      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a person is required to give help to an officer\nor authority of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory as\nmentioned in subsection 313(3), (4), (4A) or (4B).\n\n(2) The person must comply with the requirement on the basis that the\nperson neither profits from, nor bears the costs of, giving that help.\n\n(3) The person must comply with the requirement on such terms and\nconditions as are:\n\n(a) agreed between the following parties:\n\n(i) the person;\n\n(ii) the Commonwealth, the State or the Territory, as the\ncase may be; or",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if a person is required to give help to an officer\nor authority of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory as\nmentioned in subsection 313(3), (4), (4A) or (4B).\n\n(2) The person must comply with the requirement on the basis that the\nperson neither profits from, nor bears the costs of, giving that help.\n\n(3) The person must comply with the requirement on such terms and\nconditions as are:\n\n(a) agreed between the following parties:\n\n(i) the person;\n\n(ii) the Commonwealth, the State or the Territory, as the\ncase may be; or",
      "cml:hasPart": [
