        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317C Designated communications provider etc.",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Part, the following table defines:\n\n(a) designated communications provider; and\n\n(b) the eligible activities of a designated communications\nprovider.\n\nDesignated communications provider and eligible activities\nItem\nA person is a designated\ncommunications provider if ...\n... and the eligible activities of the\nperson are ...\nthe person is a carrier or carriage\nservice provider\n(a) the operation by the person of\ntelecommunications networks, or\nfacilities, in Australia; or\n(b) the supply by the person of listed\ncarriage services\nthe person is a carriage service\nintermediary who arranges for the\nsupply by a carriage service provider\nof listed carriage services\n(a) the arranging by the person for\nthe supply by the carriage service\nprovider of listed carriage\nservices; or\n(b) the operation by the carriage\nservice provider of\ntelecommunications networks, or\nfacilities, in Australia; or\n(c) the supply by the carriage service\nprovider of listed carriage\nservices\nthe person provides a service that\nfacilitates, or is ancillary or\nincidental to, the supply of a listed\ncarriage service\nthe provision by the person of a\nservice that facilitates, or is ancillary\nor incidental to, the supply of a\nlisted carriage service\nthe person provides an electronic\nservice that has one or more\nend-users in Australia\nthe provision by the person of an\nelectronic service that has one or\nmore end-users in Australia\nthe person provides a service that\nfacilitates, or is ancillary or\nthe provision by the person of a\nservice that facilitates, or is ancillary",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Part, the following table defines:\n\n(a) designated communications provider; and\n\n(b) the eligible activities of a designated communications\nprovider.\n\nDesignated communications provider and eligible activities\nItem\nA person is a designated\ncommunications provider if ...\n... and the eligible activities of the\nperson are ...\nthe person is a carrier or carriage\nservice provider\n(a) the operation by the person of\ntelecommunications networks, or\nfacilities, in Australia; or\n(b) the supply by the person of listed\ncarriage services\nthe person is a carriage service\nintermediary who arranges for the\nsupply by a carriage service provider\nof listed carriage services\n(a) the arranging by the person for\nthe supply by the carriage service\nprovider of listed carriage\nservices; or\n(b) the operation by the carriage\nservice provider of\ntelecommunications networks, or\nfacilities, in Australia; or\n(c) the supply by the carriage service\nprovider of listed carriage\nservices\nthe person provides a service that\nfacilitates, or is ancillary or\nincidental to, the supply of a listed\ncarriage service\nthe provision by the person of a\nservice that facilitates, or is ancillary\nor incidental to, the supply of a\nlisted carriage service\nthe person provides an electronic\nservice that has one or more\nend-users in Australia\nthe provision by the person of an\nelectronic service that has one or\nmore end-users in Australia\nthe person provides a service that\nfacilitates, or is ancillary or\nthe provision by the person of a\nservice that facilitates, or is ancillary",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317c-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "da615a88f64399b85c70f82357e9b846e8ecf5bf4337a00af149d0298bd01808",
      "skos:note": "Defines designated communications provider and eligible activities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317C Designated communications provider etc.",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Part, the following table defines:\n\n(a) designated communications provider; and\n\n(b) the eligible activities of a designated communications\nprovider.\n\nDesignated communications provider and eligible activities\nItem\nA person is a designated\ncommunications provider if ...\n... and the eligible activities of the\nperson are ...\nthe person is a carrier or carriage\nservice provider\n(a) the operation by the person of\ntelecommunications networks, or\nfacilities, in Australia; or\n(b) the supply by the person of listed\ncarriage services\nthe person is a carriage service\nintermediary who arranges for the\nsupply by a carriage service provider\nof listed carriage services\n(a) the arranging by the person for\nthe supply by the carriage service\nprovider of listed carriage\nservices; or\n(b) the operation by the carriage\nservice provider of\ntelecommunications networks, or\nfacilities, in Australia; or\n(c) the supply by the carriage service\nprovider of listed carriage\nservices\nthe person provides a service that\nfacilitates, or is ancillary or\nincidental to, the supply of a listed\ncarriage service\nthe provision by the person of a\nservice that facilitates, or is ancillary\nor incidental to, the supply of a\nlisted carriage service\nthe person provides an electronic\nservice that has one or more\nend-users in Australia\nthe provision by the person of an\nelectronic service that has one or\nmore end-users in Australia\nthe person provides a service that\nfacilitates, or is ancillary or\nthe provision by the person of a\nservice that facilitates, or is ancillary"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317c-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317c"
