      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A reference in this section to the use of a thing is a reference to the\nuse of the thing either:\n\n(a) in isolation; or\n\n(b) in conjunction with one or more other things.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A reference in this section to the use of a thing is a reference to the\nuse of the thing either:\n\n(a) in isolation; or\n\n(b) in conjunction with one or more other things.",
      "values:partOf": {
