    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317E Listed acts or things",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of the application of this Part to a designated\ncommunications provider, listed act or thing means:\n\n(a) removing one or more forms of electronic protection that are\nor were applied by, or on behalf of, the provider; or\n\n(b) providing technical information; or\n\n(c) installing, maintaining, testing or using software or\nequipment; or\n\n(d) ensuring that information obtained in connection with the\nexecution of a warrant or authorisation is given in a particular\nformat; or\n\n(da) an act or thing done to assist in, or facilitate:\n\n(i) giving effect to a warrant or authorisation under a law of\nthe Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(ii) the effective receipt of information in connection with a\nwarrant or authorisation under a law of the\nCommonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(e) facilitating or assisting access to whichever of the following\nare the subject of eligible activities of the provider:\n\n(i) a facility;\n\n(ii) customer equipment;\n\n(iii) a data processing device;\n\n(iv) a listed carriage service;\n\n(v) a service that facilitates, or is ancillary or incidental to,\nthe supply of a listed carriage service;",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of the application of this Part to a designated\ncommunications provider, listed act or thing means:\n\n(a) removing one or more forms of electronic protection that are\nor were applied by, or on behalf of, the provider; or\n\n(b) providing technical information; or\n\n(c) installing, maintaining, testing or using software or\nequipment; or\n\n(d) ensuring that information obtained in connection with the\nexecution of a warrant or authorisation is given in a particular\nformat; or\n\n(da) an act or thing done to assist in, or facilitate:\n\n(i) giving effect to a warrant or authorisation under a law of\nthe Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(ii) the effective receipt of information in connection with a\nwarrant or authorisation under a law of the\nCommonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(e) facilitating or assisting access to whichever of the following\nare the subject of eligible activities of the provider:\n\n(i) a facility;\n\n(ii) customer equipment;\n\n(iii) a data processing device;\n\n(iv) a listed carriage service;\n\n(v) a service that facilitates, or is ancillary or incidental to,\nthe supply of a listed carriage service;",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317e-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317e-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317e-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1221699eca793a01c62de8d30c0b86c0af5aaae79e5efba3211be146e1293626",
      "skos:note": "Listed acts or things include actions that assist in executing a warrant or authorisation, facilitating access to facilities, customer equipment, data processing devices, and listed carriage services."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317E Listed acts or things",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of the application of this Part to a designated\ncommunications provider, listed act or thing means:\n\n(a) removing one or more forms of electronic protection that are\nor were applied by, or on behalf of, the provider; or\n\n(b) providing technical information; or\n\n(c) installing, maintaining, testing or using software or\nequipment; or\n\n(d) ensuring that information obtained in connection with the\nexecution of a warrant or authorisation is given in a particular\nformat; or\n\n(da) an act or thing done to assist in, or facilitate:\n\n(i) giving effect to a warrant or authorisation under a law of\nthe Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(ii) the effective receipt of information in connection with a\nwarrant or authorisation under a law of the\nCommonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(e) facilitating or assisting access to whichever of the following\nare the subject of eligible activities of the provider:\n\n(i) a facility;\n\n(ii) customer equipment;\n\n(iii) a data processing device;\n\n(iv) a listed carriage service;\n\n(v) a service that facilitates, or is ancillary or incidental to,\nthe supply of a listed carriage service;"
    },
