      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on oral technical assistance request",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "An imminent risk of serious harm to a person or substantial damage to property exists",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Technical assistance request must be given in writing unless certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317h-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317H(3) Form of technical assistance request",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317h-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If a technical assistance request is given orally by:\n\n(a) the Director-General of Security; or\n\n(b) the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence\nService; or\n\n(c) the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate; or\n\n(d) the chief officer of an interception agency;\nthe Director-General of Security, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Secret Intelligence Service, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Signals Directorate or the chief officer, as the case\nrequires, must:\n\n(e) make a written record of the request; and\n\n(f) do so within 48 hours after the request was given.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If a technical assistance request is given orally by:\n\n(a) the Director-General of Security; or\n\n(b) the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence\nService; or\n\n(c) the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate; or\n\n(d) the chief officer of an interception agency;\nthe Director-General of Security, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Secret Intelligence Service, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Signals Directorate or the chief officer, as the case\nrequires, must:\n\n(e) make a written record of the request; and\n\n(f) do so within 48 hours after the request was given.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317h"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317h-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317h-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e9af2acc04d3a4b2c23d6526e029d568a93be4b76a6e4b43da309691e791ac3d",
      "skos:note": "Make a written record of a technical assistance request within 48 hours after it is given orally.",
      "dc:description": "Written record of the request"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317h-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317H(3) Form of technical assistance request",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If a technical assistance request is given orally by:\n\n(a) the Director-General of Security; or\n\n(b) the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence\nService; or\n\n(c) the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate; or\n\n(d) the chief officer of an interception agency;\nthe Director-General of Security, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Secret Intelligence Service, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Signals Directorate or the chief officer, as the case\nrequires, must:\n\n(e) make a written record of the request; and\n\n(f) do so within 48 hours after the request was given."
    },
