    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ha",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317HA Duration of technical assistance request",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317ha"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A technical assistance request:\n\n(a) comes in force:\n\n(i) when it is given; or\n\n(ii) if a later time is specified in the request—at that later\ntime; and\n\n(b) unless sooner revoked, remains in force:\n\n(i) if an expiry date is specified in the request—until the\nstart of the expiry date; or\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nVoluntary technical assistance  Division 2\n\nSection 317J\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) otherwise—at end of the 90-day period beginning when\nthe request was given.\n\n(2) If a technical assistance request expires, this Part does not prevent\nthe giving of a fresh technical assistance request in the same terms\nas the expired technical assistance request.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A technical assistance request:\n\n(a) comes in force:\n\n(i) when it is given; or\n\n(ii) if a later time is specified in the request—at that later\ntime; and\n\n(b) unless sooner revoked, remains in force:\n\n(i) if an expiry date is specified in the request—until the\nstart of the expiry date; or\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nVoluntary technical assistance  Division 2\n\nSection 317J\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) otherwise—at end of the 90-day period beginning when\nthe request was given.\n\n(2) If a technical assistance request expires, this Part does not prevent\nthe giving of a fresh technical assistance request in the same terms\nas the expired technical assistance request.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ha-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ha-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3206e454622014348c4c9c79e530666f798db48b435a96feab71db11acf44367"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317ha",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317HA Duration of technical assistance request",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A technical assistance request:\n\n(a) comes in force:\n\n(i) when it is given; or\n\n(ii) if a later time is specified in the request—at that later\ntime; and\n\n(b) unless sooner revoked, remains in force:\n\n(i) if an expiry date is specified in the request—until the\nstart of the expiry date; or\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nVoluntary technical assistance  Division 2\n\nSection 317J\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) otherwise—at end of the 90-day period beginning when\nthe request was given.\n\n(2) If a technical assistance request expires, this Part does not prevent\nthe giving of a fresh technical assistance request in the same terms\nas the expired technical assistance request."
    },
