    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ja-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317JA(7) Variation of technical assistance requests",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317ja-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If a variation is made orally by:\n\n(a) the Director-General of Security; or\n\n(b) the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence\nService; or\n\n(c) the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate; or\n\n(d) the chief officer of an interception agency;\nthe Director-General of Security, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Secret Intelligence Service, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Signals Directorate or the chief officer, as the case\nrequires, must:\n\n(e) make a written record of the variation; and\n\n(f) do so within 48 hours after the variation was made.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If a variation is made orally by:\n\n(a) the Director-General of Security; or\n\n(b) the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence\nService; or\n\n(c) the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate; or\n\n(d) the chief officer of an interception agency;\nthe Director-General of Security, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Secret Intelligence Service, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Signals Directorate or the chief officer, as the case\nrequires, must:\n\n(e) make a written record of the variation; and\n\n(f) do so within 48 hours after the variation was made.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ja"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ja-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ja-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2dc3de6f7d0a49cc69cea7dfcd4c081f745080ea201dcdc8ad6ecd88097772ed",
      "skos:note": "Make a written record of variation within 48 hours after oral variation made by certain officials",
      "dc:description": "Written record of variation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317ja-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317JA(7) Variation of technical assistance requests",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If a variation is made orally by:\n\n(a) the Director-General of Security; or\n\n(b) the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence\nService; or\n\n(c) the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate; or\n\n(d) the chief officer of an interception agency;\nthe Director-General of Security, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Secret Intelligence Service, the Director-General of the\nAustralian Signals Directorate or the chief officer, as the case\nrequires, must:\n\n(e) make a written record of the variation; and\n\n(f) do so within 48 hours after the variation was made."
    },
    {
