    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317n",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317N Compliance period etc.",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317n"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.79",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A technical assistance notice may require a specified act or thing to\nbe done within a specified period.\n\n(2) A technical assistance notice may require a specified act or thing to\nbe done:\n\n(a) in a specified manner; or\n\n(b) in a way that meets one or more specified conditions.\n\n(3) Subsections (1) and (2) of this section do not limit\nsubsections 317L(1) and (2).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A technical assistance notice may require a specified act or thing to\nbe done within a specified period.\n\n(2) A technical assistance notice may require a specified act or thing to\nbe done:\n\n(a) in a specified manner; or\n\n(b) in a way that meets one or more specified conditions.\n\n(3) Subsections (1) and (2) of this section do not limit\nsubsections 317L(1) and (2).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
