      "values:originalText": "The Director-General of Security or the chief officer of an\ninterception agency must not give a technical assistance notice to a\ndesignated communications provider unless the Director-General\nof Security or the chief officer, as the case requires, is satisfied\nthat:\n\n(a) the requirements imposed by the notice are reasonable and\nproportionate; and\n\n(b) compliance with the notice is:\n\n(i) practicable; and\n\n(ii) technically feasible.\nNote:\nSee also section 317RA.",
      "skos:definition": "The Director-General of Security or the chief officer of an\ninterception agency must not give a technical assistance notice to a\ndesignated communications provider unless the Director-General\nof Security or the chief officer, as the case requires, is satisfied\nthat:\n\n(a) the requirements imposed by the notice are reasonable and\nproportionate; and\n\n(b) compliance with the notice is:\n\n(i) practicable; and\n\n(ii) technically feasible.\nNote:\nSee also section 317RA.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317p-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317p-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fa480ae7766765be670c5a11f90e25899b99d7e5b691a32a70a516145c58fda9",
      "skos:note": "Cannot give technical assistance notice without reasonable and proportionate requirements"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317p",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317P Decision-making criteria",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 79,
      "values:originalText": "The Director-General of Security or the chief officer of an\ninterception agency must not give a technical assistance notice to a\ndesignated communications provider unless the Director-General\nof Security or the chief officer, as the case requires, is satisfied\nthat:\n\n(a) the requirements imposed by the notice are reasonable and\nproportionate; and\n\n(b) compliance with the notice is:\n\n(i) practicable; and\n\n(ii) technically feasible.\nNote:\nSee also section 317RA."
    },
