      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A variation must not be made orally unless:\n\n(a) an imminent risk of serious harm to a person or substantial\ndamage to property exists; and\n\n(b) the variation is necessary for the purpose of dealing with that\nrisk; and\n\n(c) it is not practicable in the circumstances to make the\nvariation in writing.\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nTechnical assistance notices  Division 3\n\nSection 317Q\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A variation must not be made orally unless:\n\n(a) an imminent risk of serious harm to a person or substantial\ndamage to property exists; and\n\n(b) the variation is necessary for the purpose of dealing with that\nrisk; and\n\n(c) it is not practicable in the circumstances to make the\nvariation in writing.\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nTechnical assistance notices  Division 3\n\nSection 317Q\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317q"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317q-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317q-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "85f9bfc7a8a1af8584022cd2ca5a5c07ceaf3658981c3107b5b2756c7e0c2308",
      "skos:note": "Variation of technical assistance notices must not be made orally unless certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317q-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317Q(4) Variation of technical assistance notices",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A variation must not be made orally unless:\n\n(a) an imminent risk of serious harm to a person or substantial\ndamage to property exists; and\n\n(b) the variation is necessary for the purpose of dealing with that\nrisk; and\n\n(c) it is not practicable in the circumstances to make the\nvariation in writing.\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nTechnical assistance notices  Division 3\n\nSection 317Q\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
