      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) If a technical assistance notice has been given to a person by the chief officer of an interception agency, and the chief officer is satisfied that: (a) the requirements imposed by the notice are not reasonable and proportionate; or (b) compliance with the notice is not: (i) practicable; and (ii) technically feasible;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(the reasoning applied to determine revocation)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317r-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317R(5) Revocation of technical assistance notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317r-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.83",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the Director-General of Security revokes a technical assistance\nnotice, the Director-General of Security must, within 7 days after\nrevoking the notice, notify the Inspector-General of Intelligence\nand Security that the notice has been revoked.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the Director-General of Security revokes a technical assistance\nnotice, the Director-General of Security must, within 7 days after\nrevoking the notice, notify the Inspector-General of Intelligence\nand Security that the notice has been revoked.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317r"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317r-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317r-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "06e769673f8d1b411b6c8edcd8def7831d3f15ee796b572f86560a5636577b51",
      "skos:note": "Notification requirement after revocation of technical assistance notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317r-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317R(5) Revocation of technical assistance notices",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 83,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the Director-General of Security revokes a technical assistance\nnotice, the Director-General of Security must, within 7 days after\nrevoking the notice, notify the Inspector-General of Intelligence\nand Security that the notice has been revoked."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317r-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317r-ss-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
