      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.86",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this section, relevant objective means:\n\n(a) enforcing the criminal law, so far as it relates to serious\nAustralian offences; or\n\n(b) assisting the enforcement of the criminal laws in force in a\nforeign country, so far as those laws relate to serious foreign\noffences; or\n\n(c) safeguarding national security.\nListed help",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of this section, relevant objective means:\n\n(a) enforcing the criminal law, so far as it relates to serious\nAustralian offences; or\n\n(b) assisting the enforcement of the criminal laws in force in a\nforeign country, so far as those laws relate to serious foreign\noffences; or\n\n(c) safeguarding national security.\nListed help",
