    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317t-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317T(4) Technical capability notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317t-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.86",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of the application of this section to a designated\ncommunications provider, if one or more acts or things done by the\nprovider:\n\n(a) are by way of giving help to ASIO or an interception agency;\nand\n\n(b) are in connection with any or all of the eligible activities of\nthe provider; and",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of the application of this section to a designated\ncommunications provider, if one or more acts or things done by the\nprovider:\n\n(a) are by way of giving help to ASIO or an interception agency;\nand\n\n(b) are in connection with any or all of the eligible activities of\nthe provider; and",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317t"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317t-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317t-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a4173ff156d5052d0b6c38e05fd3a3741d77a6b53fe93d76d2c831a21effc75f",
      "skos:note": "Designated communications provider must provide help to ASIO or interception agency in connection with eligible activities.",
      "dc:description": "True"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317t-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317T(4) Technical capability notices",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 86,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of the application of this section to a designated\ncommunications provider, if one or more acts or things done by the\nprovider:\n\n(a) are by way of giving help to ASIO or an interception agency;\nand\n\n(b) are in connection with any or all of the eligible activities of\nthe provider; and"
    },
