        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "949eb982b400d56284b5eae0d0ed552ebce07d0f4ab729dcb7876cc44eef58ea",
      "skos:note": "Consultation before giving a technical capability notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317w-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317W(8) Consultation about a proposal to give a technical capability",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 94,
      "values:originalText": "(8) Before giving a designated communications provider a technical\ncapability notice that satisfies the following conditions:\n\n(a) the requirements imposed by the technical capability notice\nare the same, or substantially the same, as the requirements\nimposed by another technical capability notice that has\npreviously been given to the provider;\n\n(b) the first-mentioned technical capability notice is to come into\nforce immediately after the expiry of the other technical\ncapability notice;\nthe Attorney-General must consult the provider."
    },
