      "skos:note": "Request for assessment of proposed technical capability notice",
      "dc:description": "written notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317wa-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317WA(1) Assessment and report",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a consultation notice is given to a designated communications\nprovider under subsection 317W(1) in relation to a proposed\ntechnical capability notice, the provider may, within the time limit\nspecified in the consultation notice, give the Attorney-General a\nwritten notice requesting the carrying out of an assessment of\nwhether the proposed technical capability notice should be given.\nAttorney-General must appoint assessors"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-1-norm",
