    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317WA(5) Assessment and report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317wa-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(5) One of the assessors must be a person who:\n\n(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a\nperiod of 5 years; and\n\n(b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed\ncourt.\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nTechnical capability notices  Division 4\n\nSection 317WA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nAssessment and report by assessors",
      "skos:definition": "(5) One of the assessors must be a person who:\n\n(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a\nperiod of 5 years; and\n\n(b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed\ncourt.\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nTechnical capability notices  Division 4\n\nSection 317WA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nAssessment and report by assessors",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6a5dabf6da3bb197154e8b045943c78bd13f676153a0914d7f2e6d76af84b5e9",
      "skos:note": "One of the assessors must be a person who has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of 5 years and no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed court."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317wa-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317WA(5) Assessment and report",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(5) One of the assessors must be a person who:\n\n(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a\nperiod of 5 years; and\n\n(b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed\ncourt.\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nTechnical capability notices  Division 4\n\nSection 317WA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nAssessment and report by assessors"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must be a person who has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of 5 years and no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed court.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of 5 years; and (b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed court.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(5) One of the assessors must be a person who:\n\n(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a\nperiod of 5 years; and\n\n(b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed\ncourt."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "BETWEEN",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The period of service must be between 5 years and the current time.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of 5 years; and (b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed court.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person who is an assessor must have served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of time between 5 years and the current time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "RECURSIVE",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The condition must be met at each assessment.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of 5 years; and (b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed court.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person who is an assessor must meet the condition that they have served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of time between 5 years and the current time at each assessment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-5-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST_NOT",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must not hold a commission as a judge of a prescribed court.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of 5 years; and (b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed court.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(5) One of the assessors must be a person who:\n\n(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a\nperiod of 5 years; and\n\n(b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed\ncourt."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317WA(6) Assessment and report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317wa-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(6) As soon as practicable after being appointed under subsection (2),\nthe assessors must:\n\n(a) carry out an assessment of whether the proposed technical\ncapability notice should be given; and\n\n(b) prepare a report of the assessment; and\n\n(c) give a copy of the report to:\n\n(i) the Attorney-General; and\n\n(ii) the designated communications provider concerned; and\n\n(d) if the acts or things specified in the proposed technical\ncapability notice:\n\n(i) are directed towards ensuring that the designated\ncommunications provider is capable of giving listed\nhelp (within the meaning of section 317T) to ASIO in\nrelation to a matter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(a); or\n\n(ii) are by way of giving help to ASIO in relation to a\nmatter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(b);\n\ngive a copy of the report to the Inspector-General of\nIntelligence and Security; and\n\n(e) if the acts or things specified in the proposed technical\ncapability notice:\n\n(i) are directed towards ensuring that the designated\ncommunications provider is capable of giving listed\nhelp (within the meaning of section 317T) to an\ninterception agency in relation to a matter covered by\nparagraph 317T(2)(a); or\n\n(ii) are by way of giving help to an interception agency in\nrelation to a matter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(b);\n\ngive a copy of the report to:\n\n(iii) if the interception agency is the Australian Crime\nCommission—the Inspector-General of Intelligence and\nSecurity; and\n\n(iv) otherwise—the Commonwealth Ombudsman.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) As soon as practicable after being appointed under subsection (2),\nthe assessors must:\n\n(a) carry out an assessment of whether the proposed technical\ncapability notice should be given; and\n\n(b) prepare a report of the assessment; and\n\n(c) give a copy of the report to:\n\n(i) the Attorney-General; and\n\n(ii) the designated communications provider concerned; and\n\n(d) if the acts or things specified in the proposed technical\ncapability notice:\n\n(i) are directed towards ensuring that the designated\ncommunications provider is capable of giving listed\nhelp (within the meaning of section 317T) to ASIO in\nrelation to a matter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(a); or\n\n(ii) are by way of giving help to ASIO in relation to a\nmatter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(b);\n\ngive a copy of the report to the Inspector-General of\nIntelligence and Security; and\n\n(e) if the acts or things specified in the proposed technical\ncapability notice:\n\n(i) are directed towards ensuring that the designated\ncommunications provider is capable of giving listed\nhelp (within the meaning of section 317T) to an\ninterception agency in relation to a matter covered by\nparagraph 317T(2)(a); or\n\n(ii) are by way of giving help to an interception agency in\nrelation to a matter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(b);\n\ngive a copy of the report to:\n\n(iii) if the interception agency is the Australian Crime\nCommission—the Inspector-General of Intelligence and\nSecurity; and\n\n(iv) otherwise—the Commonwealth Ombudsman.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317wa-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f6559f7f39ee95598dd146be5f917dd14473ce4795ed7e668e287c4e9e8ebbf0",
      "skos:note": "Must provide reports to specified parties after assessment",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317wa-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317WA(6) Assessment and report",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(6) As soon as practicable after being appointed under subsection (2),\nthe assessors must:\n\n(a) carry out an assessment of whether the proposed technical\ncapability notice should be given; and\n\n(b) prepare a report of the assessment; and\n\n(c) give a copy of the report to:\n\n(i) the Attorney-General; and\n\n(ii) the designated communications provider concerned; and\n\n(d) if the acts or things specified in the proposed technical\ncapability notice:\n\n(i) are directed towards ensuring that the designated\ncommunications provider is capable of giving listed\nhelp (within the meaning of section 317T) to ASIO in\nrelation to a matter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(a); or\n\n(ii) are by way of giving help to ASIO in relation to a\nmatter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(b);\n\ngive a copy of the report to the Inspector-General of\nIntelligence and Security; and\n\n(e) if the acts or things specified in the proposed technical\ncapability notice:\n\n(i) are directed towards ensuring that the designated\ncommunications provider is capable of giving listed\nhelp (within the meaning of section 317T) to an\ninterception agency in relation to a matter covered by\nparagraph 317T(2)(a); or\n\n(ii) are by way of giving help to an interception agency in\nrelation to a matter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(b);\n\ngive a copy of the report to:\n\n(iii) if the interception agency is the Australian Crime\nCommission—the Inspector-General of Intelligence and\nSecurity; and\n\n(iv) otherwise—the Commonwealth Ombudsman."
    },
    {
