          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c4f6e56a092d6546cebde203b51aae3b8981f0217cd586458b37cf5915ac63dd",
      "skos:note": "Listed acts or things must be in connection with eligible activities and covered by subsection 317T(2)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317x-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317X(3) Variation of technical capability notices",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 100,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The acts or things specified in a varied technical capability notice\nin accordance with paragraph 317T(2)(b) must be listed acts or\nthings, so long as those acts or things:\n\n(a) are in connection with any or all of the eligible activities of\nthe designated communications provider concerned; and\n\n(b) are covered by subsection 317T(2), so far as that subsection\nrelates to paragraph 317T(2)(b).\nNote:\nFor listed acts or things, see section 317E.\nDecision-making criteria"
    },
