    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317X(4) Variation of technical capability notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317x-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.100",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Attorney-General must not vary a technical capability notice\nunless the Attorney-General is satisfied that:\n\n(a) the requirements imposed by the varied notice are reasonable\nand proportionate; and\n\n(b) compliance with the varied notice is:\n\n(i) practicable; and\n\n(ii) technically feasible.\nNote:\nSee also section 317ZAA.\nVariation must not extend duration of technical capability notice",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Attorney-General must not vary a technical capability notice\nunless the Attorney-General is satisfied that:\n\n(a) the requirements imposed by the varied notice are reasonable\nand proportionate; and\n\n(b) compliance with the varied notice is:\n\n(i) practicable; and\n\n(ii) technically feasible.\nNote:\nSee also section 317ZAA.\nVariation must not extend duration of technical capability notice",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x-ss-4-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1b29386a5c735fa984950474e6a99bf82f0e81f4272e710d741b3f75ed182eda",
      "skos:note": "The Attorney-General must not vary a technical capability notice unless certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
