    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317X(6) Variation of technical capability notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317x-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.100",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) the Attorney-General varies a technical capability notice; and\n\n(b) the acts or things specified in the varied notice:\n\n(i) are directed towards ensuring that a designated\ncommunications provider is capable of giving listed\nhelp (within the meaning of section 317T) to ASIO in\nrelation to a matter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(a); or\n\n(ii) are by way of giving help to ASIO in relation to a\nmatter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(b);",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If:\n\n(a) the Attorney-General varies a technical capability notice; and\n\n(b) the acts or things specified in the varied notice:\n\n(i) are directed towards ensuring that a designated\ncommunications provider is capable of giving listed\nhelp (within the meaning of section 317T) to ASIO in\nrelation to a matter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(a); or\n\n(ii) are by way of giving help to ASIO in relation to a\nmatter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(b);",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "53dbd3542118bf9dbde040d7474839365710dc56d0b33d9d5f6be6f25d293456",
      "skos:note": "Variation of technical capability notices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317x-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317X(6) Variation of technical capability notices",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 100,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) the Attorney-General varies a technical capability notice; and\n\n(b) the acts or things specified in the varied notice:\n\n(i) are directed towards ensuring that a designated\ncommunications provider is capable of giving listed\nhelp (within the meaning of section 317T) to ASIO in\nrelation to a matter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(a); or\n\n(ii) are by way of giving help to ASIO in relation to a\nmatter covered by paragraph 317T(2)(b);"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317x-ss-6-norm",
