    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317xa-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317XA(6) Approval of variation of technical capability notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317xa-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(6) In considering whether to approve the variation of the technical\ncapability notice, the Minister must have regard to the following\nmatters:\n\n(a) the objectives of the notice as proposed to be varied;\n\n(b) the legitimate interests of the designated communications\nprovider to whom the notice relates;\n\n(c) the impact of the notice as proposed to be varied on the\nefficiency and international competitiveness of the Australian\ntelecommunications industry;\n\n(d) the representation (if any) that was made under\nsubsection (4);\n\n(e) such other matters (if any) as the Minister considers relevant.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) In considering whether to approve the variation of the technical\ncapability notice, the Minister must have regard to the following\nmatters:\n\n(a) the objectives of the notice as proposed to be varied;\n\n(b) the legitimate interests of the designated communications\nprovider to whom the notice relates;\n\n(c) the impact of the notice as proposed to be varied on the\nefficiency and international competitiveness of the Australian\ntelecommunications industry;\n\n(d) the representation (if any) that was made under\nsubsection (4);\n\n(e) such other matters (if any) as the Minister considers relevant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317xa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317xa-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317xa-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317xa-ss-6-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317xa-ss-6-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317xa-ss-6-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317xa-ss-6-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f70daa6ffe51b6bc478497f2039ae9795f805ea75c49fccf6ff9b063b338883e",
      "skos:note": "Consideration of factors when approving variation of technical capability notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317xa-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317XA(6) Approval of variation of technical capability notice",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 102,
      "values:originalText": "(6) In considering whether to approve the variation of the technical\ncapability notice, the Minister must have regard to the following\nmatters:\n\n(a) the objectives of the notice as proposed to be varied;\n\n(b) the legitimate interests of the designated communications\nprovider to whom the notice relates;\n\n(c) the impact of the notice as proposed to be varied on the\nefficiency and international competitiveness of the Australian\ntelecommunications industry;\n\n(d) the representation (if any) that was made under\nsubsection (4);\n\n(e) such other matters (if any) as the Minister considers relevant."
    },
