    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317y-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317Y(6) Consultation about a proposal to vary a technical capability",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317y-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If, under subsection (5), a designated communications provider\nmakes a written record of the waiver, the provider must:\n\n(a) give a copy of the record to the Attorney-General; and\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nTechnical capability notices  Division 4\n\nSection 317YA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) do so as soon as practicable after the record was made.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If, under subsection (5), a designated communications provider\nmakes a written record of the waiver, the provider must:\n\n(a) give a copy of the record to the Attorney-General; and\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nTechnical capability notices  Division 4\n\nSection 317YA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) do so as soon as practicable after the record was made.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317y"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
