        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2bbf5946f0aca347402608a017850261f2a4dbee28f0be4553dcdfa101bafa9b",
      "skos:note": "Must provide a copy of the record to the Attorney-General as soon as practicable after it was made.",
      "dc:description": "yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317y-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317Y(6) Consultation about a proposal to vary a technical capability",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 104,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If, under subsection (5), a designated communications provider\nmakes a written record of the waiver, the provider must:\n\n(a) give a copy of the record to the Attorney-General; and\n\n\nIndustry assistance  Part 15\nTechnical capability notices  Division 4\n\nSection 317YA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) do so as soon as practicable after the record was made."
    },
    {
