    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ya-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317YA(4) Assessment and report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317ya-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.105",
      "values:originalText": "(4) One of the assessors must be a person who:\n\n(a) has knowledge that would enable the person to assess\nwhether proposed technical capability notices would\ncontravene section 317ZG; and\n\n(b) is cleared for security purposes to:\n\n(i) the highest level required by staff members of ASIO; or\n\n(ii) such lower level as the Attorney-General approves.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) One of the assessors must be a person who:\n\n(a) has knowledge that would enable the person to assess\nwhether proposed technical capability notices would\ncontravene section 317ZG; and\n\n(b) is cleared for security purposes to:\n\n(i) the highest level required by staff members of ASIO; or\n\n(ii) such lower level as the Attorney-General approves.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ya"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ya-ss-4-norm"
        },
