      "cml:integrityHash": "fe3ecd82e205465d311561dc106c7db09f90648f3f2b72527e320b39e34b36c2",
      "skos:note": "Compliance with foreign country requirements is a defence in proceedings for a civil penalty order."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zb-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317ZB(5) Compliance with notices—designated communications",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 112,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In proceedings for a civil penalty order against a designated\ncommunications provider for a contravention of subsection (1) in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) a requirement under a technical assistance notice to do an act\nor thing in a foreign country; or\n\n(b) a requirement under a technical capability notice to do an act\nor thing in a foreign country;\nit is a defence if the provider proves that compliance with the\nrequirement in the foreign country would contravene a law of the\nforeign country."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zb-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zb-ss-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zb-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "exemption",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exemptions from obligations",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Compliance with foreign country requirements is a defence.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The obligation to comply does not apply."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zc",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317ZC Civil penalty provision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zc"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.113",
      "values:originalText": "Enforceable civil penalty provision\n\n(1) Section 317ZB of this Act is enforceable under Part 4 of the\nRegulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014.\nNote:\nPart 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014\nallows a civil penalty provision to be enforced by obtaining an order\nfor a person to pay a pecuniary penalty for the contravention of the\nprovision.",
      "skos:definition": "Enforceable civil penalty provision\n\n(1) Section 317ZB of this Act is enforceable under Part 4 of the\nRegulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014.\nNote:\nPart 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014\nallows a civil penalty provision to be enforced by obtaining an order\nfor a person to pay a pecuniary penalty for the contravention of the\nprovision.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zc-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zc-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4b825188b0e4126ee36e98274e77dc3ee6a73030763734a537d90180599d56da",
      "skos:note": "Enforces civil penalty provision under Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zc",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317ZC Civil penalty provision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 113,
      "values:originalText": "Enforceable civil penalty provision\n\n(1) Section 317ZB of this Act is enforceable under Part 4 of the\nRegulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014.\nNote:\nPart 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014\nallows a civil penalty provision to be enforced by obtaining an order\nfor a person to pay a pecuniary penalty for the contravention of the\nprovision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zc-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
