      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 128,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A technical assistance request, technical assistance notice or\ntechnical capability notice must not have the effect of:\n\n(a) requesting or requiring a designated communications\nprovider to implement or build a systemic weakness, or a\nsystemic vulnerability, into a form of electronic protection;\nor\n\n(b) preventing a designated communications provider from\nrectifying a systemic weakness, or a systemic vulnerability,\nin a form of electronic protection."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-1"
