    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-4c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317ZG(4C) Designated communications provider must not be requested",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zg-ss-4c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.128",
      "values:originalText": "(4C) For the purposes of subsections (4A) and (4B), an act or thing will,\nor is likely to, jeopardise the security of information if the act or\nthing creates a material risk that otherwise secure information can\nbe accessed by an unauthorised third party.",
      "skos:definition": "(4C) For the purposes of subsections (4A) and (4B), an act or thing will,\nor is likely to, jeopardise the security of information if the act or\nthing creates a material risk that otherwise secure information can\nbe accessed by an unauthorised third party.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-4c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-4c-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "246124be2d8dd0f47ccf428dfcd1768f4fcb9e6060e877a15d5e7b199b2e8c6a",
      "skos:note": "Must not create a material risk that otherwise secure information can be accessed by an unauthorised third party."
    },
    {
