    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317ZG(1) Designated communications provider must not be requested",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zg-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.128",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a designated communications provider supplies a particular\nkind of telecommunications service; and\n\n(b) the service involves, or will involve, the use of a\ntelecommunications system;\na technical capability notice has no effect to the extent (if any) to\nwhich it requires the provider to ensure that the kind of service, or\nthe system:\n\n(c) has the capability to enable a communication passing over\nthe system to be intercepted in accordance with an\ninterception warrant; or\n\n(d) has the capability to transmit lawfully intercepted\ninformation to the delivery points applicable in respect of\nthat kind of service; or\n\n(e) has a delivery capability.\nNote 1:",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a designated communications provider supplies a particular\nkind of telecommunications service; and\n\n(b) the service involves, or will involve, the use of a\ntelecommunications system;\na technical capability notice has no effect to the extent (if any) to\nwhich it requires the provider to ensure that the kind of service, or\nthe system:\n\n(c) has the capability to enable a communication passing over\nthe system to be intercepted in accordance with an\ninterception warrant; or\n\n(d) has the capability to transmit lawfully intercepted\ninformation to the delivery points applicable in respect of\nthat kind of service; or\n\n(e) has a delivery capability.\nNote 1:",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-1-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-1-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "66d2c6707b0ec3c52effeae72eb31fd83248021818a0bd0b7e6f66eedc7d4ed0",
      "skos:note": "Designated communications provider must not be requested for certain services. Designated communications provider must not be requested to implement or build a systemic weakness."
    },
    {
