      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(g) a law of a State or Territory"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317ZH(2) General limits on technical assistance requests, technical",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zh-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.130",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1):\n\n(a) assume that each law mentioned in that subsection applied\nboth within and outside Australia; and\n\n(b) assume that each reference in Part 13 to a carriage service\nprovider included a reference to a designated\ncommunications provider.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1):\n\n(a) assume that each law mentioned in that subsection applied\nboth within and outside Australia; and\n\n(b) assume that each reference in Part 13 to a carriage service\nprovider included a reference to a designated\ncommunications provider.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-2-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7fd5d6868d22efa8c8c3eb44751ac7f2d8148e9a6b3a0b3d09a4ff7963e07c1b",
      "skos:note": "Assume laws apply both within and outside Australia, and assume references to carriage service providers include designated communications providers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zh-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317ZH(2) General limits on technical assistance requests, technical",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 130,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1):\n\n(a) assume that each law mentioned in that subsection applied\nboth within and outside Australia; and\n\n(b) assume that each reference in Part 13 to a carriage service\nprovider included a reference to a designated\ncommunications provider."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal interval relation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Assume each reference in Part 13 to a carriage service provider includes a reference to a designated communications provider.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The assumption applies to all references."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-2-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Assume laws apply both within and outside Australia.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A duty is imposed on the State."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317ZH(3) General limits on technical assistance requests, technical",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zh-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.130",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A technical assistance request, technical assistance notice or\ntechnical capability notice has no effect to the extent (if any) to\nwhich it would request or require a designated communications\nprovider to:\n\n(a) use a surveillance device (within the meaning of the\nSurveillance Devices Act 2004); or\n\n(b) access data held in a computer (within the meaning of the\nSurveillance Devices Act 2004);\nif a law of a State or Territory requires a warrant or authorisation\nfor that use or access.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A technical assistance request, technical assistance notice or\ntechnical capability notice has no effect to the extent (if any) to\nwhich it would request or require a designated communications\nprovider to:\n\n(a) use a surveillance device (within the meaning of the\nSurveillance Devices Act 2004); or\n\n(b) access data held in a computer (within the meaning of the\nSurveillance Devices Act 2004);\nif a law of a State or Territory requires a warrant or authorisation\nfor that use or access.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b082f4d90874821ff5d9b7535b640093ec6ef8bd2782ae1f59335e7aadd9dd48",
      "skos:note": "No effect if a warrant or authorisation is required"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zh-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317ZH(3) General limits on technical assistance requests, technical",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 130,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A technical assistance request, technical assistance notice or\ntechnical capability notice has no effect to the extent (if any) to\nwhich it would request or require a designated communications\nprovider to:\n\n(a) use a surveillance device (within the meaning of the\nSurveillance Devices Act 2004); or\n\n(b) access data held in a computer (within the meaning of the\nSurveillance Devices Act 2004);\nif a law of a State or Territory requires a warrant or authorisation\nfor that use or access."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits use of surveillance devices or accessing data without warrant/authorisation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317ZH(4) General limits on technical assistance requests, technical",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zh-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.130",
      "values:originalText": "(4) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) or (3) does not prevent a technical\nassistance request, technical assistance notice or technical\ncapability notice from requesting or requiring a designated\ncommunications provider to do an act or thing by way of giving\nhelp to:\n\n(a) ASIO; or",
      "skos:definition": "(4) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) or (3) does not prevent a technical\nassistance request, technical assistance notice or technical\ncapability notice from requesting or requiring a designated\ncommunications provider to do an act or thing by way of giving\nhelp to:\n\n(a) ASIO; or",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d4cde104c8ef7d17411d348a7ba1204cef8a3d11599c6e02d9e82130f6bc0587",
      "skos:note": "Requesting a designated communications provider to do an act or thing for ASIO."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zh-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317ZH(4) General limits on technical assistance requests, technical",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 130,
      "values:originalText": "(4) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) or (3) does not prevent a technical\nassistance request, technical assistance notice or technical\ncapability notice from requesting or requiring a designated\ncommunications provider to do an act or thing by way of giving\nhelp to:\n\n(a) ASIO; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
