      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.135",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A designated communications provider is not subject to any civil\nliability for, or in relation to, an act or thing done by the provider:\n\n(a) in compliance; or\n\n(b) in good faith in purported compliance;\nwith:\n\n(c) a technical assistance notice; or\n\n(d) a technical capability notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A designated communications provider is not subject to any civil\nliability for, or in relation to, an act or thing done by the provider:\n\n(a) in compliance; or\n\n(b) in good faith in purported compliance;\nwith:\n\n(c) a technical assistance notice; or\n\n(d) a technical capability notice.",
