    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zj-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "317ZJ(3) Immunity",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zj-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.135",
      "values:originalText": "(3) An officer, employee or agent of a designated communications\nprovider is not subject to any civil liability for, or in relation to, an\nact or thing done by the officer, employee or agent in connection\nwith an act or thing done by the provider:\n\n(a) in compliance; or\n\n(b) in good faith in purported compliance;\nwith:\n\n(c) a technical assistance notice; or\n\n(d) a technical capability notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An officer, employee or agent of a designated communications\nprovider is not subject to any civil liability for, or in relation to, an\nact or thing done by the officer, employee or agent in connection\nwith an act or thing done by the provider:\n\n(a) in compliance; or\n\n(b) in good faith in purported compliance;\nwith:\n\n(c) a technical assistance notice; or\n\n(d) a technical capability notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zj"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zj-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zj-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d5e4eadb90df61b9d16be7d414e769a31e600c3aa329365ebda4df3d79549e05",
      "skos:note": "Protection of communications provider employees from civil liability for actions taken in compliance with technical assistance or capability notices."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-317zj-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "317ZJ(3) Immunity",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 135,
      "values:originalText": "(3) An officer, employee or agent of a designated communications\nprovider is not subject to any civil liability for, or in relation to, an\nact or thing done by the officer, employee or agent in connection\nwith an act or thing done by the provider:\n\n(a) in compliance; or\n\n(b) in good faith in purported compliance;\nwith:\n\n(c) a technical assistance notice; or\n\n(d) a technical capability notice."
    },
