      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.156",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Without limiting its effect apart from this section, this Part also has\neffect as provided by this section.\n\n(2) This Part also has the effect it would have if each reference in this\nPart to a designated communications provider were, by express\nprovision, confined to a designated communications provider that\nis a constitutional corporation.\n\n\nDefence requirements and disaster plans  Part 16\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nSection 333\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Without limiting its effect apart from this section, this Part also has\neffect as provided by this section.\n\n(2) This Part also has the effect it would have if each reference in this\nPart to a designated communications provider were, by express\nprovision, confined to a designated communications provider that\nis a constitutional corporation.\n\n\nDefence requirements and disaster plans  Part 16\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nSection 333\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
