      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.156",
      "values:originalText": "(2) This Part also has the effect it would have if each reference in this\nPart to a designated communications provider were, by express\nprovision, confined to a designated communications provider that\nis a constitutional corporation.\n\n\nDefence requirements and disaster plans  Part 16\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nSection 333\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) This Part also has the effect it would have if each reference in this\nPart to a designated communications provider were, by express\nprovision, confined to a designated communications provider that\nis a constitutional corporation.\n\n\nDefence requirements and disaster plans  Part 16\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nSection 333\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
