      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.158",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to the\nconduct of an arbitration under this section.\n\n\nDefence requirements and disaster plans  Part 16\nSupply of carriage services  Division 2\n\nSection 335\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
