    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-335-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "335(6) Requirement to supply carriage services for defence purposes or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-335-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.158",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-335"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-335-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9cfc8f9fb3ac19645663a7056097417518e123ed34838ddb9907d93bcd30cfe9",
      "skos:note": "The ACCC may be constituted by a single member or specified number of members for arbitration purposes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-335-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "335(6) Requirement to supply carriage services for defence purposes or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 158,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC."
    },
