    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-339",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "339 Requirement to enter into certified agreement",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-339"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.162",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if the ACMA has certified a draft agreement\nrelating to a carrier or carriage service provider.\n\n(2) A defence authority may give:\n\n(a) the carrier; or\n\n(b) the carriage service provider;\nas the case requires, a written notice requiring the carrier or\nprovider to enter into the agreement within 30 days after receiving\nthe notice.\n\n(3) The carrier or provider must comply with the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if the ACMA has certified a draft agreement\nrelating to a carrier or carriage service provider.\n\n(2) A defence authority may give:\n\n(a) the carrier; or\n\n(b) the carriage service provider;\nas the case requires, a written notice requiring the carrier or\nprovider to enter into the agreement within 30 days after receiving\nthe notice.\n\n(3) The carrier or provider must comply with the notice.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-339-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-339-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-339-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "21cbc135c154170eac28d496581355d3024ba93e3041118fe8ae0ab4a69c8d5e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-339",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "339 Requirement to enter into certified agreement",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 162,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if the ACMA has certified a draft agreement\nrelating to a carrier or carriage service provider.\n\n(2) A defence authority may give:\n\n(a) the carrier; or\n\n(b) the carriage service provider;\nas the case requires, a written notice requiring the carrier or\nprovider to enter into the agreement within 30 days after receiving\nthe notice.\n\n(3) The carrier or provider must comply with the notice."
    },
