      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.165",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An instrument under section 63 imposing conditions on a carrier\nlicence held by a carrier may make provision for and in relation to\ncompliance by the carrier with one or more specified designated\ndisaster plans.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit section 63.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An instrument under section 63 imposing conditions on a carrier\nlicence held by a carrier may make provision for and in relation to\ncompliance by the carrier with one or more specified designated\ndisaster plans.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit section 63.",
