      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) An officer, employee or agent of a carrier or of a carriage service provider is not liable to an action or other proceeding for damages for or in relation to an act done or omitted in good faith.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The diffusion of liability applies to other parties"
    },
    {
