      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.167",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In this section:\nsenior rank means a rank not lower than:\n\n(a) in the case of the Royal Australian Navy—the rank of\nCommodore; or\n\n(b) in the case of the Australian Army—the rank of Brigadier; or\n\n(c) in the case of the Royal Australian Air Force—the rank of\nAir Commodore.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In this section:\nsenior rank means a rank not lower than:\n\n(a) in the case of the Royal Australian Navy—the rank of\nCommodore; or\n\n(b) in the case of the Australian Army—the rank of Brigadier; or\n\n(c) in the case of the Royal Australian Air Force—the rank of\nAir Commodore.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-347"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
