    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-348",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "348 Simplified outline",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-348"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nThe ACMA may require certain carriers and carriage service\nproviders to provide pre-selection in favour of carriage service\nproviders in relation to calls made using a standard telephone\nservice.\n•\nThe ACMA must require certain carriers and carriage service\nproviders to provide pre-selection in favour of carriage service\nproviders in relation to calls made using a declared carriage\nservice.\n•\nPre-selection must include over-ride dial codes for selecting\nalternative carriage service providers on a call-by-call basis.",
      "skos:definition": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nThe ACMA may require certain carriers and carriage service\nproviders to provide pre-selection in favour of carriage service\nproviders in relation to calls made using a standard telephone\nservice.\n•\nThe ACMA must require certain carriers and carriage service\nproviders to provide pre-selection in favour of carriage service\nproviders in relation to calls made using a declared carriage\nservice.\n•\nPre-selection must include over-ride dial codes for selecting\nalternative carriage service providers on a call-by-call basis.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-348-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-348-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0011fc1a1631d7a2257a571170e1adbfa5a3b16ee7c65837c4dbd35cffa847b7",
      "skos:note": "Must provide pre-selection in favour of carriage service providers",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-348",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "348 Simplified outline",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nThe ACMA may require certain carriers and carriage service\nproviders to provide pre-selection in favour of carriage service\nproviders in relation to calls made using a standard telephone\nservice.\n•\nThe ACMA must require certain carriers and carriage service\nproviders to provide pre-selection in favour of carriage service\nproviders in relation to calls made using a declared carriage\nservice.\n•\nPre-selection must include over-ride dial codes for selecting\nalternative carriage service providers on a call-by-call basis."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-348-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-348"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-348-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide pre-selection",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "349 Requirement to provide pre-selection",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-349"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACMA may make a written determination requiring each\ncarrier or carriage service provider who supplies an eligible\nstandard telephone service to:\n\n(a) provide pre-selection in favour of a specified carriage service\nprovider, in relation to calls made using an eligible standard\ntelephone service, in the manner specified in the\ndetermination; and\n\n(b) comply with such ancillary or incidental rules (if any) as are\nset out in the determination.\n\n(2) The ACMA must make a written determination requiring each\ncarrier or carriage service provider who supplies a specified\ndeclared carriage service to:\n\n\nPre-selection in favour of carriage service providers  Part 17\n\nSection 349\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) provide pre-selection in favour of a specified carriage service\nprovider, in relation to calls made using the carriage service,\nin the manner specified in the determination; and\n\n(b) comply with such ancillary or incidental rules (if any) as are\nset out in the determination.\nNote:\nDeclared carriage service is defined by section 350A.\n\n(3) In making a determination under subsection (1) or (2), the ACMA\nmust have regard to:\n\n(a) the technical feasibility of complying with the requirement\nconcerned; and\n\n(b) the costs and benefits of complying with the requirement\nconcerned.\n\n(4) Subsection (3) does not, by implication, limit the matters to which\nregard may be had.\n\n(5) A reference in this section to a standard telephone service does not\ninclude a reference to a service that is supplied by means of a\npublic mobile telecommunications service.\n\n(5A) A reference in this section to a standard telephone service does not\ninclude a reference to a service that:\n\n(a) is supplied using:\n\n(i) a designated radiocommunications facility owned or\noperated by a carrier or carriage service provider; and\n\n(ii) a line that runs directly between the facility and the\npremises occupied or used by an end-user; and\n\n(b) if an instrument is in force under subsection (5B)—satisfies\nthe conditions set out in the instrument.\n\n(5B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, set out conditions for\nthe purposes of paragraph (5A)(b).\n\n(6) Before making a determination under this section, the ACMA must\nconsult the ACCC.\n\n(7) In making a determination under this section, the ACMA may\napply, adopt or incorporate (with or without modification) any",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The ACMA may make a written determination requiring each\ncarrier or carriage service provider who supplies an eligible\nstandard telephone service to:\n\n(a) provide pre-selection in favour of a specified carriage service\nprovider, in relation to calls made using an eligible standard\ntelephone service, in the manner specified in the\ndetermination; and\n\n(b) comply with such ancillary or incidental rules (if any) as are\nset out in the determination.\n\n(2) The ACMA must make a written determination requiring each\ncarrier or carriage service provider who supplies a specified\ndeclared carriage service to:\n\n\nPre-selection in favour of carriage service providers  Part 17\n\nSection 349\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) provide pre-selection in favour of a specified carriage service\nprovider, in relation to calls made using the carriage service,\nin the manner specified in the determination; and\n\n(b) comply with such ancillary or incidental rules (if any) as are\nset out in the determination.\nNote:\nDeclared carriage service is defined by section 350A.\n\n(3) In making a determination under subsection (1) or (2), the ACMA\nmust have regard to:\n\n(a) the technical feasibility of complying with the requirement\nconcerned; and\n\n(b) the costs and benefits of complying with the requirement\nconcerned.\n\n(4) Subsection (3) does not, by implication, limit the matters to which\nregard may be had.\n\n(5) A reference in this section to a standard telephone service does not\ninclude a reference to a service that is supplied by means of a\npublic mobile telecommunications service.\n\n(5A) A reference in this section to a standard telephone service does not\ninclude a reference to a service that:\n\n(a) is supplied using:\n\n(i) a designated radiocommunications facility owned or\noperated by a carrier or carriage service provider; and\n\n(ii) a line that runs directly between the facility and the\npremises occupied or used by an end-user; and\n\n(b) if an instrument is in force under su",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-5a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-5b"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-6"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-7"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e181e3dc7997705fc30ee61684554c7c6a3cd3b92e12bb2a497e391745197a3a"
    },
