      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACMA may make a written determination requiring each\ncarrier or carriage service provider who supplies an eligible\nstandard telephone service to:\n\n(a) provide pre-selection in favour of a specified carriage service\nprovider, in relation to calls made using an eligible standard\ntelephone service, in the manner specified in the\ndetermination; and\n\n(b) comply with such ancillary or incidental rules (if any) as are\nset out in the determination.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The ACMA may make a written determination requiring each\ncarrier or carriage service provider who supplies an eligible\nstandard telephone service to:\n\n(a) provide pre-selection in favour of a specified carriage service\nprovider, in relation to calls made using an eligible standard\ntelephone service, in the manner specified in the\ndetermination; and\n\n(b) comply with such ancillary or incidental rules (if any) as are\nset out in the determination.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a645f982539ec2a5e1988eb07613361cb4083e19a578098536231abe8272cd4c",
      "skos:note": "Carrier must provide pre-selection in favour of a specified carriage service provider.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-349-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "349(1) Requirement to provide pre-selection",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACMA may make a written determination requiring each\ncarrier or carriage service provider who supplies an eligible\nstandard telephone service to:\n\n(a) provide pre-selection in favour of a specified carriage service\nprovider, in relation to calls made using an eligible standard\ntelephone service, in the manner specified in the\ndetermination; and\n\n(b) comply with such ancillary or incidental rules (if any) as are\nset out in the determination."
    },
