      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In making a determination under subsection (1) or (2), the ACMA\nmust have regard to:\n\n(a) the technical feasibility of complying with the requirement\nconcerned; and\n\n(b) the costs and benefits of complying with the requirement\nconcerned.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In making a determination under subsection (1) or (2), the ACMA\nmust have regard to:\n\n(a) the technical feasibility of complying with the requirement\nconcerned; and\n\n(b) the costs and benefits of complying with the requirement\nconcerned.",
