      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A reference in this section to a standard telephone service does not\ninclude a reference to a service that is supplied by means of a\npublic mobile telecommunications service.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A reference in this section to a standard telephone service does not\ninclude a reference to a service that is supplied by means of a\npublic mobile telecommunications service.",
