    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-5a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "349(5A) Requirement to provide pre-selection",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-349-ss-5a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(5A) A reference in this section to a standard telephone service does not\ninclude a reference to a service that:\n\n(a) is supplied using:\n\n(i) a designated radiocommunications facility owned or\noperated by a carrier or carriage service provider; and\n\n(ii) a line that runs directly between the facility and the\npremises occupied or used by an end-user; and\n\n(b) if an instrument is in force under subsection (5B)—satisfies\nthe conditions set out in the instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(5A) A reference in this section to a standard telephone service does not\ninclude a reference to a service that:\n\n(a) is supplied using:\n\n(i) a designated radiocommunications facility owned or\noperated by a carrier or carriage service provider; and\n\n(ii) a line that runs directly between the facility and the\npremises occupied or used by an end-user; and\n\n(b) if an instrument is in force under subsection (5B)—satisfies\nthe conditions set out in the instrument.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349-ss-5a-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b9b9da770e8c7029a2645cc0ed965b1d7a6d32ade275d80ddd859807c44c175f",
      "skos:note": "Exclusion of certain standard telephone services from the definition."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-349-ss-5a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "349(5A) Requirement to provide pre-selection",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "(5A) A reference in this section to a standard telephone service does not\ninclude a reference to a service that:\n\n(a) is supplied using:\n\n(i) a designated radiocommunications facility owned or\noperated by a carrier or carriage service provider; and\n\n(ii) a line that runs directly between the facility and the\npremises occupied or used by an end-user; and\n\n(b) if an instrument is in force under subsection (5B)—satisfies\nthe conditions set out in the instrument."
    },
    {
