      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.174",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Each of the following is an example of an end-user’s requirements:\n\n(a) the end-user’s requirements relating to domestic\nlong-distance calls;\n\n(b) the end-user’s requirements relating to international calls.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Each of the following is an example of an end-user’s requirements:\n\n(a) the end-user’s requirements relating to domestic\nlong-distance calls;\n\n(b) the end-user’s requirements relating to international calls.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349a"
