    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-350a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "350A(5) Declared carriage services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-350a-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.176",
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of this section, the question whether a particular\nthing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of:\n\n(a) carriage services; or\n\n(b) services supplied by means of carriage services;\nis to be determined in the same manner in which that question is\ndetermined for the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and\nConsumer Act 2010.\nNote:\nSee section 152AB of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) For the purposes of this section, the question whether a particular\nthing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of:\n\n(a) carriage services; or\n\n(b) services supplied by means of carriage services;\nis to be determined in the same manner in which that question is\ndetermined for the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and\nConsumer Act 2010.\nNote:\nSee section 152AB of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-350a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-350a-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2fb94f9b68a14d636f219934f1f664e8bb80548fc7cf62271adfce4e841ddd6c",
      "skos:note": "Determine whether a thing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or services supplied by means of carriage services.",
      "dc:references": [
        "sec-152AB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-350a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "350A(5) Declared carriage services",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 176,
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of this section, the question whether a particular\nthing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of:\n\n(a) carriage services; or\n\n(b) services supplied by means of carriage services;\nis to be determined in the same manner in which that question is\ndetermined for the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and\nConsumer Act 2010.\nNote:\nSee section 152AB of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-350a-ss-5-norm",
