      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The regulation may make provision for arbitration under this section",
      "cml:conclusionText": "This provision requires a temporal relation between the regulation and the arbitration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-351-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "351(4) Pre-selection to be provided",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-351-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.176",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-351"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-351-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "64861dc687fc4a616622459cf0c465c75b45b3ee4e2eb27cbb156cd8fc5e3e45",
      "skos:note": "The ACCC may be constituted by a single member or specified number of members for a particular arbitration.",
      "dc:description": "Nominations in writing by the Chairperson of the ACCC"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-351-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "351(4) Pre-selection to be provided",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 176,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC."
    },
