      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.178",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The requirement in subsection (2) does not, by implication, prevent\nan alternative carriage service provider from refusing to supply a\ncarriage service to the end-user concerned.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The requirement in subsection (2) does not, by implication, prevent\nan alternative carriage service provider from refusing to supply a\ncarriage service to the end-user concerned.",
