    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360aa",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360AA Qualifying fixed wireless carriage service",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360aa"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.185",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, qualifying fixed wireless carriage\nservice means a carriage service, where:\n\n(a) the carriage service is supplied using a fixed wireless\ntechnology platform; and\n\n(b) the carriage service is marketed to customers, or potential\ncustomers, as a fixed wireless service; and",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, qualifying fixed wireless carriage\nservice means a carriage service, where:\n\n(a) the carriage service is supplied using a fixed wireless\ntechnology platform; and\n\n(b) the carriage service is marketed to customers, or potential\ncustomers, as a fixed wireless service; and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360aa-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b2a2e466ca8d22f5e0c08149eb1858307ec40eaec4879b530278651ecdc4462b",
      "skos:note": "Defines qualifying fixed wireless carriage service"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360aa",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360AA Qualifying fixed wireless carriage service",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 185,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, qualifying fixed wireless carriage\nservice means a carriage service, where:\n\n(a) the carriage service is supplied using a fixed wireless\ntechnology platform; and\n\n(b) the carriage service is marketed to customers, or potential\ncustomers, as a fixed wireless service; and"
    },
