    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360ab-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360AB(2) Associate",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360ab-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.186",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, persons are not associates of each other if the ACMA is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) they do not act together in any relevant dealings relating to\nthe facility or company; and\n\n(b) neither of them is in a position to exert influence over the\nbusiness dealings of the other in relation to the facility or\ncompany.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, persons are not associates of each other if the ACMA is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) they do not act together in any relevant dealings relating to\nthe facility or company; and\n\n(b) neither of them is in a position to exert influence over the\nbusiness dealings of the other in relation to the facility or\ncompany.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360ab"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360ab-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360ab-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360ab-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360ab-ss-2-logic-argumentation-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dcabc9a7aa732bca19c026ec8dde463bf43593b0a70afd7b5b764f9f524576fe",
      "skos:note": "Persons are not associates if they do not act together in relevant dealings and one cannot exert influence over the other's business dealings."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360ab-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360AB(2) Associate",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 186,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, persons are not associates of each other if the ACMA is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) they do not act together in any relevant dealings relating to\nthe facility or company; and\n\n(b) neither of them is in a position to exert influence over the\nbusiness dealings of the other in relation to the facility or\ncompany."
    },
