      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.192",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, specify conditions for\nthe purposes of paragraph (2)(c).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, specify conditions for\nthe purposes of paragraph (2)(c).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
