      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.212",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) a specified development area mentioned in subsection (1) is\nnot a nominated service area for the purposes of this Part;\nand\n\n(b) a specified area is a nominated service area for the purposes\nof this Part.\nNote 1:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nNote 2:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nService areas and statutory infrastructure providers  Division 2\n\nSection 360K\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) a specified development area mentioned in subsection (1) is\nnot a nominated service area for the purposes of this Part;\nand\n\n(b) a specified area is a nominated service area for the purposes\nof this Part.\nNote 1:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nNote 2:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nService areas and statutory infrastructure providers  Division 2\n\nSection 360K\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360j-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "efe1b8f17903dcc4fb4a7d10aa646032eb8929becbc1a31f07e12e866756e074",
      "skos:note": "Declaration of nominated service area"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360j-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360J(4) Nominated service area—carrier licence conditions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 212,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) a specified development area mentioned in subsection (1) is\nnot a nominated service area for the purposes of this Part;\nand\n\n(b) a specified area is a nominated service area for the purposes\nof this Part.\nNote 1:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nNote 2:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nService areas and statutory infrastructure providers  Division 2\n\nSection 360K\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
