    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360K Statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service area",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360k"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.213",
      "values:originalText": "Nominated service area covered by a declaration under\nsection 360H\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a\ndeclaration made by a carrier under section 360H; and\n\n(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area\nis a nominated service area;\nthe carrier is the statutory infrastructure provider for the\nnominated service area.\nNominated service area covered by a declaration under\nsection 360HB\n\n(1A) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a\ndeclaration made by a carriage service provider under\nsection 360HB; and\n\n(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area\nis a nominated service area;\nthe carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure\nprovider for the nominated service area.\n\n(1B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) subsection (1A) does not apply to a specified nominated\nservice area; and\n\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the\npurposes of this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "Nominated service area covered by a declaration under\nsection 360H\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a\ndeclaration made by a carrier under section 360H; and\n\n(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area\nis a nominated service area;\nthe carrier is the statutory infrastructure provider for the\nnominated service area.\nNominated service area covered by a declaration under\nsection 360HB\n\n(1A) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a\ndeclaration made by a carriage service provider under\nsection 360HB; and\n\n(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area\nis a nominated service area;\nthe carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure\nprovider for the nominated service area.\n\n(1B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) subsection (1A) does not apply to a specified nominated\nservice area; and\n\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the\npurposes of this Part.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k-ss-1b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "23dd3b965cc5c46da790ade37d1a31f34f45595c7d5e4a33110f013c8e907b15"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360k",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360K Statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service area",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 213,
      "values:originalText": "Nominated service area covered by a declaration under\nsection 360H\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a\ndeclaration made by a carrier under section 360H; and\n\n(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area\nis a nominated service area;\nthe carrier is the statutory infrastructure provider for the\nnominated service area.\nNominated service area covered by a declaration under\nsection 360HB\n\n(1A) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a\ndeclaration made by a carriage service provider under\nsection 360HB; and\n\n(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area\nis a nominated service area;\nthe carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure\nprovider for the nominated service area.\n\n(1B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) subsection (1A) does not apply to a specified nominated\nservice area; and\n\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the\npurposes of this Part."
    },
