        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area is a nominated service area;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the declaration was made before the area became a nominated service area."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k-ss-1a-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "is",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Definition of carriage service provider",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a declaration made by a carriage service provider under section 360HB;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the carriage service provider is the one who declared the area."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k-ss-1a-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "is",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Definition of nominated service area",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area is a nominated service area;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the area is a nominated service area."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k-ss-1b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360K(1B) Statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service area",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360k-ss-1b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.213",
      "values:originalText": "(1B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) subsection (1A) does not apply to a specified nominated\nservice area; and\n\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the\npurposes of this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(1B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) subsection (1A) does not apply to a specified nominated\nservice area; and\n\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the\npurposes of this Part.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k-ss-1b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360k-ss-1b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "182a88c83ae999359818cbe2c4da62fb440e4e076df85f52a22173a0e530bd89",
      "skos:note": "Minister may declare exemption from subsection (1A) for a nominated service area."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360k-ss-1b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360K(1B) Statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service area",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 213,
      "values:originalText": "(1B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) subsection (1A) does not apply to a specified nominated\nservice area; and\n\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the\npurposes of this Part."
    },
    {
