      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) a specified area is a designated service area for the purposes\nof this Part; and\n\n(b) a specified carrier or carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the designated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nNote 1:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nNote 2:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.\nDesignated service area—multiple statutory infrastructure\nproviders\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) a specified area is a designated service area for the purposes\nof this Part; and\n\n(b) each of 2 or more specified persons is a statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the designated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nNote 1:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nNote 2:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) a specified area is a designated service area for the purposes\nof this Part; and\n\n(b) a specified carrier or carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the designated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nNote 1:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nNote 2:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.\nDesignated service area—multiple statutory infrastructure\nproviders\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n\n(a) a specified area is a designated service area for the purposes\nof this Part; and\n\n(b) each of 2 or more specified persons is a statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the designated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nNote 1:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nNote 2:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.",
