    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360la",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360LA Format of description of areas",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360la"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.218",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An area declared under:\n\n(c) subsection 360H(2); or\n\n(d) subsection 360H(4); or\n\n(e) subsection 360H(6); or\n\n(f) subsection 360HB(2); or\n\n(fa) subsection 360HB(6); or\n\n(fb) subsection 360J(3); or\n\n(fc) subsection 360J(4); or\n\n(fd) subsection 360L(1); or\n\n(fe) subsection 360L(2);\nmust be described:\n\n(g) using:\n\n(i) if no coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the GDA94 coordinate system; or\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nService areas and statutory infrastructure providers  Division 2\n\nSection 360LA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) if a coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the coordinate system determined\nunder subsection (2A); and\n\n(h) if a format is determined under subsection (3)—in that\nformat; and\n\n(i) if no format is determined under subsection (3)—in a TAB\nvector format.\n\n(2) An area specified under:\n\n(a) subsection 360HA(1); or\n\n(b) subsection 360HA(2); or\n\n(c) subsection 360HA(3); or\n\n(d) subsection 360HA(4); or\n\n(da) subsection 360HC(1); or\n\n(db) subsection 360HC(2);\nmust be described:\n\n(e) using:\n\n(i) if no coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the GDA94 coordinate system; or\n\n(ii) if a coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the coordinate system determined\nunder subsection (2A); and\n\n(f) if a format is determined under subsection (3)—in that\nformat; and\n\n(g) if no format is determined under subsection (3)—in a TAB\nvector format.\n\n(2A) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, determine a coordinate\nsystem for the purposes of paragraphs (1)(g) and (2)(e).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\n\n(2B) If a coordinate system is determined under subsection (2A), the\ndetermination does not apply to a declaration made, or a notice\ngiven, before the commencement of the determination.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An area declared under:\n\n(c) subsection 360H(2); or\n\n(d) subsection 360H(4); or\n\n(e) subsection 360H(6); or\n\n(f) subsection 360HB(2); or\n\n(fa) subsection 360HB(6); or\n\n(fb) subsection 360J(3); or\n\n(fc) subsection 360J(4); or\n\n(fd) subsection 360L(1); or\n\n(fe) subsection 360L(2);\nmust be described:\n\n(g) using:\n\n(i) if no coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the GDA94 coordinate system; or\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nService areas and statutory infrastructure providers  Division 2\n\nSection 360LA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) if a coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the coordinate system determined\nunder subsection (2A); and\n\n(h) if a format is determined under subsection (3)—in that\nformat; and\n\n(i) if no format is determined under subsection (3)—in a TAB\nvector format.\n\n(2) An area specified under:\n\n(a) subsection 360HA(1); or\n\n(b) subsection 360HA(2); or\n\n(c) subsection 360HA(3); or\n\n(d) subsection 360HA(4); or\n\n(da) subsection 360HC(1); or\n\n(db) subsection 360HC(2);\nmust be described:\n\n(e) using:\n\n(i) if no coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the GDA94 coordinate system; or\n\n(ii) if a coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the coordinate system determined\nunder subsection (2A); and\n\n(f) if a format is determined under subsection (3)—in that\nformat; and\n\n(g) if no format is determined under subsection (3)—in a TAB\nvector format.\n\n(2A) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, determine a coordinate\nsystem for the purposes of paragraphs (1)(g) and (2)(e).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\n\n(2B) If a coordinate system is determined under subsection (2A), the\ndetermination does not apply to a declaration made, or a notice\ngiven, before the commencement of the determination.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360la-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360la-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360la-ss-2a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360la-ss-2b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e45f4b9cec66d06f9528cd79f90a52b86b560d099fb8b35668f8109e73796c58"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360la",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360LA Format of description of areas",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An area declared under:\n\n(c) subsection 360H(2); or\n\n(d) subsection 360H(4); or\n\n(e) subsection 360H(6); or\n\n(f) subsection 360HB(2); or\n\n(fa) subsection 360HB(6); or\n\n(fb) subsection 360J(3); or\n\n(fc) subsection 360J(4); or\n\n(fd) subsection 360L(1); or\n\n(fe) subsection 360L(2);\nmust be described:\n\n(g) using:\n\n(i) if no coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the GDA94 coordinate system; or\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nService areas and statutory infrastructure providers  Division 2\n\nSection 360LA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) if a coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the coordinate system determined\nunder subsection (2A); and\n\n(h) if a format is determined under subsection (3)—in that\nformat; and\n\n(i) if no format is determined under subsection (3)—in a TAB\nvector format.\n\n(2) An area specified under:\n\n(a) subsection 360HA(1); or\n\n(b) subsection 360HA(2); or\n\n(c) subsection 360HA(3); or\n\n(d) subsection 360HA(4); or\n\n(da) subsection 360HC(1); or\n\n(db) subsection 360HC(2);\nmust be described:\n\n(e) using:\n\n(i) if no coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the GDA94 coordinate system; or\n\n(ii) if a coordinate system is determined under\nsubsection (2A)—the coordinate system determined\nunder subsection (2A); and\n\n(f) if a format is determined under subsection (3)—in that\nformat; and\n\n(g) if no format is determined under subsection (3)—in a TAB\nvector format.\n\n(2A) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, determine a coordinate\nsystem for the purposes of paragraphs (1)(g) and (2)(e).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\n\n(2B) If a coordinate system is determined under subsection (2A), the\ndetermination does not apply to a declaration made, or a notice\ngiven, before the commencement of the determination."
    },
    {
