      "cml:premiseText": "...the person responsible for the real estate development project;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Real estate development project person responsible for installation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360m-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360M(2) Exempt real estate development projects",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360m-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.220",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A real estate development project is exempt from\nsubsection 360H(2) if:\n\n(a) there is telecommunications network infrastructure installed\nwithin any part of, or in proximity to, the project area of the\nproject that will enable the supply of eligible services to\npremises in the whole of the project area of the project; and\n\n(b) the telecommunications network infrastructure was fully\ninstalled on or after 1 July 2020; and\n\n(c) the telecommunications network infrastructure was installed\nin accordance with a contractual arrangement that:\n\n(i) was entered into by a carrier and the person responsible\nfor the real estate development project; and\n\n(ii) does not require the carrier to supply qualifying carriage\nservices within all or any part of the project area of the\nproject; and\n\n(d) the telecommunications network infrastructure is capable of\nbeing used to supply, to end-users at premises in the project\narea of the project, carriage services that enable those\nend-users to make and receive radiocommunications fixed\nvoice calls.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A real estate development project is exempt from\nsubsection 360H(2) if:\n\n(a) there is telecommunications network infrastructure installed\nwithin any part of, or in proximity to, the project area of the\nproject that will enable the supply of eligible services to\npremises in the whole of the project area of the project; and\n\n(b) the telecommunications network infrastructure was fully\ninstalled on or after 1 July 2020; and\n\n(c) the telecommunications network infrastructure was installed\nin accordance with a contractual arrangement that:\n\n(i) was entered into by a carrier and the person responsible\nfor the real estate development project; and\n\n(ii) does not require the carrier to supply qualifying carriage\nservices within all or any part of the project area of the\nproject; and\n\n(d) the telecommunications network infrastructure is capable of\nbeing used to supply, to end-users at premises in the project\narea of the project, carriage services that enable those\nend-users to make and receive radiocommunications fixed\nvoice calls.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360m"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360m-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360m-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360m-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9672a7011dbec32220b2619beb7e3cc049f66e8147f14b7fcae7ef50f275f79c",
      "skos:note": "Exempt real estate development projects from subsection 360H(2) if certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360m-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360M(2) Exempt real estate development projects",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 220,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A real estate development project is exempt from\nsubsection 360H(2) if:\n\n(a) there is telecommunications network infrastructure installed\nwithin any part of, or in proximity to, the project area of the\nproject that will enable the supply of eligible services to\npremises in the whole of the project area of the project; and\n\n(b) the telecommunications network infrastructure was fully\ninstalled on or after 1 July 2020; and\n\n(c) the telecommunications network infrastructure was installed\nin accordance with a contractual arrangement that:\n\n(i) was entered into by a carrier and the person responsible\nfor the real estate development project; and\n\n(ii) does not require the carrier to supply qualifying carriage\nservices within all or any part of the project area of the\nproject; and\n\n(d) the telecommunications network infrastructure is capable of\nbeing used to supply, to end-users at premises in the project\narea of the project, carriage services that enable those\nend-users to make and receive radiocommunications fixed\nvoice calls."
    },
