      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.224",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine\ncircumstances for the purposes of subsection (2).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nObligations of statutory infrastructure provider  Division 3\n\nSection 360P\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nSpecial obligation of NBN Co",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine\ncircumstances for the purposes of subsection (2).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nObligations of statutory infrastructure provider  Division 3\n\nSection 360P\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nSpecial obligation of NBN Co",
