    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360P(3A) Obligation of statutory infrastructure provider to connect",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360p-ss-3a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.224",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if the\nconditions specified in the determination are satisfied, this section\nhas effect as if:\n\n(a) the area specified in the determination were a service area;\nand\n\n(b) NBN Co were the statutory infrastructure provider for that\narea.\nRequirements",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if the\nconditions specified in the determination are satisfied, this section\nhas effect as if:\n\n(a) the area specified in the determination were a service area;\nand\n\n(b) NBN Co were the statutory infrastructure provider for that\narea.\nRequirements",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-3a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-3a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "39c9d78b5f1bc9811f6923b37f95e3a33a60a4dea2bbe2702bcf499f470d1f1d",
      "skos:note": "Statutory infrastructure provider must connect area if conditions are met",
      "dc:description": "Connection to the area"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360p-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360P(3A) Obligation of statutory infrastructure provider to connect",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 224,
      "values:originalText": "(3A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if the\nconditions specified in the determination are satisfied, this section\nhas effect as if:\n\n(a) the area specified in the determination were a service area;\nand\n\n(b) NBN Co were the statutory infrastructure provider for that\narea.\nRequirements"
    },
