      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.224",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In fulfilling its obligations under subsection (1), the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for a service area must comply with such\nrequirements (if any) as are determined under subsection (5).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In fulfilling its obligations under subsection (1), the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for a service area must comply with such\nrequirements (if any) as are determined under subsection (5).",
