    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360P(8) Obligation of statutory infrastructure provider to connect",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360p-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.224",
      "values:originalText": "(8) If:\n\n(a) a carriage service provider makes a request as mentioned in\nsubsection (1) in relation to the connection of premises in a\nservice area; and\n\n(b) as a result, the statutory infrastructure provider has an\nobligation under subsection (1) to connect the premises; and\n\n(c) the statutory infrastructure provider has made available on its\nwebsite:\n\n(i) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of\nascertaining price; and",
      "skos:definition": "(8) If:\n\n(a) a carriage service provider makes a request as mentioned in\nsubsection (1) in relation to the connection of premises in a\nservice area; and\n\n(b) as a result, the statutory infrastructure provider has an\nobligation under subsection (1) to connect the premises; and\n\n(c) the statutory infrastructure provider has made available on its\nwebsite:\n\n(i) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of\nascertaining price; and",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "26f4a49fb36c1abdea3cbe7540da05c7282c6079cbaa7823678800930044f59f",
      "skos:note": "Statutory infrastructure provider must connect premises upon request.",
      "dc:description": "Connection to premises"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360p-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360P(8) Obligation of statutory infrastructure provider to connect",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 224,
      "values:originalText": "(8) If:\n\n(a) a carriage service provider makes a request as mentioned in\nsubsection (1) in relation to the connection of premises in a\nservice area; and\n\n(b) as a result, the statutory infrastructure provider has an\nobligation under subsection (1) to connect the premises; and\n\n(c) the statutory infrastructure provider has made available on its\nwebsite:\n\n(i) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of\nascertaining price; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-8"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-8-logic-deontic-1",
