    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360q-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360Q(2) Obligation of statutory infrastructure provider to supply",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360q-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.228",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if the\nconditions specified in the determination are satisfied, this section\nhas effect as if:\n\n(a) the area specified in the determination were a service area;\nand\n\n(b) NBN Co were the statutory infrastructure provider for that\narea.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nAdjustment",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if the\nconditions specified in the determination are satisfied, this section\nhas effect as if:\n\n(a) the area specified in the determination were a service area;\nand\n\n(b) NBN Co were the statutory infrastructure provider for that\narea.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nAdjustment",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360q"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360q-ss-2-norm"
        },
