    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360vd-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360VD(1) Damages for breach of a designated compensable standard",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 246,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a statutory infrastructure provider contravenes a designated\ncompensable standard; and\n\n(b) the standard is determined under subsection 360U(1); and\n\n(c) the contravention relates to a particular customer;\nthe statutory infrastructure provider is liable to pay damages to the\ncustomer for the contravention."
    },
