      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) If: a statutory infrastructure provider contravenes a designated compensable rule; and the rule is made under subsection 360V(1); and the contravention relates to a particular customer;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the statutory infrastructure provider is liable to pay damages to the customer for the contravention."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
