      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.246",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The amount of damages payable under subsection (1) or (2) for a\nparticular contravention is ascertained in accordance with the\ncompensation rules.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The amount of damages payable under subsection (1) or (2) for a\nparticular contravention is ascertained in accordance with the\ncompensation rules.",
