    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360VD(4) Damages for breach of a designated compensable standard",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360vd-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.246",
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, if:\n\n(a) the statutory infrastructure provider:\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nCompensation  Division 4A\n\nSection 360VD\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(i) credits an amount to an account that the customer has\nwith the provider; or\n\n(ii) pays an amount to the customer; and\n\n(b) the credit or payment was made as a result of a right or\nremedy that:\n\n(i) was available to the customer otherwise than under this\nDivision; and\n\n(ii) arose out of the same event or transaction as the\ncontravention;\nthe amount of damages payable for the contravention is to be\nreduced (but not below zero) by the amount of the credit or\npayment.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) However, if:\n\n(a) the statutory infrastructure provider:\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nCompensation  Division 4A\n\nSection 360VD\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(i) credits an amount to an account that the customer has\nwith the provider; or\n\n(ii) pays an amount to the customer; and\n\n(b) the credit or payment was made as a result of a right or\nremedy that:\n\n(i) was available to the customer otherwise than under this\nDivision; and\n\n(ii) arose out of the same event or transaction as the\ncontravention;\nthe amount of damages payable for the contravention is to be\nreduced (but not below zero) by the amount of the credit or\npayment.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-4-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-4-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-4-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "94d60e09ffc6a9cb7659e675ec117c3bac0eac49c1dfc77d1be02c03ed85b0a1",
      "skos:note": "Reduction of damages for breach of standard"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360vd-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360VD(4) Damages for breach of a designated compensable standard",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 246,
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, if:\n\n(a) the statutory infrastructure provider:\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nCompensation  Division 4A\n\nSection 360VD\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(i) credits an amount to an account that the customer has\nwith the provider; or\n\n(ii) pays an amount to the customer; and\n\n(b) the credit or payment was made as a result of a right or\nremedy that:\n\n(i) was available to the customer otherwise than under this\nDivision; and\n\n(ii) arose out of the same event or transaction as the\ncontravention;\nthe amount of damages payable for the contravention is to be\nreduced (but not below zero) by the amount of the credit or\npayment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-4-norm",
