          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vh-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vh-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e9ca307283f440e50803da62dd2bea62365cb6a2a2dbfa3405b8d05d3400f742",
      "skos:note": "The Minister may make rules prescribing matters required or permitted by this Division."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360vh",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360VH Compensation rules",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 251,
      "values:originalText": "The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules\n(compensation rules) prescribing matters required or permitted by\nthis Division to be prescribed by the compensation rules.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901."
