    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360y-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360Y(4) Building redevelopment projects etc.",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360y-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.260",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:\n\n(a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in\nstages; or\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 360Z\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will\nbe, carried out by different persons; or\n\n(c) one or more approvals are given, are required, or will be\nrequired, under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a\nTerritory, for the project, or any element of the project.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:\n\n(a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in\nstages; or\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 360Z\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will\nbe, carried out by different persons; or\n\n(c) one or more approvals are given, are required, or will be\nrequired, under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a\nTerritory, for the project, or any element of the project.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360y"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360y-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9d426370fe557485b4ed92a4a63460e10bd6340260776664521982ac232846d8",
      "skos:note": "It is immaterial whether the project has been, is being, or will be implemented in stages."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360y-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360Y(4) Building redevelopment projects etc.",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 260,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:\n\n(a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in\nstages; or\n\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Part 19\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 360Z\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will\nbe, carried out by different persons; or\n\n(c) one or more approvals are given, are required, or will be\nrequired, under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a\nTerritory, for the project, or any element of the project."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360y-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360y-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360z",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360Z Register of statutory infrastructure providers and anticipatory",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360z"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.261",
      "values:originalText": "notices\n\n(1) The ACMA is to maintain a Register in which the ACMA\nincludes:\n\n(a) the name of each statutory infrastructure provider; and\n\n(b) for each of those providers—the relevant service area or\nareas; and\n\n(c) subject to subsections (4) and (5), a copy of each notice given\nby a carrier or carriage service provider under:\n\n(i) subsection 360HA(1); or\n\n(ii) subsection 360HA(2); or\n\n(iii) subsection 360HA(3); or\n\n(iv) subsection 360HA(4); or\n\n(v) subsection 360HC(1); or\n\n(vi) subsection 360HC(2).\n\n(2) The Register may be maintained by electronic means.\n\n(3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the ACMA’s\nwebsite.\n\n(4) If an area specified in a notice given under a provision mentioned\nin paragraph (1)(c) consists of, or is included in, a nominated\nservice area, the ACMA may:\n\n(a) annotate the copy of the notice that is included in the\nRegister with a statement to the effect that the area specified\nin the notice consists of, or is included in, a specified\nnominated service area; or\n\n(b) remove the notice from the Register.",
      "skos:definition": "notices\n\n(1) The ACMA is to maintain a Register in which the ACMA\nincludes:\n\n(a) the name of each statutory infrastructure provider; and\n\n(b) for each of those providers—the relevant service area or\nareas; and\n\n(c) subject to subsections (4) and (5), a copy of each notice given\nby a carrier or carriage service provider under:\n\n(i) subsection 360HA(1); or\n\n(ii) subsection 360HA(2); or\n\n(iii) subsection 360HA(3); or\n\n(iv) subsection 360HA(4); or\n\n(v) subsection 360HC(1); or\n\n(vi) subsection 360HC(2).\n\n(2) The Register may be maintained by electronic means.\n\n(3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the ACMA’s\nwebsite.\n\n(4) If an area specified in a notice given under a provision mentioned\nin paragraph (1)(c) consists of, or is included in, a nominated\nservice area, the ACMA may:\n\n(a) annotate the copy of the notice that is included in the\nRegister with a statement to the effect that the area specified\nin the notice consists of, or is included in, a specified\nnominated service area; or\n\n(b) remove the notice from the Register.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360z-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360z-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360z-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360z-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7367ab9a454559025d4d8ee2241d74682674f0e62c344695d23cfb2f080dd0a9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360z",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360Z Register of statutory infrastructure providers and anticipatory",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 261,
      "values:originalText": "notices\n\n(1) The ACMA is to maintain a Register in which the ACMA\nincludes:\n\n(a) the name of each statutory infrastructure provider; and\n\n(b) for each of those providers—the relevant service area or\nareas; and\n\n(c) subject to subsections (4) and (5), a copy of each notice given\nby a carrier or carriage service provider under:\n\n(i) subsection 360HA(1); or\n\n(ii) subsection 360HA(2); or\n\n(iii) subsection 360HA(3); or\n\n(iv) subsection 360HA(4); or\n\n(v) subsection 360HC(1); or\n\n(vi) subsection 360HC(2).\n\n(2) The Register may be maintained by electronic means.\n\n(3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the ACMA’s\nwebsite.\n\n(4) If an area specified in a notice given under a provision mentioned\nin paragraph (1)(c) consists of, or is included in, a nominated\nservice area, the ACMA may:\n\n(a) annotate the copy of the notice that is included in the\nRegister with a statement to the effect that the area specified\nin the notice consists of, or is included in, a specified\nnominated service area; or\n\n(b) remove the notice from the Register."
    },
