    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360z-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360Z(4) Register of statutory infrastructure providers and anticipatory",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360z-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.261",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If an area specified in a notice given under a provision mentioned\nin paragraph (1)(c) consists of, or is included in, a nominated\nservice area, the ACMA may:\n\n(a) annotate the copy of the notice that is included in the\nRegister with a statement to the effect that the area specified\nin the notice consists of, or is included in, a specified\nnominated service area; or\n\n(b) remove the notice from the Register.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If an area specified in a notice given under a provision mentioned\nin paragraph (1)(c) consists of, or is included in, a nominated\nservice area, the ACMA may:\n\n(a) annotate the copy of the notice that is included in the\nRegister with a statement to the effect that the area specified\nin the notice consists of, or is included in, a specified\nnominated service area; or\n\n(b) remove the notice from the Register.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360z"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360z-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360z-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a4ef27cce4cc17b3683fc35107740a15269a3ce6c15bd9afee1a92f85871a639",
      "skos:note": "Annotate or remove notice from Register"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360z-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360Z(4) Register of statutory infrastructure providers and anticipatory",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 261,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If an area specified in a notice given under a provision mentioned\nin paragraph (1)(c) consists of, or is included in, a nominated\nservice area, the ACMA may:\n\n(a) annotate the copy of the notice that is included in the\nRegister with a statement to the effect that the area specified\nin the notice consists of, or is included in, a specified\nnominated service area; or\n\n(b) remove the notice from the Register."
    },
