    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360za-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360ZA(3) Delegation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360za-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.262",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The ACMA may, by writing, delegate to:\n\n(a) a member of the ACMA; or\n\n(b) a person who is:\n\n(i) a member of the staff of the ACMA; and\n\n(ii) an SES employee or acting SES employee; or\n\n(c) a person who:\n\n(i) is a member of the staff of the ACMA; and\n\n(ii) holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 1 or 2, or\nequivalent, position;\nany or all of the powers that have been delegated by the Minister to\nthe ACMA under subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The ACMA may, by writing, delegate to:\n\n(a) a member of the ACMA; or\n\n(b) a person who is:\n\n(i) a member of the staff of the ACMA; and\n\n(ii) an SES employee or acting SES employee; or\n\n(c) a person who:\n\n(i) is a member of the staff of the ACMA; and\n\n(ii) holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 1 or 2, or\nequivalent, position;\nany or all of the powers that have been delegated by the Minister to\nthe ACMA under subsection (1).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360za"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360za-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1a59dce33ce310452c23312a9b0fcd988518517b1827878139950004495145b5",
      "skos:note": "Delegation of powers to ACMA staff and SES employees"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-360za-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360ZA(3) Delegation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 262,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The ACMA may, by writing, delegate to:\n\n(a) a member of the ACMA; or\n\n(b) a person who is:\n\n(i) a member of the staff of the ACMA; and\n\n(ii) an SES employee or acting SES employee; or\n\n(c) a person who:\n\n(i) is a member of the staff of the ACMA; and\n\n(ii) holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 1 or 2, or\nequivalent, position;\nany or all of the powers that have been delegated by the Minister to\nthe ACMA under subsection (1)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360za-ss-3-norm",
