    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-366-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "366(6) Compliance with conventions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 266,
      "values:originalText": "(6) In this section:\nconvention means:\n\n(a) a convention to which Australia is a party; or\n\n(b) an agreement or arrangement between Australia and a foreign\ncountry;\nand includes, for example, an agreement, arrangement or\nunderstanding between a Minister and an official or authority of a\nforeign country."
    },
    {
