      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.270",
      "values:originalText": "The ACCC has the general administration of the Rules of Conduct\nin force under section 367.\n\n\nInternational aspects of activities of the telecommunications industry  Part 20\nRules of conduct about dealings with international telecommunications operators",
