    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372C Deployment of optical fibre lines to building units",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.277",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to the installation of a line in the project area,\nor any of the project areas, for a real estate development project if:\n\n(a) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits on one or more areas of land; and\n\n(b) the project is specified in, or ascertained in accordance with,\na legislative instrument made by the Minister; and\n\n(c) the line is wholly or primarily used, or wholly or primarily\nfor use, to supply one or more carriage services to either or\nboth of the following:\n\n(i) one or more end-users in those building units;\n\n(ii) one or more prospective end-users in those building\nunits; and\n\n(d) the line is not on the customer side of the boundary of a\ntelecommunications network; and\n\n(e) the line is used, or for use, to supply a carriage service to the\npublic; and\n\n(f) the installation occurs after the commencement of this\nsection.\nNote 1:\nFor real estate development project, see section 372Q.\nNote 2:\nFor building unit, see section 372S.\nNote 3:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\nNote 4:\nFor boundary of a telecommunications network, see section 22.\nNote 5:\nFor supply to the public, see section 372ZA.\nNote 6:\nFor exemption of certain projects, see section 372P.",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to the installation of a line in the project area,\nor any of the project areas, for a real estate development project if:\n\n(a) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits on one or more areas of land; and\n\n(b) the project is specified in, or ascertained in accordance with,\na legislative instrument made by the Minister; and\n\n(c) the line is wholly or primarily used, or wholly or primarily\nfor use, to supply one or more carriage services to either or\nboth of the following:\n\n(i) one or more end-users in those building units;\n\n(ii) one or more prospective end-users in those building\nunits; and\n\n(d) the line is not on the customer side of the boundary of a\ntelecommunications network; and\n\n(e) the line is used, or for use, to supply a carriage service to the\npublic; and\n\n(f) the installation occurs after the commencement of this\nsection.\nNote 1:\nFor real estate development project, see section 372Q.\nNote 2:\nFor building unit, see section 372S.\nNote 3:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\nNote 4:\nFor boundary of a telecommunications network, see section 22.\nNote 5:\nFor supply to the public, see section 372ZA.\nNote 6:\nFor exemption of certain projects, see section 372P.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372c-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c245e055166837bd4e6871e9028d27b665d1a2dd44959502da6c965c35d35aa7",
      "skos:note": "Scope for deployment of optical fibre lines to building units"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372C Deployment of optical fibre lines to building units",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 277,
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to the installation of a line in the project area,\nor any of the project areas, for a real estate development project if:\n\n(a) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits on one or more areas of land; and\n\n(b) the project is specified in, or ascertained in accordance with,\na legislative instrument made by the Minister; and\n\n(c) the line is wholly or primarily used, or wholly or primarily\nfor use, to supply one or more carriage services to either or\nboth of the following:\n\n(i) one or more end-users in those building units;\n\n(ii) one or more prospective end-users in those building\nunits; and\n\n(d) the line is not on the customer side of the boundary of a\ntelecommunications network; and\n\n(e) the line is used, or for use, to supply a carriage service to the\npublic; and\n\n(f) the installation occurs after the commencement of this\nsection.\nNote 1:\nFor real estate development project, see section 372Q.\nNote 2:\nFor building unit, see section 372S.\nNote 3:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\nNote 4:\nFor boundary of a telecommunications network, see section 22.\nNote 5:\nFor supply to the public, see section 372ZA.\nNote 6:\nFor exemption of certain projects, see section 372P."
    },
