    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372D Exemptions—Ministerial instrument",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.279",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, exempt:\n\n(a) conduct specified in the instrument; or\n\n(b) conduct ascertained in accordance with the instrument;\nfrom the scope of either or both of the following provisions:\n\n(c) subsection 372B(2);\n\n(d) subsection 372C(2).\n\n(2) An exemption under subsection (1) may be unconditional or\nsubject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the\nexemption.\n\n(3) An instrument under subsection (1) may confer functions or\npowers on the ACMA.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, exempt:\n\n(a) conduct specified in the instrument; or\n\n(b) conduct ascertained in accordance with the instrument;\nfrom the scope of either or both of the following provisions:\n\n(c) subsection 372B(2);\n\n(d) subsection 372C(2).\n\n(2) An exemption under subsection (1) may be unconditional or\nsubject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the\nexemption.\n\n(3) An instrument under subsection (1) may confer functions or\npowers on the ACMA.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372d-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372d-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372d-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f6c357e809fe7f5704d3227bf82ca881b2d6370138c82f761eca31c226eb3ad9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372d",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372D Exemptions—Ministerial instrument",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 279,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, exempt:\n\n(a) conduct specified in the instrument; or\n\n(b) conduct ascertained in accordance with the instrument;\nfrom the scope of either or both of the following provisions:\n\n(c) subsection 372B(2);\n\n(d) subsection 372C(2).\n\n(2) An exemption under subsection (1) may be unconditional or\nsubject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the\nexemption.\n\n(3) An instrument under subsection (1) may confer functions or\npowers on the ACMA."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372d-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372D(1) Exemptions—Ministerial instrument",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
