      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.279",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An exemption under subsection (1) may be unconditional or\nsubject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the\nexemption.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An exemption under subsection (1) may be unconditional or\nsubject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the\nexemption.",
      "values:partOf": {
