      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.279",
      "values:originalText": "(3) An instrument under subsection (1) may confer functions or\npowers on the ACMA.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An instrument under subsection (1) may confer functions or\npowers on the ACMA.",
