      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 280,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A person must not install a fixed-line facility in the project area, or\nany of the project areas, for a real estate development project,\nunless:\n\n(a) the facility is a fibre-ready facility; and\n\n(b) the conditions (if any) specified in an instrument under\nsubsection (4) are satisfied.\n\n\nDeployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A\nInstallation of fibre-ready facilities  Division 3\n\nSection 372F\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nNote 1:\nFor fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K."
    },
    {
