    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372f",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372F Installation of fibre-ready facilities—building units",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372f"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.281",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to the installation of a fixed-line facility in the\nproject area, or any of the project areas, for a real estate\ndevelopment project if:\n\n(a) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits on one or more areas of land; and\n\n(b) the installation occurs after the commencement of this\nsection; and\n\n(c) sewerage services, electricity or water is, are, or will be,\nsupplied to those units.",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to the installation of a fixed-line facility in the\nproject area, or any of the project areas, for a real estate\ndevelopment project if:\n\n(a) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits on one or more areas of land; and\n\n(b) the installation occurs after the commencement of this\nsection; and\n\n(c) sewerage services, electricity or water is, are, or will be,\nsupplied to those units.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372f-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7c66fc29428b549f13af4ccc2f3ec8256e01569bd6c49e55e394b2d8697ede2c",
      "skos:note": "Installation of fibre-ready facilities—building units"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372f",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372F Installation of fibre-ready facilities—building units",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 281,
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to the installation of a fixed-line facility in the\nproject area, or any of the project areas, for a real estate\ndevelopment project if:\n\n(a) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits on one or more areas of land; and\n\n(b) the installation occurs after the commencement of this\nsection; and\n\n(c) sewerage services, electricity or water is, are, or will be,\nsupplied to those units."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372f-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372f"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372g",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372G Sale of building lots and building units—subdivisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372g"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.283",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a real estate development project involves the subdivision of\none or more areas of land into building lots; and\n\n(b) the project involves either or both of the following:\n\n(i) the making available of one or more of those lots for\nsale or lease, where it would be reasonable to expect\nthat one or more building units would be subsequently\nconstructed on the lots;\n\n(ii) the construction of one or more building units on any of\nthe lots and the making available of any of those\nbuilding units for sale or lease; and\n\n(c) if subparagraph (b)(i) applies—sewerage services, electricity\nor water is, are, or will be, supplied to those lots; and\n\n(d) if subparagraph (b)(ii) applies—sewerage services, electricity\nor water is, are, or will be, supplied to those units.\nNote 1:\nFor subdivision of an area of land, see section 372R.\nNote 2:\nFor building lot, see section 372Q.\nNote 3:\nFor building unit, see section 372S.\nNote 4:\nFor sale of building lots, see section 372T.\nNote 5:\nFor sale of building units, see section 372U.\nNote 6:\nFor supply of sewerage services, electricity or water, see\nsection 372Z.\nNote 7:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nNote 8:\nFor exemption of certain projects, see section 372P.",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a real estate development project involves the subdivision of\none or more areas of land into building lots; and\n\n(b) the project involves either or both of the following:\n\n(i) the making available of one or more of those lots for\nsale or lease, where it would be reasonable to expect\nthat one or more building units would be subsequently\nconstructed on the lots;\n\n(ii) the construction of one or more building units on any of\nthe lots and the making available of any of those\nbuilding units for sale or lease; and\n\n(c) if subparagraph (b)(i) applies—sewerage services, electricity\nor water is, are, or will be, supplied to those lots; and\n\n(d) if subparagraph (b)(ii) applies—sewerage services, electricity\nor water is, are, or will be, supplied to those units.\nNote 1:\nFor subdivision of an area of land, see section 372R.\nNote 2:\nFor building lot, see section 372Q.\nNote 3:\nFor building unit, see section 372S.\nNote 4:\nFor sale of building lots, see section 372T.\nNote 5:\nFor sale of building units, see section 372U.\nNote 6:\nFor supply of sewerage services, electricity or water, see\nsection 372Z.\nNote 7:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nNote 8:\nFor exemption of certain projects, see section 372P.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372g-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372g-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "adf638bb25414284c9150f5b8c61dd7959d4ea35ca713ea991de0a451ffb8403",
      "skos:note": "Scope of subdivision of building lots and units"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372g",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372G Sale of building lots and building units—subdivisions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 283,
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a real estate development project involves the subdivision of\none or more areas of land into building lots; and\n\n(b) the project involves either or both of the following:\n\n(i) the making available of one or more of those lots for\nsale or lease, where it would be reasonable to expect\nthat one or more building units would be subsequently\nconstructed on the lots;\n\n(ii) the construction of one or more building units on any of\nthe lots and the making available of any of those\nbuilding units for sale or lease; and\n\n(c) if subparagraph (b)(i) applies—sewerage services, electricity\nor water is, are, or will be, supplied to those lots; and\n\n(d) if subparagraph (b)(ii) applies—sewerage services, electricity\nor water is, are, or will be, supplied to those units.\nNote 1:\nFor subdivision of an area of land, see section 372R.\nNote 2:\nFor building lot, see section 372Q.\nNote 3:\nFor building unit, see section 372S.\nNote 4:\nFor sale of building lots, see section 372T.\nNote 5:\nFor sale of building units, see section 372U.\nNote 6:\nFor supply of sewerage services, electricity or water, see\nsection 372Z.\nNote 7:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nNote 8:\nFor exemption of certain projects, see section 372P."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372g-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372g"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
