    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372H Sale of building units—other projects",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372h"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.286",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a real estate development project involves:\n\n(i) the construction of one or more building units on one or\nmore areas of land; and\n\n(ii) the making available of any or all of those building units\nfor sale or lease; and\n\n(b) sewerage services, electricity or water is, are, or will be,\nsupplied to those units.\nNote 1:\nFor building unit, see section 372S.\nNote 2:\nFor sale of building units, see section 372U.\nNote 3:\nFor supply of sewerage services, electricity or water, see\nsection 372Z.\nNote 4:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nNote 5:\nFor exemption of certain projects, see section 372P.\n\n\nDeployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A\nInstallation of fibre-ready facilities  Division 3\n\nSection 372H\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nRequirements\n\n(2) A constitutional corporation must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease such a\nbuilding unit unless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in\nproximity to the unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\n\n(3) If such a building unit is in a Territory, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\n\n(3A) If such a building unit is in a State, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nAncillary contraventions\n\n(4) A person must not:\n\n(a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of\nsubsection (2), (3) or (3A); or\n\n(b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a\ncontravention of subsection (2), (3) or (3A); or",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a real estate development project involves:\n\n(i) the construction of one or more building units on one or\nmore areas of land; and\n\n(ii) the making available of any or all of those building units\nfor sale or lease; and\n\n(b) sewerage services, electricity or water is, are, or will be,\nsupplied to those units.\nNote 1:\nFor building unit, see section 372S.\nNote 2:\nFor sale of building units, see section 372U.\nNote 3:\nFor supply of sewerage services, electricity or water, see\nsection 372Z.\nNote 4:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nNote 5:\nFor exemption of certain projects, see section 372P.\n\n\nDeployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A\nInstallation of fibre-ready facilities  Division 3\n\nSection 372H\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nRequirements\n\n(2) A constitutional corporation must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease such a\nbuilding unit unless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in\nproximity to the unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\n\n(3) If such a building unit is in a Territory, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\n\n(3A) If such a building unit is in a State, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, s",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-3a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372h",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372H Sale of building units—other projects",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 286,
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a real estate development project involves:\n\n(i) the construction of one or more building units on one or\nmore areas of land; and\n\n(ii) the making available of any or all of those building units\nfor sale or lease; and\n\n(b) sewerage services, electricity or water is, are, or will be,\nsupplied to those units.\nNote 1:\nFor building unit, see section 372S.\nNote 2:\nFor sale of building units, see section 372U.\nNote 3:\nFor supply of sewerage services, electricity or water, see\nsection 372Z.\nNote 4:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nNote 5:\nFor exemption of certain projects, see section 372P.\n\n\nDeployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A\nInstallation of fibre-ready facilities  Division 3\n\nSection 372H\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nRequirements\n\n(2) A constitutional corporation must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease such a\nbuilding unit unless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in\nproximity to the unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\n\n(3) If such a building unit is in a Territory, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\n\n(3A) If such a building unit is in a State, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nAncillary contraventions\n\n(4) A person must not:\n\n(a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of\nsubsection (2), (3) or (3A); or\n\n(b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a\ncontravention of subsection (2), (3) or (3A); or"
    },
