      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 286,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If such a building unit is in a Territory, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K."
