        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Machine Learning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Artificial intelligence application",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A machine learning algorithm can be used to determine proximity and detect non-compliance.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The use of artificial intelligence can aid in detecting non-compliance with the regulation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372H(3A) Sale of building units—other projects",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372h-ss-3a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.286",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) If such a building unit is in a State, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nAncillary contraventions",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) If such a building unit is in a State, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nAncillary contraventions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-3a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-3a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f1845b2cf389410f193ca4e1264bb3bae2db66e730256bad8430425192396a66",
      "skos:note": "No sale or lease of a building unit without a functional fibre-ready facility installed nearby."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372h-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372H(3A) Sale of building units—other projects",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 286,
      "values:originalText": "(3A) If such a building unit is in a State, a person (other than a\nconstitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out,\nor carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit\nunless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to\nthe unit.\nNote 1:\nFor functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W.\nNote 2:\nFor proximity, see section 372Y.\nNote 3:\nFor exemptions, see section 372K.\nAncillary contraventions"
    },
