      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.286",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person must not:\n\n(a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of\nsubsection (2), (3) or (3A); or\n\n(b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a\ncontravention of subsection (2), (3) or (3A); or",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A person must not:\n\n(a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of\nsubsection (2), (3) or (3A); or\n\n(b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a\ncontravention of subsection (2), (3) or (3A); or",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dc12b803c6cceed4d1c85a8a424be305c81fec77cdca9b8cec66b3d4d36c8f7c",
      "skos:note": "A person must not aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (2), (3) or (3A); or induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (2), (3) or (3A);"
    },
    {
