      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.290",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section, compliance period means the period stated in the\nremedial notice under section 372JB, and includes that period as\nextended under this section.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In this section, compliance period means the period stated in the\nremedial notice under section 372JB, and includes that period as\nextended under this section.",
