      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.291",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies if a person has been given a remedial notice.\nVariation\n\n(2) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the person, vary the\nnotice.\n\n(3) The ACMA may also, in accordance with section 372JD, extend\nthe compliance period for a remedial notice.",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies if a person has been given a remedial notice.\nVariation\n\n(2) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the person, vary the\nnotice.\n\n(3) The ACMA may also, in accordance with section 372JD, extend\nthe compliance period for a remedial notice.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
