    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372l-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372L(3) Third party access regime",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372l-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.295",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The owner or operator of the facility is not required to comply with\nsubsection (2) unless:\n\n(a) the access is provided for the sole purpose of enabling the\ncarrier:\n\n(i) to provide facilities and carriage services; or\n\n(ii) to establish its own facilities; and\n\n(b) the carrier gives the owner or operator of the facility\nreasonable notice that the carrier requires the access.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The owner or operator of the facility is not required to comply with\nsubsection (2) unless:\n\n(a) the access is provided for the sole purpose of enabling the\ncarrier:\n\n(i) to provide facilities and carriage services; or\n\n(ii) to establish its own facilities; and\n\n(b) the carrier gives the owner or operator of the facility\nreasonable notice that the carrier requires the access.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372l"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372l-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372l-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "83901845938ed230086a3b6cb333acf4e8c464c656f50ab9071c72d5f7b947e4",
      "skos:note": "Carrier may access facility for specific purposes with reasonable notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372l-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372L(3) Third party access regime",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 295,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The owner or operator of the facility is not required to comply with\nsubsection (2) unless:\n\n(a) the access is provided for the sole purpose of enabling the\ncarrier:\n\n(i) to provide facilities and carriage services; or\n\n(ii) to establish its own facilities; and\n\n(b) the carrier gives the owner or operator of the facility\nreasonable notice that the carrier requires the access."
    },
