      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.295",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In determining whether compliance with subsection (2) in relation\nto a facility is technically feasible, the ACCC must have regard to:",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In determining whether compliance with subsection (2) in relation\nto a facility is technically feasible, the ACCC must have regard to:",
