      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372M Terms and conditions of access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372m"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.297",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The owner or operator of a fixed-line facility must comply with\nsubsection 372L(2) on such terms and conditions as are:\n\n(a) agreed between the following parties:\n\n(i) the owner or operator of the facility;\n\n(ii) the carrier who made the request under that subsection;\nor\n\n(b) failing agreement, determined by an arbitrator appointed by\nthe parties.\nIf the parties fail to agree on the appointment of an arbitrator, the\nACCC is to be the arbitrator.\n\n(2) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to the\nconduct of an arbitration under this section.\n\n(3) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC.\n\n(4) Subsection (3) does not, by implication, limit subsection (2).\n\n(5) If:\n\n(a) an agreement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) is in force; and\n\n(b) the agreement is in writing;\na determination under this section has no effect to the extent to\nwhich it is inconsistent with the agreement.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The owner or operator of a fixed-line facility must comply with\nsubsection 372L(2) on such terms and conditions as are:\n\n(a) agreed between the following parties:\n\n(i) the owner or operator of the facility;\n\n(ii) the carrier who made the request under that subsection;\nor\n\n(b) failing agreement, determined by an arbitrator appointed by\nthe parties.\nIf the parties fail to agree on the appointment of an arbitrator, the\nACCC is to be the arbitrator.\n\n(2) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to the\nconduct of an arbitration under this section.\n\n(3) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC.\n\n(4) Subsection (3) does not, by implication, limit subsection (2).\n\n(5) If:\n\n(a) an agreement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) is in force; and\n\n(b) the agreement is in writing;\na determination under this section has no effect to the extent to\nwhich it is inconsistent with the agreement.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m-ss-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "05f7b8929afb1e68fbbbc26bc0899c1190af9c0bede37b6235555173cdfeac4e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372m",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372M Terms and conditions of access",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 297,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The owner or operator of a fixed-line facility must comply with\nsubsection 372L(2) on such terms and conditions as are:\n\n(a) agreed between the following parties:\n\n(i) the owner or operator of the facility;\n\n(ii) the carrier who made the request under that subsection;\nor\n\n(b) failing agreement, determined by an arbitrator appointed by\nthe parties.\nIf the parties fail to agree on the appointment of an arbitrator, the\nACCC is to be the arbitrator.\n\n(2) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to the\nconduct of an arbitration under this section.\n\n(3) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC.\n\n(4) Subsection (3) does not, by implication, limit subsection (2).\n\n(5) If:\n\n(a) an agreement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) is in force; and\n\n(b) the agreement is in writing;\na determination under this section has no effect to the extent to\nwhich it is inconsistent with the agreement."
    },
    {
