    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372M(3) Terms and conditions of access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372m-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.297",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372m-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "85f74b7a90ccd3b9a557573361c608f9807d4b8c54904dfbc415dae75e85dd4e",
      "skos:note": "The ACCC may be constituted by a single member or specified number of members for a particular arbitration.",
      "dc:description": "Nominations in writing by the Chairperson of the ACCC"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372m-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372M(3) Terms and conditions of access",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 297,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular\narbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC\nmay be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of\nmembers, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or\nthose members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson\nof the ACCC."
    },
