        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372p-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ab42d001815fd4925d621cfa235bfbc330121590a1c4e2e57e236ae6245b134f",
      "skos:note": "Exemption for real estate development projects with fixed-line facilities installation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372p-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372P(2) Exemption of certain projects",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 300,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A real estate development project is exempt from the scope of\nDivision 3 if, before the commencement of this section, a person\nwho carries out, or carries out an element of, the project:\n\n(a) began to install fixed-line facilities in the project area, or any\nof the project areas, for the project; or\n\n(b) entered into a contract with another person for the installation\nof fixed-line facilities in the project area, or any of the project\nareas, for the project."
    },
