    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372t",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372T Sale of building lots",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372t"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.303",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Act, a person sells a building lot if:\n\n(a) in a case where the person holds a freehold interest in the\nland concerned—the person transfers the whole or a part of\nthe freehold interest in the land; or\n\n(b) in a case where the person holds a leasehold interest in the\nland concerned—the person transfers the whole or a part of\nthe leasehold interest in the land.",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Act, a person sells a building lot if:\n\n(a) in a case where the person holds a freehold interest in the\nland concerned—the person transfers the whole or a part of\nthe freehold interest in the land; or\n\n(b) in a case where the person holds a leasehold interest in the\nland concerned—the person transfers the whole or a part of\nthe leasehold interest in the land.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372t-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372t-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3210f7c1e2d9bf7eea1d1ce2679ca295bafbbb06c9ef5632798ca34f491e9c73",
      "skos:note": "Definition of selling a building lot"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372t",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372T Sale of building lots",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 303,
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Act, a person sells a building lot if:\n\n(a) in a case where the person holds a freehold interest in the\nland concerned—the person transfers the whole or a part of\nthe freehold interest in the land; or\n\n(b) in a case where the person holds a leasehold interest in the\nland concerned—the person transfers the whole or a part of\nthe leasehold interest in the land."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372t-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372t"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372t-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "defines",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines the concept of selling a building lot",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372U Sale of building units",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372u"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.304",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Act, a person sells a building unit if:\n\n(a) in a case where:\n\n(i) the building unit is covered by subsection 372S(2), but\nis not covered by subsection 372S(3); and\n\n(ii) the person holds a freehold interest in the land on which\nthe building unit is situated;\n\nthe person transfers the whole or a part of the freehold\ninterest; or\n\n(b) in a case where:\n\n(i) the building unit is covered by subsection 372S(2), but\nis not covered by subsection 372S(3); and\n\n(ii) the person holds a leasehold interest in the land on\nwhich the building unit is situated;\n\nthe person transfers the whole or a part of the leasehold\ninterest; or\n\n(c) in a case where:\n\n(i) the building unit is covered by subsection 372S(3); and\n\n(ii) the person holds an interest in the unit;\n\nthe person transfers the whole or a part of the interest in the\nunit.",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Act, a person sells a building unit if:\n\n(a) in a case where:\n\n(i) the building unit is covered by subsection 372S(2), but\nis not covered by subsection 372S(3); and\n\n(ii) the person holds a freehold interest in the land on which\nthe building unit is situated;\n\nthe person transfers the whole or a part of the freehold\ninterest; or\n\n(b) in a case where:\n\n(i) the building unit is covered by subsection 372S(2), but\nis not covered by subsection 372S(3); and\n\n(ii) the person holds a leasehold interest in the land on\nwhich the building unit is situated;\n\nthe person transfers the whole or a part of the leasehold\ninterest; or\n\n(c) in a case where:\n\n(i) the building unit is covered by subsection 372S(3); and\n\n(ii) the person holds an interest in the unit;\n\nthe person transfers the whole or a part of the interest in the\nunit.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u-logic-argumentation-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7a7a362cd1a7eff1a70a431cd36742dd620b774a00ed535b91d7353a8cd2a4d2",
      "skos:note": "A person sells a building unit if they transfer their freehold or leasehold interest."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372u",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372U Sale of building units",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 304,
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Act, a person sells a building unit if:\n\n(a) in a case where:\n\n(i) the building unit is covered by subsection 372S(2), but\nis not covered by subsection 372S(3); and\n\n(ii) the person holds a freehold interest in the land on which\nthe building unit is situated;\n\nthe person transfers the whole or a part of the freehold\ninterest; or\n\n(b) in a case where:\n\n(i) the building unit is covered by subsection 372S(2), but\nis not covered by subsection 372S(3); and\n\n(ii) the person holds a leasehold interest in the land on\nwhich the building unit is situated;\n\nthe person transfers the whole or a part of the leasehold\ninterest; or\n\n(c) in a case where:\n\n(i) the building unit is covered by subsection 372S(3); and\n\n(ii) the person holds an interest in the unit;\n\nthe person transfers the whole or a part of the interest in the\nunit."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "hasObligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Has obligation to sell building unit",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The person holds a freehold or leasehold interest in the land.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person must transfer their interest."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Transfer of interest occurs during the same time period as the sale",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The person transfers the whole or a part of their freehold or leasehold interest.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The transfer of interest occurs during the same time period as the sale."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372u-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "implies",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Sale implies transfer of interest",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The person sells a building unit.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person must transfer their interest."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372v",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372V Fixed-line facilities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372v"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.304",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Act, a fixed-line facility is a facility (other\nthan a line) used, or for use, in connection with a line, where the\nline:\n\n(a) is not on the customer side of the boundary of a\ntelecommunications network; and\n\n(b) is used, or for use, to supply a carriage service to the public.\nNote 1:\nFor boundary of a telecommunications network, see section 22.\nNote 2:\nFor supply to the public, see section 372ZA.\n\n\nDeployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 372W\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Act, a fixed-line facility is a facility (other\nthan a line) used, or for use, in connection with a line, where the\nline:\n\n(a) is not on the customer side of the boundary of a\ntelecommunications network; and\n\n(b) is used, or for use, to supply a carriage service to the public.\nNote 1:\nFor boundary of a telecommunications network, see section 22.\nNote 2:\nFor supply to the public, see section 372ZA.\n\n\nDeployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 372W\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372v-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eea146112368a05a1eea19860c4756adb677a290dd2325d02cce189af11cdc2a",
      "skos:note": "Definition of fixed-line facility"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372v",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372V Fixed-line facilities",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 304,
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Act, a fixed-line facility is a facility (other\nthan a line) used, or for use, in connection with a line, where the\nline:\n\n(a) is not on the customer side of the boundary of a\ntelecommunications network; and\n\n(b) is used, or for use, to supply a carriage service to the public.\nNote 1:\nFor boundary of a telecommunications network, see section 22.\nNote 2:\nFor supply to the public, see section 372ZA.\n\n\nDeployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 372W\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372v-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372v"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372w",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372W Fibre-ready facility",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372w"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.305",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, each of the following is a fibre-ready\nfacility:\n\n(a) an underground fixed-line facility that:\n\n(i) is used, or for use, in connection with an optical fibre\nline; and\n\n(ii) satisfies such conditions (if any) as are specified in a\nlegislative instrument made by the Minister;\n\n(b) a fixed-line facility that:\n\n(i) is used, or for use, in connection with an optical fibre\nline; and\n\n(ii) is specified in a legislative instrument made by the\nMinister; and\n\n(iii) satisfies such conditions (if any) as are specified in a\nlegislative instrument made by the Minister.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, a functional fibre-ready facility is a\nfibre-ready facility that is technically capable of being used in\nconnection with an optical fibre line.\n\n(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), in determining whether a\nfibre-ready facility is technically capable of being used in\nconnection with an optical fibre line, regard must be had to\napplicable industry codes registered, or applicable industry\nstandards determined, under Part 6 (if any).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, each of the following is a fibre-ready\nfacility:\n\n(a) an underground fixed-line facility that:\n\n(i) is used, or for use, in connection with an optical fibre\nline; and\n\n(ii) satisfies such conditions (if any) as are specified in a\nlegislative instrument made by the Minister;\n\n(b) a fixed-line facility that:\n\n(i) is used, or for use, in connection with an optical fibre\nline; and\n\n(ii) is specified in a legislative instrument made by the\nMinister; and\n\n(iii) satisfies such conditions (if any) as are specified in a\nlegislative instrument made by the Minister.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, a functional fibre-ready facility is a\nfibre-ready facility that is technically capable of being used in\nconnection with an optical fibre line.\n\n(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), in determining whether a\nfibre-ready facility is technically capable of being used in\nconnection with an optical fibre line, regard must be had to\napplicable industry codes registered, or applicable industry\nstandards determined, under Part 6 (if any).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372w-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372w-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372w-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c2da8ec2cf6401cede4969b3560902ca56d2daaba21d3168cb77ca6aa573eeea"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372w",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372W Fibre-ready facility",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 305,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, each of the following is a fibre-ready\nfacility:\n\n(a) an underground fixed-line facility that:\n\n(i) is used, or for use, in connection with an optical fibre\nline; and\n\n(ii) satisfies such conditions (if any) as are specified in a\nlegislative instrument made by the Minister;\n\n(b) a fixed-line facility that:\n\n(i) is used, or for use, in connection with an optical fibre\nline; and\n\n(ii) is specified in a legislative instrument made by the\nMinister; and\n\n(iii) satisfies such conditions (if any) as are specified in a\nlegislative instrument made by the Minister.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, a functional fibre-ready facility is a\nfibre-ready facility that is technically capable of being used in\nconnection with an optical fibre line.\n\n(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), in determining whether a\nfibre-ready facility is technically capable of being used in\nconnection with an optical fibre line, regard must be had to\napplicable industry codes registered, or applicable industry\nstandards determined, under Part 6 (if any)."
    },
