    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372y",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372Y Installation of a fibre-ready facility in proximity to a building",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372y"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.306",
      "values:originalText": "lot or building unit\nBuilding lot\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use,\nin connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building lot\nif, and only if, it is installed:\n\n(a) in, on or under the lot, so as to enable the line to be readily\nconnected to a building unit that has been, is being, is to be,\nor may be, constructed on the lot; or\n\n(b) in sufficient proximity to the lot as to enable the line to be\nreadily connected to a building unit that has been, is being, is\nto be, or may be, constructed on the lot.\nBuilding unit\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use,\nin connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building unit\nif, and only if, it is installed in sufficient proximity to the building\nunit as to enable the line to be readily connected to the building\nunit.",
      "skos:definition": "lot or building unit\nBuilding lot\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use,\nin connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building lot\nif, and only if, it is installed:\n\n(a) in, on or under the lot, so as to enable the line to be readily\nconnected to a building unit that has been, is being, is to be,\nor may be, constructed on the lot; or\n\n(b) in sufficient proximity to the lot as to enable the line to be\nreadily connected to a building unit that has been, is being, is\nto be, or may be, constructed on the lot.\nBuilding unit\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use,\nin connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building unit\nif, and only if, it is installed in sufficient proximity to the building\nunit as to enable the line to be readily connected to the building\nunit.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372y-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372y-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "94991187abd47ef16d30dc427fd61e6a31960efd25cb96b4ac1fd230104e9d88"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372y",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372Y Installation of a fibre-ready facility in proximity to a building",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 306,
      "values:originalText": "lot or building unit\nBuilding lot\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use,\nin connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building lot\nif, and only if, it is installed:\n\n(a) in, on or under the lot, so as to enable the line to be readily\nconnected to a building unit that has been, is being, is to be,\nor may be, constructed on the lot; or\n\n(b) in sufficient proximity to the lot as to enable the line to be\nreadily connected to a building unit that has been, is being, is\nto be, or may be, constructed on the lot.\nBuilding unit\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use,\nin connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building unit\nif, and only if, it is installed in sufficient proximity to the building\nunit as to enable the line to be readily connected to the building\nunit."
    },
