        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372y-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372y-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2743c76f5df5ec56fa456302eb6df79529681621f91f0d54cd302a75d2f322df",
      "skos:note": "Fibre-ready facility must be installed in proximity to a building lot"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372y-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372Y(1) Installation of a fibre-ready facility in proximity to a building",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 306,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use,\nin connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building lot\nif, and only if, it is installed:\n\n(a) in, on or under the lot, so as to enable the line to be readily\nconnected to a building unit that has been, is being, is to be,\nor may be, constructed on the lot; or\n\n(b) in sufficient proximity to the lot as to enable the line to be\nreadily connected to a building unit that has been, is being, is\nto be, or may be, constructed on the lot.\nBuilding unit"
    },
