    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372z-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372Z(5) Sewerage services, electricity or water supplied to a building",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372z-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.306",
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of this Part, water is supplied to a building lot if,\nand only if:\n\n(a) a water pipeline is installed:\n\n(i) under the lot; or\n\n(ii) in sufficient proximity to the lot as to enable water to be\nreadily connected to a building unit that has been, is\nbeing, is to be, or may be, constructed on the lot; and\n\n(b) the pipeline is part of a reticulated water supply system.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) For the purposes of this Part, water is supplied to a building lot if,\nand only if:\n\n(a) a water pipeline is installed:\n\n(i) under the lot; or\n\n(ii) in sufficient proximity to the lot as to enable water to be\nreadily connected to a building unit that has been, is\nbeing, is to be, or may be, constructed on the lot; and\n\n(b) the pipeline is part of a reticulated water supply system.",
      "values:partOf": {
