      "cml:premiseText": "(a) a water pipeline is installed: (i) under the lot; or (ii) in sufficient proximity to the lot...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "water is supplied to a building lot if, and only if:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372ZA Supply to the public",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372za"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.308",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line consists of, or forms part of, a network unit; and\n\n(b) under section 44, the network unit is taken, for the purposes\nof section 42, to be used to supply a carriage service to the\npublic;\nthe line is taken to be used, or for use, to supply a carriage service\nto the public.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line neither consists of, nor forms part of, a network unit;\nand\n\n(b) assuming that the line were a network unit, then, under\nsection 44, the network unit would be taken, for the purposes\nof section 42, to be used to supply a carriage service to the\npublic;\nthe line is taken to be used, or for use, to supply a carriage service\nto the public.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line consists of, or forms part of, a network unit; and\n\n(b) under section 44, the network unit is taken, for the purposes\nof section 42, to be used to supply a carriage service to the\npublic;\nthe line is taken to be used, or for use, to supply a carriage service\nto the public.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line neither consists of, nor forms part of, a network unit;\nand\n\n(b) assuming that the line were a network unit, then, under\nsection 44, the network unit would be taken, for the purposes\nof section 42, to be used to supply a carriage service to the\npublic;\nthe line is taken to be used, or for use, to supply a carriage service\nto the public.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "94e8ff581d1c3f44b1e9a0fa5207332fb57fbfc7c1b9fedae876ddb1a2511474"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372za",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372ZA Supply to the public",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 308,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line consists of, or forms part of, a network unit; and\n\n(b) under section 44, the network unit is taken, for the purposes\nof section 42, to be used to supply a carriage service to the\npublic;\nthe line is taken to be used, or for use, to supply a carriage service\nto the public.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line neither consists of, nor forms part of, a network unit;\nand\n\n(b) assuming that the line were a network unit, then, under\nsection 44, the network unit would be taken, for the purposes\nof section 42, to be used to supply a carriage service to the\npublic;\nthe line is taken to be used, or for use, to supply a carriage service\nto the public."
    },
