    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "372ZA(2) Supply to the public",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372za-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.308",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line neither consists of, nor forms part of, a network unit;\nand\n\n(b) assuming that the line were a network unit, then, under\nsection 44, the network unit would be taken, for the purposes\nof section 42, to be used to supply a carriage service to the\npublic;\nthe line is taken to be used, or for use, to supply a carriage service\nto the public.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line neither consists of, nor forms part of, a network unit;\nand\n\n(b) assuming that the line were a network unit, then, under\nsection 44, the network unit would be taken, for the purposes\nof section 42, to be used to supply a carriage service to the\npublic;\nthe line is taken to be used, or for use, to supply a carriage service\nto the public.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za-ss-2-norm"
        },
