          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za-ss-2-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372za-ss-2-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "64918e003998d56b0ca31d845cbcdc0083f36c18de6d11677a0377ac588638b8",
      "skos:note": "A line is taken to be used or for use to supply a carriage service to the public."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-372za-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "372ZA(2) Supply to the public",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 308,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line neither consists of, nor forms part of, a network unit;\nand\n\n(b) assuming that the line were a network unit, then, under\nsection 44, the network unit would be taken, for the purposes\nof section 42, to be used to supply a carriage service to the\npublic;\nthe line is taken to be used, or for use, to supply a carriage service\nto the public."
    },
