    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-377",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "377 Adoption of voluntary standards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-377"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.315",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In making a technical standard under section 376, the ACMA may\napply, adopt or incorporate (with or without modification) any\nmatter contained in a standard proposed or approved by:\n\n(a) Standards Australia; or\n\n(b) any other body or association;\neither:\n\n(c) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(d) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit section 589.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In making a technical standard under section 376, the ACMA may\napply, adopt or incorporate (with or without modification) any\nmatter contained in a standard proposed or approved by:\n\n(a) Standards Australia; or\n\n(b) any other body or association;\neither:\n\n(c) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(d) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit section 589.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-377-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-377-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ff59eb7043364594cc02514c211724674f23002cf1b13468ec5f5fdf762184ac"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-377",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "377 Adoption of voluntary standards",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 315,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In making a technical standard under section 376, the ACMA may\napply, adopt or incorporate (with or without modification) any\nmatter contained in a standard proposed or approved by:\n\n(a) Standards Australia; or\n\n(b) any other body or association;\neither:\n\n(c) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(d) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit section 589."
    },
