      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.315",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Before making a technical standard under section 376, the ACMA\nmust, so far as is practicable, try to ensure that:\n\n(a) interested persons have had an adequate opportunity to make\nrepresentations about the proposed standard (either directly,\nor indirectly by means of a report under paragraph (2)(g));\nand\n\n(b) due consideration has been given to any representation so\nmade.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Before making a technical standard under section 376, the ACMA\nmust, so far as is practicable, try to ensure that:\n\n(a) interested persons have had an adequate opportunity to make\nrepresentations about the proposed standard (either directly,\nor indirectly by means of a report under paragraph (2)(g));\nand\n\n(b) due consideration has been given to any representation so\nmade.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-378-norm"
        },
