      "skos:note": "Representations must be made within a certain timeframe."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-386-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "386(5) Procedures for making technical standards",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 322,
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of subsection (1), interested persons are taken not\nto have had an adequate opportunity to make representations unless\nthere was a period of at least 60 days during which the\nrepresentations could be made."
    },
