    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-389",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "389 Promotion of the long-term interests of end-users of carriage",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-389"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.324",
      "values:originalText": "services and of services supplied by means of carriage\nservices\n\nFor the purposes of this Division, the question whether a particular\nthing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage\nservices or of services supplied by means of carriage services is to\nbe determined in the same manner as it is determined for the\npurposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nTechnical standards relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Division 5A\n\nSection 389A\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "services and of services supplied by means of carriage\nservices\n\nFor the purposes of this Division, the question whether a particular\nthing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage\nservices or of services supplied by means of carriage services is to\nbe determined in the same manner as it is determined for the\npurposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nTechnical standards relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Division 5A\n\nSection 389A\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-389-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-389-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-389-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "009599a6088c9030d6fb721c0d246adf36e7a9d6f1e0a08496eaba05cb8c196d",
      "skos:note": "Promotes long-term interests of end-users of carriage services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-389",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "389 Promotion of the long-term interests of end-users of carriage",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 324,
      "values:originalText": "services and of services supplied by means of carriage\nservices\n\nFor the purposes of this Division, the question whether a particular\nthing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage\nservices or of services supplied by means of carriage services is to\nbe determined in the same manner as it is determined for the\npurposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nTechnical standards relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Division 5A\n\nSection 389A\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-389-norm",
