      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.328",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACMA may request the applicant to give the ACMA further\ninformation about the application.\n\n(2) The ACMA may refuse to consider the application until the\napplicant gives the ACMA the information.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The ACMA may request the applicant to give the ACMA further\ninformation about the application.\n\n(2) The ACMA may refuse to consider the application until the\napplicant gives the ACMA the information.",
