      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.328",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In deciding whether to issue a connection permit, the ACMA may\nhave regard to:\n\n(a) whether the purpose for which the permit is sought is a\npurpose related to:\n\n(i) education or research; or\n\n(ii) the testing of customer equipment or customer cabling;\nor\n\n(iii) the demonstration of customer equipment or customer\ncabling; and\n\n(b) the knowledge and experience of the applicant.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In deciding whether to issue a connection permit, the ACMA may\nhave regard to:\n\n(a) whether the purpose for which the permit is sought is a\npurpose related to:\n\n(i) education or research; or\n\n(ii) the testing of customer equipment or customer cabling;\nor\n\n(iii) the demonstration of customer equipment or customer\ncabling; and\n\n(b) the knowledge and experience of the applicant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-394"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-394-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d72e8e02e77f0d8343671b561e5dd0145ea7db993f9f1c045f9d83925f285de7",
      "skos:note": "Consideration of specific purposes and applicant knowledge when issuing a connection permit."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-394-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "394(2) Issue of connection permits",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 328,
      "values:originalText": "(2) In deciding whether to issue a connection permit, the ACMA may\nhave regard to:\n\n(a) whether the purpose for which the permit is sought is a\npurpose related to:\n\n(i) education or research; or\n\n(ii) the testing of customer equipment or customer cabling;\nor\n\n(iii) the demonstration of customer equipment or customer\ncabling; and\n\n(b) the knowledge and experience of the applicant."
    },
