    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-394-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "394(3) Issue of connection permits",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-394-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.328",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In deciding whether to issue a connection permit, the ACMA must\nhave regard to:\n\n(a) the protection of the integrity of a telecommunications\nnetwork or of a facility; and\n\n(b) the protection of the health or safety of persons who:\n\n(i) operate; or\n\n(ii) work on; or\n\n(iii) use services supplied by means of; or\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nConnection permits and connection rules  Division 6\n\nSection 395\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(iv) are otherwise reasonably likely to be affected by the\noperation of;\n\na telecommunications network or a facility.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In deciding whether to issue a connection permit, the ACMA must\nhave regard to:\n\n(a) the protection of the integrity of a telecommunications\nnetwork or of a facility; and\n\n(b) the protection of the health or safety of persons who:\n\n(i) operate; or\n\n(ii) work on; or\n\n(iii) use services supplied by means of; or\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nConnection permits and connection rules  Division 6\n\nSection 395\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(iv) are otherwise reasonably likely to be affected by the\noperation of;\n\na telecommunications network or a facility.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-394"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-394-ss-3-norm"
