    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-397-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "397(2) Duration of connection permits",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 329,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the holder of a\nconnection permit, declare that the permit has effect as if the\npermit had specified a day specified in the notice as the day of\nexpiration of the connection permit. The declaration has effect\naccordingly."
