    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-402",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "402 Cancellation of connection permit",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 331,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the holder of a\nconnection permit, cancel the permit.\n\n(2) In deciding whether to cancel the permit, the ACMA may have\nregard to any matter which the ACMA was entitled, under\nsubsection 394(2), to have regard in deciding whether to issue a\npermit."
    },
