    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-403-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "403(4) Register of connection permits",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-403-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.332",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of this section, if the Register is maintained by\nelectronic means, a person is taken to have made a copy of, or\ntaken an extract from, the Register if the ACMA gives the person a\nprintout of, or of the relevant parts of, the Register.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of this section, if the Register is maintained by\nelectronic means, a person is taken to have made a copy of, or\ntaken an extract from, the Register if the ACMA gives the person a\nprintout of, or of the relevant parts of, the Register.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-403"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-403-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-403-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-403-ss-4-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0ad0e2a3c74d49eb20816b779bf137671c001907ef5d39071adc6726642afd13",
      "skos:note": "A person must make a copy of or take an extract from the Register if ACMA provides them with a printout."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-403-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "403(4) Register of connection permits",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 332,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of this section, if the Register is maintained by\nelectronic means, a person is taken to have made a copy of, or\ntaken an extract from, the Register if the ACMA gives the person a\nprintout of, or of the relevant parts of, the Register."
    },
    {
