    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-405",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "405 Procedures for making connection rules",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-405"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.333",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Before making connection rules under section 404, the ACMA\nmust, so far as is practicable, try to ensure that:\n\n(a) interested persons have had an adequate opportunity to make\nrepresentations about the proposed rules (either directly, or\nindirectly by means of a report under paragraph (2)(g)); and\n\n(b) due consideration has been given to any representation so\nmade.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Before making connection rules under section 404, the ACMA\nmust, so far as is practicable, try to ensure that:\n\n(a) interested persons have had an adequate opportunity to make\nrepresentations about the proposed rules (either directly, or\nindirectly by means of a report under paragraph (2)(g)); and\n\n(b) due consideration has been given to any representation so\nmade.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-405-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-405-logic-deontic-1"
