    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "406A Application of Division to agent of manufacturer or importer",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-406a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.335",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Act and to avoid doubt, a reference in this\nDivision to a manufacturer or importer of customer equipment or\ncustomer cabling includes a reference to a person who is authorised\nin writing by such a manufacturer or importer to act in Australia as\nan agent of the manufacturer or importer (as the case may be) for\nthe purposes of this Division.",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Act and to avoid doubt, a reference in this\nDivision to a manufacturer or importer of customer equipment or\ncustomer cabling includes a reference to a person who is authorised\nin writing by such a manufacturer or importer to act in Australia as\nan agent of the manufacturer or importer (as the case may be) for\nthe purposes of this Division.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a-logic-descriptionlogic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "76a4dc178e8515132dfebee367f5557a7c822e0cdf51f99a88a28fc23370e892",
      "skos:note": "A person authorized in writing by a manufacturer or importer to act as an agent for the purposes of this Division."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-406a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "406A Application of Division to agent of manufacturer or importer",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 335,
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Act and to avoid doubt, a reference in this\nDivision to a manufacturer or importer of customer equipment or\ncustomer cabling includes a reference to a person who is authorised\nin writing by such a manufacturer or importer to act in Australia as\nan agent of the manufacturer or importer (as the case may be) for\nthe purposes of this Division."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a-logic-descriptionlogic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Class hierarchy application",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A reference to a manufacturer or importer includes a person authorized in writing.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The key refers to an agent of the manufacturer or importer."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Class hierarchy application",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A reference to a customer equipment or cabling includes a person authorized in writing.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The key refers to an agent of the manufacturer or importer for customer equipment or cabling."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-406a-logic-descriptionlogic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Class hierarchy application",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A reference to a person includes a person authorized in writing.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The key refers to an agent of the manufacturer or importer."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-407",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "407 Labelling requirements",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-407"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.335",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACMA may, by written instrument, require any person who is\na manufacturer or importer of specified customer equipment or\nspecified customer cabling to apply to the equipment or cabling a\nlabel that indicates whether the equipment or cabling meets the\nrequirements of the section 376 standards specified in the\ninstrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The ACMA may, by written instrument, require any person who is\na manufacturer or importer of specified customer equipment or\nspecified customer cabling to apply to the equipment or cabling a\nlabel that indicates whether the equipment or cabling meets the\nrequirements of the section 376 standards specified in the\ninstrument.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-407-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-407-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "28d7816140a61d0cc731b242b04030b477f393982b9ac40a4b01e4bade4c8146",
      "skos:note": "Manufacturer/importer must apply label indicating compliance with standards.",
      "dc:description": "Label application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-407",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "407 Labelling requirements",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 335,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACMA may, by written instrument, require any person who is\na manufacturer or importer of specified customer equipment or\nspecified customer cabling to apply to the equipment or cabling a\nlabel that indicates whether the equipment or cabling meets the\nrequirements of the section 376 standards specified in the\ninstrument."
    },
