    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-408-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "408(6) Requirements to apply labels—ancillary matters",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-408-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.336",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The instrument may specify requirements that must be met after a\nlabel has been applied to customer equipment or customer cabling,\nincluding (but not limited to) a requirement that a manufacturer or\nimporter retain for inspection, for the period specified in the\ninstrument:\n\n(a) records of the quality assurance programs conducted in\naccordance with the instrument in respect of the equipment\nor cabling; and\n\n(b) records of any results of any tests conducted in relation to\ncompliance with the standards specified in the instrument;\nand\n\n(c) a declaration, or a copy of a declaration, made as mentioned\nin paragraph (5)(e).",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The instrument may specify requirements that must be met after a\nlabel has been applied to customer equipment or customer cabling,\nincluding (but not limited to) a requirement that a manufacturer or\nimporter retain for inspection, for the period specified in the\ninstrument:\n\n(a) records of the quality assurance programs conducted in\naccordance with the instrument in respect of the equipment\nor cabling; and\n\n(b) records of any results of any tests conducted in relation to\ncompliance with the standards specified in the instrument;\nand\n\n(c) a declaration, or a copy of a declaration, made as mentioned\nin paragraph (5)(e).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-408"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
