      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-413-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "413(2) Supply of unlabelled customer equipment or unlabelled",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 342,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence\npunishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding 100 penalty units.\nNote 1:\nSee also sections 4AA and 4B of the Crimes Act 1914.\nNote 2:\nSee also Division 13 of this Part (which deals with the payment of\npenalties as an alternative to prosecution)."
    },
