      "values:originalText": "(2A) Subsection (2) does not apply if the person has a reasonable\nexcuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (2A) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
      "skos:definition": "(2A) Subsection (2) does not apply if the person has a reasonable\nexcuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (2A) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
      "values:partOf": {
