      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.342",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the ACMA makes an instrument under subsection 407(1) that\nspecifies requirements to be met after a label has been applied, a\nmanufacturer or importer must not contravene those requirements.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the ACMA makes an instrument under subsection 407(1) that\nspecifies requirements to be met after a label has been applied, a\nmanufacturer or importer must not contravene those requirements.",
