    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-416",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "416 Application of labels containing false statements about",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-416"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.344",
      "values:originalText": "compliance with standards\n\n(1) A person must not apply a label to customer equipment or\ncustomer cabling if:\n\n(a) the label contains a statement to the effect that the equipment\nor cabling complies with a section 376 standard; and\n\n(b) the statement is false or misleading.\n\n(2) A person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence\npunishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding 120 penalty units.\nNote 1:\nSee also sections 4AA and 4B of the Crimes Act 1914.\nNote 2:\nSee also Division 13 of this Part (which deals with the payment of\npenalties as an alternative to prosecution).\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nProtected symbols  Division 8\n\nSection 417\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "compliance with standards\n\n(1) A person must not apply a label to customer equipment or\ncustomer cabling if:\n\n(a) the label contains a statement to the effect that the equipment\nor cabling complies with a section 376 standard; and\n\n(b) the statement is false or misleading.\n\n(2) A person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence\npunishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding 120 penalty units.\nNote 1:\nSee also sections 4AA and 4B of the Crimes Act 1914.\nNote 2:\nSee also Division 13 of this Part (which deals with the payment of\npenalties as an alternative to prosecution).\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nProtected symbols  Division 8\n\nSection 417\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-416-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-416-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "640a62f732a16eb05e4180805bcce4e9e3ed808486d02db17768e2f4c0dbeb5e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-416",
