      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.346",
      "values:originalText": "(13) In addition to its effect apart from this subsection, this section also\nhas the effect it would have if a reference in subsection (1) to a\nperson were, by express provision, confined to a corporation to\nwhich paragraph 51(xx) of the Constitution applies.",
