    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-432-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "432(3) Conditions of cabling licence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-432-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.354",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the holder of a cabling\nlicence:\n\n(a) impose one or more further conditions to which the licence is\nsubject; or\n\n(b) revoke or vary any condition:\n\n(i) imposed under paragraph (a); or\n\n(ii) specified in the licence.\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nCabling providers  Division 9\n\nSection 433\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the holder of a cabling\nlicence:\n\n(a) impose one or more further conditions to which the licence is\nsubject; or\n\n(b) revoke or vary any condition:\n\n(i) imposed under paragraph (a); or\n\n(ii) specified in the licence.\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nCabling providers  Division 9\n\nSection 433\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-432"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-432-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-432-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "29cfe91296c2cd27c2fbf7762ebdb78a3a37438cbb78a25a0d0ac6a63e86cf54",
      "skos:note": "Imposing further conditions on the licence"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-432-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "432(3) Conditions of cabling licence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 354,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the holder of a cabling\nlicence:\n\n(a) impose one or more further conditions to which the licence is\nsubject; or\n\n(b) revoke or vary any condition:\n\n(i) imposed under paragraph (a); or\n\n(ii) specified in the licence.\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nCabling providers  Division 9\n\nSection 433\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
