      "cml:premiseText": "ACMA may by written notice",
      "cml:conclusionText": "holder of a cabling licence"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-432-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "432(4) Conditions of cabling licence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-432-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.354",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The following are examples of conditions to which a cabling\nlicence could be subject:\n\n(a) conditions relating to the types of premises in or on which\nthe holder of the licence may perform cabling work;\n\n(b) conditions requiring customer cabling to be inspected by\npersons authorised in writing by the ACMA for the purposes\nof this paragraph.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The following are examples of conditions to which a cabling\nlicence could be subject:\n\n(a) conditions relating to the types of premises in or on which\nthe holder of the licence may perform cabling work;\n\n(b) conditions requiring customer cabling to be inspected by\npersons authorised in writing by the ACMA for the purposes\nof this paragraph.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-432"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-432-ss-4-norm"
