    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-436",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "436 Surrender of cabling licence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-436"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.356",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The holder of a cabling licence may, at any time, surrender the\nlicence by:\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nCabling providers  Division 9\n\nSection 437\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) returning it to the ACMA; and\n\n(b) giving the ACMA written notice that it is surrendered.\n\n(2) The surrender of a cabling licence takes effect on the day on which\nthe notice is given to the ACMA.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The holder of a cabling licence may, at any time, surrender the\nlicence by:\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nCabling providers  Division 9\n\nSection 437\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) returning it to the ACMA; and\n\n(b) giving the ACMA written notice that it is surrendered.\n\n(2) The surrender of a cabling licence takes effect on the day on which\nthe notice is given to the ACMA.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-436-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-436-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8f61d945e164b0e065427d620ebbcb2353c827633def4ef888b2eb0284bd741f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-436",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "436 Surrender of cabling licence",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 356,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The holder of a cabling licence may, at any time, surrender the\nlicence by:\n\n\nTechnical regulation  Part 21\nCabling providers  Division 9\n\nSection 437\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) returning it to the ACMA; and\n\n(b) giving the ACMA written notice that it is surrendered.\n\n(2) The surrender of a cabling licence takes effect on the day on which\nthe notice is given to the ACMA."
    },
