    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-445",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "445 Remedies for connection of unlabelled customer equipment or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-445"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.363",
      "values:originalText": "unlabelled customer cabling\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person:\n\n(i) connects customer equipment, or customer cabling, to a\ntelecommunications network or to a facility; or\n\n(ii) has under his or her control customer equipment, or\ncustomer cabling, connected to a telecommunications\nnetwork or to a facility; and\n\n(b) the manufacturer or importer of the equipment or cabling was\nrequired by subsection 407(1) to apply a label to the\nequipment or cabling; and\n\n(c) either:\n\n(i) the manufacturer or importer did not comply with the\nrequirement; or",
      "skos:definition": "unlabelled customer cabling\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person:\n\n(i) connects customer equipment, or customer cabling, to a\ntelecommunications network or to a facility; or\n\n(ii) has under his or her control customer equipment, or\ncustomer cabling, connected to a telecommunications\nnetwork or to a facility; and\n\n(b) the manufacturer or importer of the equipment or cabling was\nrequired by subsection 407(1) to apply a label to the\nequipment or cabling; and\n\n(c) either:\n\n(i) the manufacturer or importer did not comply with the\nrequirement; or",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-445-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-445-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f945cd1e00e096b9910c3e8ab6db124371fba4e8453097faceea5ef0003d74d3",
      "skos:note": "Prohibition on unlabelled customer equipment or cabling"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-445",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "445 Remedies for connection of unlabelled customer equipment or",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 363,
