    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-454c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "454C Numbering scheme principles",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-454c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.375",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The numbering scheme manager must manage the numbering\nscheme in accordance with the numbering scheme principles.\n\n(2) The numbering scheme principles are as follows:\n\n(a) there must be an adequate and appropriate supply of numbers\nfor carriage services;\n\n(b) future needs for numbering must be planned for, having\nregard to community needs, industry needs and global trends;\n\n(c) numbering arrangements must be effective and efficient and\nsupport the effective and efficient supply of carriage services;",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The numbering scheme manager must manage the numbering\nscheme in accordance with the numbering scheme principles.\n\n(2) The numbering scheme principles are as follows:\n\n(a) there must be an adequate and appropriate supply of numbers\nfor carriage services;\n\n(b) future needs for numbering must be planned for, having\nregard to community needs, industry needs and global trends;\n\n(c) numbering arrangements must be effective and efficient and\nsupport the effective and efficient supply of carriage services;",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-454c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-454c-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "33870a025fb073dda0d0dd75dc8d4eb2188c3906bdcd1273c4e7a93f7d2fe141"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-454c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "454C Numbering scheme principles",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 375,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The numbering scheme manager must manage the numbering\nscheme in accordance with the numbering scheme principles.\n\n(2) The numbering scheme principles are as follows:\n\n(a) there must be an adequate and appropriate supply of numbers\nfor carriage services;\n\n(b) future needs for numbering must be planned for, having\nregard to community needs, industry needs and global trends;\n\n(c) numbering arrangements must be effective and efficient and\nsupport the effective and efficient supply of carriage services;"
    },
