    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-454d-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "454D(2) Revocation of determination",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 377,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Before the Minister revokes the determination of a person as the\nnumbering scheme manager, the Minister must consult the person,\nthe ACMA and the ACCC."
    },
    {
