      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.379",
      "values:originalText": "Documents containing the rules and processes of the numbering\nscheme, including a plan for numbering of carriage services, are\nnot legislative instruments.\nSubdivision A—Management by the ACMA",
