      "skos:note": "Specify numbers for carriage services supply"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-455-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "455(3) Numbering plan",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 380,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The numbering plan must specify the numbers that are for use in\nconnection with the supply of carriage services to the public in\nAustralia.\nNote:\nSpecification is the “first tier” concept. It operates at the level of a\ngeneral specification of numbers."
    },
