      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.382",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In exercising the power conferred by subsection (2), the ACCC\nmust have regard to whether portability of particular allocated\nnumbers is required in order to promote the long-term interests of\nend-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of\ncarriage services.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In exercising the power conferred by subsection (2), the ACCC\nmust have regard to whether portability of particular allocated\nnumbers is required in order to promote the long-term interests of\nend-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of\ncarriage services.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-458"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
