      "cml:premiseText": "End-users' interests are promoted by considering portability",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Portability is relevant to promoting end-users' interests"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-458-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "458(6) Numbering plan—rules about portability of allocated numbers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-458-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.382",
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of this section, the question whether a particular\nthing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage\nservices or of services supplied by means of carriage services is to\nbe determined in the same manner as that question is determined\nfor the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act\n2010.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) For the purposes of this section, the question whether a particular\nthing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage\nservices or of services supplied by means of carriage services is to\nbe determined in the same manner as that question is determined\nfor the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act\n2010.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-458"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-458-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-458-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-458-ss-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "89fce8304fe879c617c11e5d6d88f4899b463bb03b1446b8361be70061d4e0a0",
      "skos:note": "Determines the question of promoting long-term interests in a manner similar to Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-458-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "458(6) Numbering plan—rules about portability of allocated numbers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 382,
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of this section, the question whether a particular\nthing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage\nservices or of services supplied by means of carriage services is to\nbe determined in the same manner as that question is determined\nfor the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act\n2010."
    },
    {
