      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.385",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Before making or varying a numbering plan, the ACMA must\nconsult the ACCC.\n\n(2) The numbering plan may provide that, before exercising a power\nconferred on the ACMA by the numbering plan, the ACMA must\nconsult the ACCC.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Before making or varying a numbering plan, the ACMA must\nconsult the ACCC.\n\n(2) The numbering plan may provide that, before exercising a power\nconferred on the ACMA by the numbering plan, the ACMA must\nconsult the ACCC.",
