    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-462-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "462(6) Compliance with the numbering plan",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-462-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.386",
      "values:originalText": "(6) A determination made in an arbitration under this section must not\nbe inconsistent with:\n\n(a) the numbering plan; or\n\n(b) with a pricing principles determination.\nFor this purpose, a pricing principles determination is a written\ndetermination made by the Minister that sets out principles dealing\nwith price-related terms and conditions relating to a requirement of\na kind referred to in paragraph (2)(b).",
      "skos:definition": "(6) A determination made in an arbitration under this section must not\nbe inconsistent with:\n\n(a) the numbering plan; or\n\n(b) with a pricing principles determination.\nFor this purpose, a pricing principles determination is a written\ndetermination made by the Minister that sets out principles dealing\nwith price-related terms and conditions relating to a requirement of\na kind referred to in paragraph (2)(b).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-462"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-462-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-462-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "638acd2b42f074744998cf040bc9a3384781c8a54800e5e99d36d1136edbbd4b",
      "skos:note": "Must comply with numbering plan and pricing principles determination"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-462-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "462(6) Compliance with the numbering plan",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 386,
      "values:originalText": "(6) A determination made in an arbitration under this section must not\nbe inconsistent with:\n\n(a) the numbering plan; or\n\n(b) with a pricing principles determination.\nFor this purpose, a pricing principles determination is a written\ndetermination made by the Minister that sets out principles dealing\nwith price-related terms and conditions relating to a requirement of\na kind referred to in paragraph (2)(b)."
    },
