    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-463a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "463A Numbering scheme manager",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-463a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.387",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If there is a numbering scheme manager, the allocation system\ndetermined by the ACMA under this Subdivision may be prepared\nby the numbering scheme manager.\n\n(2) However, the ACMA must not determine an allocation system that\ndoes not meet the ACMA’s requirements (including in relation to\nthe Telecommunications (Numbering Charges) Act 1997).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If there is a numbering scheme manager, the allocation system\ndetermined by the ACMA under this Subdivision may be prepared\nby the numbering scheme manager.\n\n(2) However, the ACMA must not determine an allocation system that\ndoes not meet the ACMA’s requirements (including in relation to\nthe Telecommunications (Numbering Charges) Act 1997).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
