    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-463a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "463A(2) Numbering scheme manager",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 387,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, the ACMA must not determine an allocation system that\ndoes not meet the ACMA’s requirements (including in relation to\nthe Telecommunications (Numbering Charges) Act 1997)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-463a-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
