    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-464",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "464 Consultation about an allocation system",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-464"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.389",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Before determining or varying an allocation system under\nsection 463, the ACMA must publish on its website a notice:\n\n(a) stating that the ACMA has prepared a draft of the plan or\nvariation; and\n\n(b) setting out the draft; and\n\n(c) inviting interested persons to give written comments about\nthe draft to the ACMA within 30 days after the publication of\nthe notice.\n\n(2) If interested persons have given comments about the draft in\naccordance with the notice, the ACMA must have due regard to\nthose comments in determining or varying the system, as the case\nmay be.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) does not apply to a variation if the variation is of a\nminor nature.\nSubdivision C—Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Before determining or varying an allocation system under\nsection 463, the ACMA must publish on its website a notice:\n\n(a) stating that the ACMA has prepared a draft of the plan or\nvariation; and\n\n(b) setting out the draft; and\n\n(c) inviting interested persons to give written comments about\nthe draft to the ACMA within 30 days after the publication of\nthe notice.\n\n(2) If interested persons have given comments about the draft in\naccordance with the notice, the ACMA must have due regard to\nthose comments in determining or varying the system, as the case\nmay be.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) does not apply to a variation if the variation is of a\nminor nature.\nSubdivision C—Miscellaneous",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-464-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-464-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-464-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7a250665e25650645fcdd3baf472053bb3cd91c08e5543bf446cc3e52e8b6b6f"
    },
