    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-468-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "468(3) Collection of numbering charges",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 392,
      "values:originalText": "(3) An annual charge is due and payable at the time ascertained in\naccordance with a written determination made by the ACMA.\n\n\nNumbering of carriage services and regulation of electronic addressing  Part 22\nNumbering of carriage services  Division 2\n\nSection 468\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nLate payment penalty"
    },
