      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.394",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A reference in this section to the Commonwealth includes a\nreference to an authority of the Commonwealth that cannot, by a\nlaw of the Commonwealth, be made liable to taxation by the\nCommonwealth.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A reference in this section to the Commonwealth includes a\nreference to an authority of the Commonwealth that cannot, by a\nlaw of the Commonwealth, be made liable to taxation by the\nCommonwealth.",
