      "skos:note": "The Commonwealth is not liable to charge for certain authorities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-471-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "471(5) Commonwealth not liable to charge",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 394,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A reference in this section to the Commonwealth includes a\nreference to an authority of the Commonwealth that cannot, by a\nlaw of the Commonwealth, be made liable to taxation by the\nCommonwealth."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-471-ss-5-norm",
