      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The authority is not liable to charge.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The authority can never be taxed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-472",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "472 Integrated public number database",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-472"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.395",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a\nspecified person (other than Telstra Limited) is to provide and\nmaintain an integrated public number database.\n\n(2) If a determination is in force under subsection (1) in relation to a\nperson, the person must comply with the determination.\n\n(3) If a determination is in force under subsection (1) in relation to a\nperson, the Minister may, by written notice given to the person,\ndirect the person to do, or refrain from doing, a specified act or",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a\nspecified person (other than Telstra Limited) is to provide and\nmaintain an integrated public number database.\n\n(2) If a determination is in force under subsection (1) in relation to a\nperson, the person must comply with the determination.\n\n(3) If a determination is in force under subsection (1) in relation to a\nperson, the Minister may, by written notice given to the person,\ndirect the person to do, or refrain from doing, a specified act or",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-472-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-472-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-472-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bfb0a81be5ca85509fa38880f8c48226d660cc1ac9481504c4fd5f85657d5a34"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-472",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "472 Integrated public number database",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 395,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a\nspecified person (other than Telstra Limited) is to provide and\nmaintain an integrated public number database.\n\n(2) If a determination is in force under subsection (1) in relation to a\nperson, the person must comply with the determination.\n\n(3) If a determination is in force under subsection (1) in relation to a\nperson, the Minister may, by written notice given to the person,\ndirect the person to do, or refrain from doing, a specified act or"
    },
