      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.397",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The ACCC must not give a direction under subsection (4) unless,\nin the ACCC’s opinion, compliance with the direction is likely to\nhave a bearing on competition or consumer protection.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The ACCC must not give a direction under subsection (4) unless,\nin the ACCC’s opinion, compliance with the direction is likely to\nhave a bearing on competition or consumer protection.",
      "values:partOf": {
