    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-475",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "475 ACMA may give directions to declared manager of electronic",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-475"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.397",
      "values:originalText": "addressing\n\n(1) The ACMA may, by written notice given to a declared manager of\nelectronic addressing in relation to a particular kind of electronic\naddressing and a particular kind of listed carriage service, direct\nthe manager to do, or refrain from doing, a specified act or thing",
      "skos:definition": "addressing\n\n(1) The ACMA may, by written notice given to a declared manager of\nelectronic addressing in relation to a particular kind of electronic\naddressing and a particular kind of listed carriage service, direct\nthe manager to do, or refrain from doing, a specified act or thing",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-475-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-475-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-475-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "55501f089821285dea986e632e58b6a9f870ec6cd0e092ffaf8bb66a46e221be",
      "skos:note": "ACMA may direct a declared manager of electronic addressing to do or refrain from doing a specified act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-475",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "475 ACMA may give directions to declared manager of electronic",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 397,
      "values:originalText": "addressing\n\n(1) The ACMA may, by written notice given to a declared manager of\nelectronic addressing in relation to a particular kind of electronic\naddressing and a particular kind of listed carriage service, direct\nthe manager to do, or refrain from doing, a specified act or thing"
    },
