      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.398",
      "values:originalText": "(7) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person has been given a direction under this section; and\n\n(b) the person engages in conduct; and\n\n(c) the person’s conduct contravenes the direction.\nPenalty: 10 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person has been given a direction under this section; and\n\n(b) the person engages in conduct; and\n\n(c) the person’s conduct contravenes the direction.\nPenalty: 10 penalty units.",
