    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-477",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "477 ACCC’s directions to prevail over the ACMA’s directions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-477"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.400",
      "values:originalText": "A direction given by the ACMA under section 475 has no effect to\nthe extent to which it is inconsistent with a direction given by the\nACCC under section 476.\n\n\nStandard agreements for the supply of carriage services  Part 23\n\nSection 478\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "A direction given by the ACMA under section 475 has no effect to\nthe extent to which it is inconsistent with a direction given by the\nACCC under section 476.\n\n\nStandard agreements for the supply of carriage services  Part 23\n\nSection 478\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-477-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-477-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-477-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e0c5adc5f5b79cb069d94e9501e9d12ea02cf06fd834201a2e2c01ff7ae66807",
      "skos:note": "ACMA's directions are overridden by ACCC's directions to the same extent they are inconsistent."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-477",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "477 ACCC’s directions to prevail over the ACMA’s directions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 400,
      "values:originalText": "A direction given by the ACMA under section 475 has no effect to\nthe extent to which it is inconsistent with a direction given by the\nACCC under section 476.\n\n\nStandard agreements for the supply of carriage services  Part 23\n\nSection 478\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-477-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-477"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-477-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overriding",
      "cml:logicSummary": "ACCC's direction overrides ACMA's direction.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "ACMA direction given under section 475",
      "cml:conclusionText": "ACCC direction given under section 476"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-477-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Inconsistency",
      "cml:logicSummary": "ACMA direction is overridden if it is inconsistent with ACCC direction.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "ACMA direction given under section 475 and ACCC direction given under section 476",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Neither ACMA nor ACCC direction has effect to the extent of inconsistency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-478",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "478 Simplified outline",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-478"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.401",
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nThe terms and conditions on which certain\ntelecommunications-related goods and services are supplied\nare:\n\n(a)\nas agreed between the supplier and the customer; or\n\n(b)\nfailing agreement, set out in a standard form of\nagreement formulated for the purposes of this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nThe terms and conditions on which certain\ntelecommunications-related goods and services are supplied\nare:\n\n(a)\nas agreed between the supplier and the customer; or\n\n(b)\nfailing agreement, set out in a standard form of\nagreement formulated for the purposes of this Part.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-478-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3c19178d57e010dcfce2d73cc0c5a640b4311ccd0648b9758f78a8d551ada130",
      "skos:note": "Terms and conditions for telecommunications-related goods and services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-478",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "478 Simplified outline",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 401,
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nThe terms and conditions on which certain\ntelecommunications-related goods and services are supplied\nare:\n\n(a)\nas agreed between the supplier and the customer; or\n\n(b)\nfailing agreement, set out in a standard form of\nagreement formulated for the purposes of this Part."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-478-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-478"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-479",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "479 Standard terms and conditions apply unless excluded",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-479"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.401",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to the supply to an ordinary person by a\ncarriage service provider of:\n\n(a) a standard telephone service; or\n\n(b) a carriage service of a kind specified in the regulations; or\n\n(c) ancillary goods of a kind specified in the regulations; or\n\n(d) an ancillary service of a kind specified in the regulations.\n\n(2) The terms and conditions on which the goods or services are\nsupplied are:\n\n(a) so far as the provider and the person agree on the terms and\nconditions on which the goods or services are supplied—the\nagreed terms and conditions; and\n\n(b) if the provider and the person do not agree on terms and\nconditions, but terms and conditions are set out in a standard\nform of agreement that:\n\n(i) is formulated by the provider for the purpose of this\nsection; and",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to the supply to an ordinary person by a\ncarriage service provider of:\n\n(a) a standard telephone service; or\n\n(b) a carriage service of a kind specified in the regulations; or\n\n(c) ancillary goods of a kind specified in the regulations; or\n\n(d) an ancillary service of a kind specified in the regulations.\n\n(2) The terms and conditions on which the goods or services are\nsupplied are:\n\n(a) so far as the provider and the person agree on the terms and\nconditions on which the goods or services are supplied—the\nagreed terms and conditions; and\n\n(b) if the provider and the person do not agree on terms and\nconditions, but terms and conditions are set out in a standard\nform of agreement that:\n\n(i) is formulated by the provider for the purpose of this\nsection; and",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-479-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-479-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "47c839e125b2555508272f1ca7c94b7a471439f91fb4a206d33bdb662d9d31e1"
    },
