    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "484B Simplified outline of this Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-484b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.406",
      "values:originalText": "•\nThe ACMA must ensure that the SMS Sender ID Register is\nestablished and maintained.\n•\nThe SMS Sender ID Register is a register of sender\nidentifications that have been accepted by the ACMA. Other\ninformation may be contained in the register.\n•\nVarious approved entities may apply to the ACMA to have a\nsender identification accepted.\n•\nThe ACMA may make determinations relating to:\n\n(a)\naccess to the SMS Sender ID Register; and\n\n(b)\nthe administration and operation of the SMS Sender ID\nRegister.",
      "skos:definition": "•\nThe ACMA must ensure that the SMS Sender ID Register is\nestablished and maintained.\n•\nThe SMS Sender ID Register is a register of sender\nidentifications that have been accepted by the ACMA. Other\ninformation may be contained in the register.\n•\nVarious approved entities may apply to the ACMA to have a\nsender identification accepted.\n•\nThe ACMA may make determinations relating to:\n\n(a)\naccess to the SMS Sender ID Register; and\n\n(b)\nthe administration and operation of the SMS Sender ID\nRegister.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5d84620dcc5256f6c6b1ef3e6e8c46c94cb2df4ab37d19d9efcefc2636f9c27d",
      "skos:note": "Ensure establishment and maintenance of SMS Sender ID Register"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-484b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "484B Simplified outline of this Part",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 406,
      "values:originalText": "•\nThe ACMA must ensure that the SMS Sender ID Register is\nestablished and maintained.\n•\nThe SMS Sender ID Register is a register of sender\nidentifications that have been accepted by the ACMA. Other\ninformation may be contained in the register.\n•\nVarious approved entities may apply to the ACMA to have a\nsender identification accepted.\n•\nThe ACMA may make determinations relating to:\n\n(a)\naccess to the SMS Sender ID Register; and\n\n(b)\nthe administration and operation of the SMS Sender ID\nRegister."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484b-norm",
