      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.414",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The substituted decision takes effect on:\n\n(a) if the ACMA specifies the day on which the substituted\ndecision takes effect (which may be earlier than the day the\nsubstituted decision is made)—that specified day; or\n\n(b) otherwise—the day of the decision taken by the operation of\nthe computer program.\n\n\nSMS Sender ID Register  Part 24B\n\nSection 484K\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nArrangement not a legislative instrument",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The substituted decision takes effect on:\n\n(a) if the ACMA specifies the day on which the substituted\ndecision takes effect (which may be earlier than the day the\nsubstituted decision is made)—that specified day; or\n\n(b) otherwise—the day of the decision taken by the operation of\nthe computer program.\n\n\nSMS Sender ID Register  Part 24B\n\nSection 484K\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nArrangement not a legislative instrument",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484j-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "beb01dbb5de1b95b69b3365f5042faeaef41911abb1356011ff418ed49e5d6e6",
      "skos:note": "Specifies the day on which a substituted decision takes effect."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-484j-ss-5",
