      "values:originalText": "(1) The Chair of the ACMA must take all reasonable steps to ensure\nthat administrative action taken by the operation of a computer\nprogram under an arrangement under subsection 484J(1) is\nadministrative action that the ACMA could validly take under this\nPart.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Chair of the ACMA must take all reasonable steps to ensure\nthat administrative action taken by the operation of a computer\nprogram under an arrangement under subsection 484J(1) is\nadministrative action that the ACMA could validly take under this\nPart.",
      "values:partOf": {
