    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484k-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "484K(4) Oversight and safeguards for automation of administrative",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-484k-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.415",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If, under subsection 484J(4), the ACMA makes a decision in\nsubstitution for a decision the ACMA is treated as having taken\nunder subsection 484J(3), the ACMA must, within 14 days of the\nmaking of the substituted decision, give the entity the subject of the\nsubstituted decision written notice of the substituted decision.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If, under subsection 484J(4), the ACMA makes a decision in\nsubstitution for a decision the ACMA is treated as having taken\nunder subsection 484J(3), the ACMA must, within 14 days of the\nmaking of the substituted decision, give the entity the subject of the\nsubstituted decision written notice of the substituted decision.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484k"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484k-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484k-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "be2be4c83d2bc7f22bda4255e2fbcbfda10bd46df59e46cbdccca2d594001320",
      "skos:note": "Entity must receive written notice of substituted decision within 14 days.",
      "dc:description": "written notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-484k-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "484K(4) Oversight and safeguards for automation of administrative",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 415,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If, under subsection 484J(4), the ACMA makes a decision in\nsubstitution for a decision the ACMA is treated as having taken\nunder subsection 484J(3), the ACMA must, within 14 days of the\nmaking of the substituted decision, give the entity the subject of the\nsubstituted decision written notice of the substituted decision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484k-ss-4-norm",
