      "skos:note": "Prohibition on publishing confidential material"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-493-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "493(6) Confidential material not to be published",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 424,
      "values:originalText": "(6) In this section:\nengage in conduct means:\n\n(a) do an act; or\n\n\nPublic inquiries  Part 25\nInquiries by the ACMA  Division 2\n\nSection 494\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) omit to perform an act."
    },
