    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-495-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "495(4) Reports on inquiries",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-495-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.426",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The ACMA is not required to include in a report any material:\n\n(a) that is of a confidential nature; or\n\n(b) the disclosure of which is likely to prejudice the fair trial of a\nperson; or\n\n(c) that is the subject of an order or direction under section 493\nor 494.\n\n\nPublic inquiries  Part 25\nInquiries by the ACCC  Division 3\n\nSection 496\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The ACMA is not required to include in a report any material:\n\n(a) that is of a confidential nature; or\n\n(b) the disclosure of which is likely to prejudice the fair trial of a\nperson; or\n\n(c) that is the subject of an order or direction under section 493\nor 494.\n\n\nPublic inquiries  Part 25\nInquiries by the ACCC  Division 3\n\nSection 496\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-495"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
