      },
      "cml:premiseText": "If the inquiry was held because of a direction given by the Minister under section 496, the ACCC must give a copy of the report to the Minister",
      "cml:conclusionText": "There is a recurring trace from the inquiry being held due to the Minister's direction to the ACCC providing the report"
