    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "505(4) Reports on inquiries",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.432",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The ACCC is not required to include in a report any material:\n\n\nPublic inquiries  Part 25\nInquiries by the ACCC  Division 3\n\nSection 505A\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) that is of a confidential nature; or\n\n(b) the disclosure of which is likely to prejudice the fair trial of a\nperson; or\n\n(c) that is the subject of an order or direction under section 503\nor 504.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The ACCC is not required to include in a report any material:\n\n\nPublic inquiries  Part 25\nInquiries by the ACCC  Division 3\n\nSection 505A\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) that is of a confidential nature; or\n\n(b) the disclosure of which is likely to prejudice the fair trial of a\nperson; or\n\n(c) that is the subject of an order or direction under section 503\nor 504.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b2d18bac768dd3ae2e8a5d00cb6eb897b1eb02fab008ff005923d0086fa2d132",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from reporting public inquiries"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "505(4) Reports on inquiries",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 432,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The ACCC is not required to include in a report any material:\n\n\nPublic inquiries  Part 25\nInquiries by the ACCC  Division 3\n\nSection 505A\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) that is of a confidential nature; or\n\n(b) the disclosure of which is likely to prejudice the fair trial of a\nperson; or\n\n(c) that is the subject of an order or direction under section 503\nor 504."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "505A ACCC may use material presented to a previous public",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.433",
      "values:originalText": "inquiry\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) evidence or other material was presented to a hearing\nfor the purposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(ii) a written submission was lodged with the ACCC for the\npurposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(iii) any other information obtained by the ACCC was used\nby the ACCC for the purposes of the original inquiry;\nand\n\n(c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part.\n\n(2) The ACCC may:\n\n(a) in the case of evidence or other material presented to a\nhearing—treat the whole or a part of the evidence or other\nmaterial as if it had also been presented to a hearing for the\npurposes of the other public inquiry; or\n\n(b) in the case of a written submission lodged with the ACCC—\ntreat the whole or a part of the written submission as if it had\nalso been lodged with the ACCC for the purposes of the\nother public inquiry; or\n\n(c) in the case of any other information obtained by the ACCC—\nuse the whole or a part of the information for the purposes of\nthe other public inquiry.",
      "skos:definition": "inquiry\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) evidence or other material was presented to a hearing\nfor the purposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(ii) a written submission was lodged with the ACCC for the\npurposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(iii) any other information obtained by the ACCC was used\nby the ACCC for the purposes of the original inquiry;\nand\n\n(c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part.\n\n(2) The ACCC may:\n\n(a) in the case of evidence or other material presented to a\nhearing—treat the whole or a part of the evidence or other\nmaterial as if it had also been presented to a hearing for the\npurposes of the other public inquiry; or\n\n(b) in the case of a written submission lodged with the ACCC—\ntreat the whole or a part of the written submission as if it had\nalso been lodged with the ACCC for the purposes of the\nother public inquiry; or\n\n(c) in the case of any other information obtained by the ACCC—\nuse the whole or a part of the information for the purposes of\nthe other public inquiry.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "84d7466427d6e8c1747edbc81df1daccedc26df156345027d638d966ed9e0329"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "505A ACCC may use material presented to a previous public",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 433,
      "values:originalText": "inquiry\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) evidence or other material was presented to a hearing\nfor the purposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(ii) a written submission was lodged with the ACCC for the\npurposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(iii) any other information obtained by the ACCC was used\nby the ACCC for the purposes of the original inquiry;\nand\n\n(c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part.\n\n(2) The ACCC may:\n\n(a) in the case of evidence or other material presented to a\nhearing—treat the whole or a part of the evidence or other\nmaterial as if it had also been presented to a hearing for the\npurposes of the other public inquiry; or\n\n(b) in the case of a written submission lodged with the ACCC—\ntreat the whole or a part of the written submission as if it had\nalso been lodged with the ACCC for the purposes of the\nother public inquiry; or\n\n(c) in the case of any other information obtained by the ACCC—\nuse the whole or a part of the information for the purposes of\nthe other public inquiry."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "505A(1) ACCC may use material presented to a previous public",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505a-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.433",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) evidence or other material was presented to a hearing\nfor the purposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(ii) a written submission was lodged with the ACCC for the\npurposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(iii) any other information obtained by the ACCC was used\nby the ACCC for the purposes of the original inquiry;\nand\n\n(c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) evidence or other material was presented to a hearing\nfor the purposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(ii) a written submission was lodged with the ACCC for the\npurposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(iii) any other information obtained by the ACCC was used\nby the ACCC for the purposes of the original inquiry;\nand\n\n(c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bcb0fa8e997abae5d9e18e434e8e11a1e53803d6d6586080d02ba31bcdf4b800",
      "skos:note": "ACCC must hold another public inquiry under this Part if certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505a-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "505A(1) ACCC may use material presented to a previous public",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 433,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) evidence or other material was presented to a hearing\nfor the purposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(ii) a written submission was lodged with the ACCC for the\npurposes of the original inquiry;\n\n(iii) any other information obtained by the ACCC was used\nby the ACCC for the purposes of the original inquiry;\nand\n\n(c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-1"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to hold another public inquiry",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "505A(2) ACCC may use material presented to a previous public",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505a-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.433",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The ACCC may:\n\n(a) in the case of evidence or other material presented to a\nhearing—treat the whole or a part of the evidence or other\nmaterial as if it had also been presented to a hearing for the\npurposes of the other public inquiry; or\n\n(b) in the case of a written submission lodged with the ACCC—\ntreat the whole or a part of the written submission as if it had\nalso been lodged with the ACCC for the purposes of the\nother public inquiry; or\n\n(c) in the case of any other information obtained by the ACCC—\nuse the whole or a part of the information for the purposes of\nthe other public inquiry.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The ACCC may:\n\n(a) in the case of evidence or other material presented to a\nhearing—treat the whole or a part of the evidence or other\nmaterial as if it had also been presented to a hearing for the\npurposes of the other public inquiry; or\n\n(b) in the case of a written submission lodged with the ACCC—\ntreat the whole or a part of the written submission as if it had\nalso been lodged with the ACCC for the purposes of the\nother public inquiry; or\n\n(c) in the case of any other information obtained by the ACCC—\nuse the whole or a part of the information for the purposes of\nthe other public inquiry.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2-logic-argumentation-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "12e277344a0a84df5f155586f7046d8bfe2fb12f02b1192852c38bfddbeca231",
      "skos:note": "Treat evidence/material as if presented to another public inquiry"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "505A(2) ACCC may use material presented to a previous public",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 433,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The ACCC may:\n\n(a) in the case of evidence or other material presented to a\nhearing—treat the whole or a part of the evidence or other\nmaterial as if it had also been presented to a hearing for the\npurposes of the other public inquiry; or\n\n(b) in the case of a written submission lodged with the ACCC—\ntreat the whole or a part of the written submission as if it had\nalso been lodged with the ACCC for the purposes of the\nother public inquiry; or\n\n(c) in the case of any other information obtained by the ACCC—\nuse the whole or a part of the information for the purposes of\nthe other public inquiry."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "use",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to treat evidence/material",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The ACCC may:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "within",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Treat within temporal interval for another public inquiry",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) in the case of any other information obtained by the ACCC—use the whole or a part of the information for the purposes of the other public inquiry."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505a-ss-2-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "for",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Use evidence/material to support another public inquiry",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The ACCC may:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "505B ACCC may adopt a finding from a previous public inquiry",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.434",
      "values:originalText": "If:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) the ACCC has prepared a report about the original inquiry\nunder section 505; and\n\n(c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part;\nthe ACCC may, for the purposes of the other public inquiry, adopt\na finding set out in the report about the original inquiry.",
      "skos:definition": "If:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) the ACCC has prepared a report about the original inquiry\nunder section 505; and\n\n(c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part;\nthe ACCC may, for the purposes of the other public inquiry, adopt\na finding set out in the report about the original inquiry.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "822017795a98706b378878d2e53f86ed2d67e1d445dd2cbbf101f7abddc8a2d7",
      "skos:note": "ACCC may adopt a finding from a previous public inquiry"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-505b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "505B ACCC may adopt a finding from a previous public inquiry",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 434,
      "values:originalText": "If:\n\n(a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry)\nunder this Part; and\n\n(b) the ACCC has prepared a report about the original inquiry\nunder section 505; and\n\n(c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part;\nthe ACCC may, for the purposes of the other public inquiry, adopt\na finding set out in the report about the original inquiry."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505b-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505b"
      },
