      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.439",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An investigation under this Part is to be conducted as the ACMA\nthinks fit.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An investigation under this Part is to be conducted as the ACMA\nthinks fit.",
      "values:partOf": {
