    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-515a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "515A Reference of matters to Information Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-515a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.443",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a complaint about any of the following\nmatters:\n\n(a) a contravention of a code registered under Part 6, where the\ncode applies to participants in a section of the telemarketing\nindustry (within the meaning of Part 6) and deals with one or\nmore matters relating to the telemarketing activities (within\nthe meaning of Part 6) of those participants;\n\n(b) a contravention of section 128 in relation to an industry\nstandard, where the standard applies to participants in a\nsection of the telemarketing industry (within the meaning of",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to a complaint about any of the following\nmatters:\n\n(a) a contravention of a code registered under Part 6, where the\ncode applies to participants in a section of the telemarketing\nindustry (within the meaning of Part 6) and deals with one or\nmore matters relating to the telemarketing activities (within\nthe meaning of Part 6) of those participants;\n\n(b) a contravention of section 128 in relation to an industry\nstandard, where the standard applies to participants in a\nsection of the telemarketing industry (within the meaning of",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-515a-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5292dded3ed32dc688bd334b0c90351d2a03bd93552f897da4d8de2c21389efe",
      "skos:note": "Matters subject to complaint about contravention of a code registered under Part 6"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-515a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "515A Reference of matters to Information Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 443,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a complaint about any of the following\nmatters:\n\n(a) a contravention of a code registered under Part 6, where the\ncode applies to participants in a section of the telemarketing\nindustry (within the meaning of Part 6) and deals with one or\nmore matters relating to the telemarketing activities (within\nthe meaning of Part 6) of those participants;\n\n(b) a contravention of section 128 in relation to an industry\nstandard, where the standard applies to participants in a\nsection of the telemarketing industry (within the meaning of"
    },
