    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-516",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "516 Reports on investigations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-516"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.444",
      "values:originalText": "(1) After concluding an investigation under subsection 510(1), the\nACMA may prepare and give to the Minister a report under this\nsection.\n\n\nInvestigations  Part 26\n\nSection 517\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) After concluding an investigation under subsection 510(3), the\nACMA must prepare and give to the Minister a report under this\nsection.\n\n(3) A report under this section must cover:\n\n(a) the conduct of the investigation concerned; and\n\n(b) any findings that the ACMA has made as a result of the\ninvestigation; and\n\n(c) the evidence and other material on which those findings were\nbased; and\n\n(d) such other matters relating to, or arising out of, the\ninvestigation as the ACMA thinks fit or as the Minister\ndirects.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) After concluding an investigation under subsection 510(1), the\nACMA may prepare and give to the Minister a report under this\nsection.\n\n\nInvestigations  Part 26\n\nSection 517\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) After concluding an investigation under subsection 510(3), the\nACMA must prepare and give to the Minister a report under this\nsection.\n\n(3) A report under this section must cover:\n\n(a) the conduct of the investigation concerned; and\n\n(b) any findings that the ACMA has made as a result of the\ninvestigation; and\n\n(c) the evidence and other material on which those findings were\nbased; and\n\n(d) such other matters relating to, or arising out of, the\ninvestigation as the ACMA thinks fit or as the Minister\ndirects.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-516-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-516-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-516-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6663f6e00dbed1c87531c107e438895cac6b1d436a5bceb79f73a51b8064edd7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-516",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "516 Reports on investigations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 444,
      "values:originalText": "(1) After concluding an investigation under subsection 510(1), the\nACMA may prepare and give to the Minister a report under this\nsection.\n\n\nInvestigations  Part 26\n\nSection 517\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) After concluding an investigation under subsection 510(3), the\nACMA must prepare and give to the Minister a report under this\nsection.\n\n(3) A report under this section must cover:\n\n(a) the conduct of the investigation concerned; and\n\n(b) any findings that the ACMA has made as a result of the\ninvestigation; and\n\n(c) the evidence and other material on which those findings were\nbased; and\n\n(d) such other matters relating to, or arising out of, the\ninvestigation as the ACMA thinks fit or as the Minister\ndirects."
    },
