      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The making of a statement to, or the giving of a document or information to, the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman in connection with an investigation under section 510.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman must consider complaints"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-519-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines the temporal overlap between certain acts and investigations",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(d) Subject to subsection (2), the making of a statement to, or the giving of a document or information to, the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman in connection with an investigation under section 510.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The making of a statement to, or the giving of a document or information to, the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman overlaps with investigations under section 510"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-519-ss-1-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recurrently",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines the recurrent nature of certain acts and investigations",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) The making of a statement to, or the giving of a document or information to, the ACMA in connection with an investigation under section 510.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The making of a statement to, or the giving of a document or information to, the ACMA is recurrently connected to investigations under section 510"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-519-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permission",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Grants permission for certain acts and investigations",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) The making of a complaint to the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The making of a complaint to the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman is permitted"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-519-ss-1-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Imposes an obligation on the person making complaints under section 509",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) The making of a complaint under section 509.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person making complaints under section 509 has an obligation to do so"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-519-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "519(2) Protection from civil actions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-519-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.446",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Paragraph (1)(d) does not apply to the making of a statement, or\nthe giving of a document or information, by:\n\n(a) a carrier; or\n\n(b) a person who is a service provider and who is participating in\nthe Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman scheme under\nwhich the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman has\nbeen appointed.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Paragraph (1)(d) does not apply to the making of a statement, or\nthe giving of a document or information, by:\n\n(a) a carrier; or\n\n(b) a person who is a service provider and who is participating in\nthe Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman scheme under\nwhich the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman has\nbeen appointed.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-519"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-519-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-519-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ff2a343db46938d8a18cef78d15ae1d11182c8b7b352f84d7b5403b1b0050b25",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from civil actions for carriers and service providers participating in the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman scheme."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-519-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "519(2) Protection from civil actions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 446,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Paragraph (1)(d) does not apply to the making of a statement, or\nthe giving of a document or information, by:\n\n(a) a carrier; or\n\n(b) a person who is a service provider and who is participating in\nthe Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman scheme under\nwhich the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman has\nbeen appointed."
    },
    {
