      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.453",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Until a certified copy is supplied, the ACMA must, at such times\nand places as the ACMA thinks appropriate, permit the person\notherwise entitled to possession of the document, or a person",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Until a certified copy is supplied, the ACMA must, at such times\nand places as the ACMA thinks appropriate, permit the person\notherwise entitled to possession of the document, or a person",
