      },
      "cml:premiseText": "ACMA may make record-keeping rules",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The rules must provide for the preparation of reports"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-529-ss-2e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "529(2E) ACMA may make record-keeping rules",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-529-ss-2e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.455",
      "values:originalText": "(2E) The rules may require or permit a report prepared in accordance\nwith the rules to be given to the ACMA, in accordance with\nspecified software requirements and specified authentication\nrequirements:\n\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.",
      "skos:definition": "(2E) The rules may require or permit a report prepared in accordance\nwith the rules to be given to the ACMA, in accordance with\nspecified software requirements and specified authentication\nrequirements:\n\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-529"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-529-ss-2e-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3e1fb63d5fba15d5236f315e1f1cd4937d1b2ebf2c485ef24f214f4aa1b0b93e",
      "skos:note": "ACMA may make record-keeping rules requiring or permitting reports to be given to ACMA."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-529-ss-2e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "529(2E) ACMA may make record-keeping rules",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 455,
      "values:originalText": "(2E) The rules may require or permit a report prepared in accordance\nwith the rules to be given to the ACMA, in accordance with\nspecified software requirements and specified authentication\nrequirements:\n\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission."
    },
