    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-532",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "532 Simplified outline",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-532"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.457",
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nA person may be appointed as an inspector.\n•\nSearches relating to offences against Part 21 (technical\nregulation) may be conducted:\n\n(a)\nunder the authority of a search warrant; or\n\n(b)\nwith the consent of the owner or occupier concerned; or\n\n(c)\nin an emergency.\n•\nSearches to monitor compliance with Part 21 (technical\nregulation) may be conducted with the consent of the occupier\nconcerned.\n•\nSearches relating to breaches of the Spam Act 2003 may be\nconducted:\n\n(a)\nunder the authority of a search warrant; or\n\n(b)\nwith the consent of the owner or occupier concerned.\n•\nSearches to monitor compliance with the Spam Act 2003 may\nbe conducted:\n\n(a)\nunder the authority of a monitoring warrant; or\n\n(b)\nwith the consent of the occupier concerned.\n•\nAn inspector may require the production of a carrier licence.\n•\nAn inspector may require the giving of certain information,\nand the production of certain documents, relevant to",
      "skos:definition": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nA person may be appointed as an inspector.\n•\nSearches relating to offences against Part 21 (technical\nregulation) may be conducted:\n\n(a)\nunder the authority of a search warrant; or\n\n(b)\nwith the consent of the owner or occupier concerned; or\n\n(c)\nin an emergency.\n•\nSearches to monitor compliance with Part 21 (technical\nregulation) may be conducted with the consent of the occupier\nconcerned.\n•\nSearches relating to breaches of the Spam Act 2003 may be\nconducted:\n\n(a)\nunder the authority of a search warrant; or\n\n(b)\nwith the consent of the owner or occupier concerned.\n•\nSearches to monitor compliance with the Spam Act 2003 may\nbe conducted:\n\n(a)\nunder the authority of a monitoring warrant; or\n\n(b)\nwith the consent of the occupier concerned.\n•\nAn inspector may require the production of a carrier licence.\n•\nAn inspector may require the giving of certain information,\nand the production of certain documents, relevant to",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-532-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-532-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2cf1de7bda99798059ef02679cbb2952e3c115ee4f04af5c8514800e4dfe963b",
      "skos:note": "Searches may be conducted with consent or authority."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-532",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "532 Simplified outline",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 457,
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nA person may be appointed as an inspector.\n•\nSearches relating to offences against Part 21 (technical\nregulation) may be conducted:\n\n(a)\nunder the authority of a search warrant; or\n\n(b)\nwith the consent of the owner or occupier concerned; or\n\n(c)\nin an emergency.\n•\nSearches to monitor compliance with Part 21 (technical\nregulation) may be conducted with the consent of the occupier\nconcerned.\n•\nSearches relating to breaches of the Spam Act 2003 may be\nconducted:\n\n(a)\nunder the authority of a search warrant; or\n\n(b)\nwith the consent of the owner or occupier concerned.\n•\nSearches to monitor compliance with the Spam Act 2003 may\nbe conducted:\n\n(a)\nunder the authority of a monitoring warrant; or\n\n(b)\nwith the consent of the occupier concerned.\n•\nAn inspector may require the production of a carrier licence.\n•\nAn inspector may require the giving of certain information,\nand the production of certain documents, relevant to"
    },
