      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 458,
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\nSpam Act 2003 includes regulations under the Spam Act 2003.\n\n\nEnforcement  Part 28\nInspectors and identity cards  Division 2\n\nSection 533\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
