      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.460",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsection (3) does not apply if the person has a reasonable\nexcuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (4) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Subsection (3) does not apply if the person has a reasonable\nexcuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (4) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
