      "skos:note": "Defendant bears evidential burden in relation to reasonable excuse."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-534-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "534(4) Identity cards",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 460,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsection (3) does not apply if the person has a reasonable\nexcuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (4) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)."
    },
