        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dd496357bb0b1f0d1c7a588a958e291f25c5763b5d3c814cab660f0343441088",
      "skos:note": "Offence of strict liability for breaches of the Spam Act 2003 or Part 21 of this Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-534-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "534(5) Identity cards",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 460,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection (3) is an offence of strict liability.\nNote:\nFor strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code.\n\n\nEnforcement  Part 28\nSearch warrants relating to breaches of the Spam Act 2003 or Part 21 of this Act"
    },
    {
