    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "547B Monitoring powers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-547b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.471",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The monitoring powers that an inspector may exercise under\nparagraph 547A(1)(b) are as follows:\n\n(a) to search the premises;\n\n(b) to inspect and take photographs, or make sketches, of the\npremises or any substance or thing at the premises;\n\n(c) to inspect any document kept at the premises;\n\n(d) to remove, or make copies of, any such document;\n\n(e) to take onto the premises such equipment and materials as the\ninspector requires for the purpose of exercising powers in\nrelation to the premises;",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The monitoring powers that an inspector may exercise under\nparagraph 547A(1)(b) are as follows:\n\n(a) to search the premises;\n\n(b) to inspect and take photographs, or make sketches, of the\npremises or any substance or thing at the premises;\n\n(c) to inspect any document kept at the premises;\n\n(d) to remove, or make copies of, any such document;\n\n(e) to take onto the premises such equipment and materials as the\ninspector requires for the purpose of exercising powers in\nrelation to the premises;",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547b-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547b-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547b-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547b-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547b-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7bf8b584fe78723d06d15179ec876a9d19147e1027916bfbc7d4bcaa7ceb02e9",
      "skos:note": "Inspector's powers to search and inspect premises"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-547b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "547B Monitoring powers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 471,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The monitoring powers that an inspector may exercise under\nparagraph 547A(1)(b) are as follows:\n\n(a) to search the premises;\n\n(b) to inspect and take photographs, or make sketches, of the\npremises or any substance or thing at the premises;\n\n(c) to inspect any document kept at the premises;\n\n(d) to remove, or make copies of, any such document;\n\n(e) to take onto the premises such equipment and materials as the\ninspector requires for the purpose of exercising powers in\nrelation to the premises;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547b-norm",
