      "skos:definition": "(1) An inspector must, before entering premises under a warrant under\nsection 547D:\n\n(a) announce that he or she is authorised to enter the premises;\nand\n\n(b) give any person at the premises an opportunity to allow entry\nto the premises.",
      "values:partOf": {
