    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547f-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "547F(2) Announcement before entry",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-547f-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.475",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An inspector is not required to comply with subsection (1) if he or\nshe believes on reasonable grounds that immediate entry to the\npremises is required:\n\n(a) to ensure the safety of a person; or\n\n(b) to ensure that the effective execution of the warrant is not\nfrustrated.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An inspector is not required to comply with subsection (1) if he or\nshe believes on reasonable grounds that immediate entry to the\npremises is required:\n\n(a) to ensure the safety of a person; or\n\n(b) to ensure that the effective execution of the warrant is not\nfrustrated.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547f"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547f-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547f-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547f-ss-2-logic-epistemic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547f-ss-2-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547f-ss-2-logic-argumentation-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547f-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "68c408bf97428ed6ec4b23124819253ce4b403b6bbd21690dbce2981cb6b4e11",
      "skos:note": "Inspector may deviate from subsection (1) under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-547f-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "547F(2) Announcement before entry",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 475,
      "values:originalText": "(2) An inspector is not required to comply with subsection (1) if he or\nshe believes on reasonable grounds that immediate entry to the\npremises is required:\n\n(a) to ensure the safety of a person; or\n\n(b) to ensure that the effective execution of the warrant is not\nfrustrated."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547f-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
