    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547j-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "547J(5) Access to computer data that is relevant to the Spam Act 2003",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-547j-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.478",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In this section:\ndata includes:\n\n(a) information in any form; and\n\n(b) any program (or part of a program).\ndata held in a computer includes:\n\n(a) data held in any removable data storage device for the time\nbeing held in a computer; and\n\n(b) data held in a data storage device on a computer network of\nwhich the computer forms a part.\ndata storage device means a thing containing, or designed to\ncontain, data for use by a computer.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In this section:\ndata includes:\n\n(a) information in any form; and\n\n(b) any program (or part of a program).\ndata held in a computer includes:\n\n(a) data held in any removable data storage device for the time\nbeing held in a computer; and\n\n(b) data held in a data storage device on a computer network of\nwhich the computer forms a part.\ndata storage device means a thing containing, or designed to\ncontain, data for use by a computer.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547j-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547j-ss-5-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547j-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547j-ss-5-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bad6e7ce27585da0d19f11b2ddfd5c1442879ef7d149bea309918bbb67038508",
      "skos:note": "Defines data for the Spam Act 2003"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-547j-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "547J(5) Access to computer data that is relevant to the Spam Act 2003",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 478,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In this section:\ndata includes:\n\n(a) information in any form; and\n\n(b) any program (or part of a program).\ndata held in a computer includes:\n\n(a) data held in any removable data storage device for the time\nbeing held in a computer; and\n\n(b) data held in a data storage device on a computer network of\nwhich the computer forms a part.\ndata storage device means a thing containing, or designed to\ncontain, data for use by a computer."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547j-ss-5-norm",
