      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.486",
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nCertain decisions of the ACMA may be reviewed by the\nAdministrative Review Tribunal following a process of\ninternal reconsideration by the ACMA.",
      "skos:definition": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nCertain decisions of the ACMA may be reviewed by the\nAdministrative Review Tribunal following a process of\ninternal reconsideration by the ACMA.",
