    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-559",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "559 Reconsideration by the ACMA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-559"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.488",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Upon receiving such an application, the ACMA must:\n\n(a) reconsider the decision; and\n\n(b) affirm, vary or revoke the decision.\n\n(2) The ACMA’s decision on reconsideration of a decision has effect\nas if it had been made under the provision under which the original\ndecision was made.\n\n(3) The ACMA must give to the applicant a notice stating its decision\non the reconsideration together with a statement of its reasons for\nits decision.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Upon receiving such an application, the ACMA must:\n\n(a) reconsider the decision; and\n\n(b) affirm, vary or revoke the decision.\n\n(2) The ACMA’s decision on reconsideration of a decision has effect\nas if it had been made under the provision under which the original\ndecision was made.\n\n(3) The ACMA must give to the applicant a notice stating its decision\non the reconsideration together with a statement of its reasons for\nits decision.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-559-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-559-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-559-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5be96d7297381f0b93e6320968943c419eabd8db6fb200c2c12618dddd27100d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-559",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "559 Reconsideration by the ACMA",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 488,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Upon receiving such an application, the ACMA must:\n\n(a) reconsider the decision; and\n\n(b) affirm, vary or revoke the decision.\n\n(2) The ACMA’s decision on reconsideration of a decision has effect\nas if it had been made under the provision under which the original\ndecision was made.\n\n(3) The ACMA must give to the applicant a notice stating its decision\non the reconsideration together with a statement of its reasons for\nits decision."
    },
