      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.489",
      "values:originalText": "Applications may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nto review a decision of a kind referred to in section 555 if the\nACMA has affirmed or varied the decision under section 559.",
      "skos:definition": "Applications may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nto review a decision of a kind referred to in section 555 if the\nACMA has affirmed or varied the decision under section 559.",
