      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.502",
      "values:originalText": "(5B) The ACMA’s powers under subsections (3) to (5) are only in\nrelation to undertakings it has accepted.\n\n\nEnforceable undertakings  Part 31A\n\nSection 572C\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(5B) The ACMA’s powers under subsections (3) to (5) are only in\nrelation to undertakings it has accepted.\n\n\nEnforceable undertakings  Part 31A\n\nSection 572C\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
