      "skos:note": "Undertakings accepted by ACMA impose obligation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-572b-ss-5b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "572B(5B) Acceptance of undertakings",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 502,
      "values:originalText": "(5B) The ACMA’s powers under subsections (3) to (5) are only in\nrelation to undertakings it has accepted.\n\n\nEnforceable undertakings  Part 31A\n\nSection 572C\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
