    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572f-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "572F(2) Matters to be included in an infringement notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-572f-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.508",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(c), the brief details must include\nthe following information in relation to the alleged contravention:\n\n(a) the date of the alleged contravention;\n\n(b) the civil penalty provision that was allegedly contravened.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(c), the brief details must include\nthe following information in relation to the alleged contravention:\n\n(a) the date of the alleged contravention;\n\n(b) the civil penalty provision that was allegedly contravened.",
      "values:partOf": {
