      "skos:note": "Must provide specific information in an infringement notice",
      "dc:description": "(a) the date of the alleged contravention; (b) the civil penalty provision that was allegedly contravened."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-572f-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "572F(2) Matters to be included in an infringement notice",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 508,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(c), the brief details must include\nthe following information in relation to the alleged contravention:\n\n(a) the date of the alleged contravention;\n\n(b) the civil penalty provision that was allegedly contravened."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572f-ss-2-norm",
