    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572g",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "572G Amount of penalty",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-572g"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.510",
      "values:originalText": "Infringement notice given to a body corporate\n\n(1) The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice given to a\nbody corporate must be a pecuniary penalty equal to:\n\n(a) if the alleged contravention is of a kind specified in a\ndetermination under subsection (2)—the number of penalty\nunits specified in the determination in relation to that kind of\ncontravention; or\n\n(b) otherwise—60 penalty units.\n\n(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(a), the Minister may, by\nlegislative instrument, make a determination that:\n\n(a) sets out one or more kinds of contraventions of section 68 or\n101; and\n\n(b) for each kind of contravention set out in the determination,\nspecifies a particular number of penalty units.\n\n(3) The number of penalty units specified in a determination for a\nparticular kind of contravention must not exceed 18,000.\nInfringement notice given to a person other than a body corporate\n\n(4) The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice given to a\nperson other than a body corporate must be a pecuniary penalty\nequal to 12 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "Infringement notice given to a body corporate\n\n(1) The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice given to a\nbody corporate must be a pecuniary penalty equal to:\n\n(a) if the alleged contravention is of a kind specified in a\ndetermination under subsection (2)—the number of penalty\nunits specified in the determination in relation to that kind of\ncontravention; or\n\n(b) otherwise—60 penalty units.\n\n(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(a), the Minister may, by\nlegislative instrument, make a determination that:\n\n(a) sets out one or more kinds of contraventions of section 68 or\n101; and\n\n(b) for each kind of contravention set out in the determination,\nspecifies a particular number of penalty units.\n\n(3) The number of penalty units specified in a determination for a\nparticular kind of contravention must not exceed 18,000.\nInfringement notice given to a person other than a body corporate\n\n(4) The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice given to a\nperson other than a body corporate must be a pecuniary penalty\nequal to 12 penalty units.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572g-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572g-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572g-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572g-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "da1303c677b899044d689d0fff40d858befc57307a7bb307a25252291ecb965e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-572g",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "572G Amount of penalty",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 510,
      "values:originalText": "Infringement notice given to a body corporate\n\n(1) The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice given to a\nbody corporate must be a pecuniary penalty equal to:\n\n(a) if the alleged contravention is of a kind specified in a\ndetermination under subsection (2)—the number of penalty\nunits specified in the determination in relation to that kind of\ncontravention; or\n\n(b) otherwise—60 penalty units.\n\n(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(a), the Minister may, by\nlegislative instrument, make a determination that:\n\n(a) sets out one or more kinds of contraventions of section 68 or\n101; and\n\n(b) for each kind of contravention set out in the determination,\nspecifies a particular number of penalty units.\n\n(3) The number of penalty units specified in a determination for a\nparticular kind of contravention must not exceed 18,000.\nInfringement notice given to a person other than a body corporate\n\n(4) The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice given to a\nperson other than a body corporate must be a pecuniary penalty\nequal to 12 penalty units."
    },
