      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.512",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The ACCC must not appoint a person under subsection (3) unless\nthe person:\n\n(a) is an SES employee or acting SES employee; or\n\n(b) holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 1 or 2 position or an\nequivalent position.\nNote:\nSES employee is defined in the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The ACCC must not appoint a person under subsection (3) unless\nthe person:\n\n(a) is an SES employee or acting SES employee; or\n\n(b) holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 1 or 2 position or an\nequivalent position.\nNote:\nSES employee is defined in the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.",
