      "skos:note": "Only SES employees or Executive Level positions can be appointed as infringement notice officers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-572l-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "572L(4) Appointment of authorised infringement notice officer",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 512,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The ACCC must not appoint a person under subsection (3) unless\nthe person:\n\n(a) is an SES employee or acting SES employee; or\n\n(b) holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 1 or 2 position or an\nequivalent position.\nNote:\nSES employee is defined in the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572l-ss-4-norm",
