      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.526",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577A is\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more\nspecified events within a specified period; and\n\n(b) such an event occurs within that period;\nTelstra must notify the ACCC in writing of the occurrence of the\nevent as soon as practicable after the occurrence.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If:\n\n(a) a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577A is\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more\nspecified events within a specified period; and\n\n(b) such an event occurs within that period;\nTelstra must notify the ACCC in writing of the occurrence of the\nevent as soon as practicable after the occurrence.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577aa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577aa-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577aa-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "069af24f632ff167597447fa097301fd6cd6fb9c1433b9065ed065aea948a4f1",
      "skos:note": "Notify ACCC of event occurrence within specified period after decision to accept undertaking is subject to occurrence of events.",
      "dc:description": "Notification in writing"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577aa-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "577AA(6) Acceptance of undertaking about structural separation may",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 526,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577A is\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more\nspecified events within a specified period; and\n\n(b) such an event occurs within that period;\nTelstra must notify the ACCC in writing of the occurrence of the\nevent as soon as practicable after the occurrence."
    },
