    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577BB Migration plan principles",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577bb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.546",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by writing, determine that specified principles\nare migration plan principles for the purposes of this Act.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nConsultation\n\n(2) Before making or varying a determination under subsection (1), the\nMinister must:\n\n(a) cause to be published on the Department’s website a notice:\n\n(i) setting out the draft determination or variation; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the Minister\nabout the draft determination or variation within 14 days\nafter the notice is published; and\n\n(b) consider any submissions received within the 14-day period\nmentioned in paragraph (a).\nPublication requirement\n\n(3) The Minister must cause a copy of a determination under\nsubsection (1) to be published on the Department’s website.\n\n\nVoluntary undertakings originally given by Telstra  Part 33\nStructural separation  Division 2\n\nSection 577BC\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nDetermination is not a legislative instrument\n\n(4) A determination under subsection (1) is not a legislative\ninstrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by writing, determine that specified principles\nare migration plan principles for the purposes of this Act.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nConsultation\n\n(2) Before making or varying a determination under subsection (1), the\nMinister must:\n\n(a) cause to be published on the Department’s website a notice:\n\n(i) setting out the draft determination or variation; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the Minister\nabout the draft determination or variation within 14 days\nafter the notice is published; and\n\n(b) consider any submissions received within the 14-day period\nmentioned in paragraph (a).\nPublication requirement\n\n(3) The Minister must cause a copy of a determination under\nsubsection (1) to be published on the Department’s website.\n\n\nVoluntary undertakings originally given by Telstra  Part 33\nStructural separation  Division 2\n\nSection 577BC\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nDetermination is not a legislative instrument\n\n(4) A determination under subsection (1) is not a legislative\ninstrument.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
