    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bd-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577BD(2) Approval of draft migration plan by the ACCC—plan given",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577bd-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.549",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The ACCC must:\n\n(a) if the ACCC is satisfied that the original plan complies with\nthe migration plan principles—approve the original plan; or\n\n(b) otherwise:\n\n(i) refuse to approve the original plan; and\n\n(ii) by written notice given to Telstra, direct Telstra to give\nthe ACCC, within 30 days after the notice is given, a\nreplacement draft migration plan that complies with the\nmigration plan principles.\nNote:\nFor migration plan principles, see section 577BB.\nConsultation",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The ACCC must:\n\n(a) if the ACCC is satisfied that the original plan complies with\nthe migration plan principles—approve the original plan; or\n\n(b) otherwise:\n\n(i) refuse to approve the original plan; and\n\n(ii) by written notice given to Telstra, direct Telstra to give\nthe ACCC, within 30 days after the notice is given, a\nreplacement draft migration plan that complies with the\nmigration plan principles.\nNote:\nFor migration plan principles, see section 577BB.\nConsultation",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bd-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bd-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "645a579f8933b104d4ee0c5e62b6e534f209c7ce7c25eee0d0ca632d65457bca",
      "skos:note": "The ACCC must approve the original plan if it complies with migration plan principles."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577bd-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "577BD(2) Approval of draft migration plan by the ACCC—plan given",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 549,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The ACCC must:\n\n(a) if the ACCC is satisfied that the original plan complies with\nthe migration plan principles—approve the original plan; or\n\n(b) otherwise:\n\n(i) refuse to approve the original plan; and\n\n(ii) by written notice given to Telstra, direct Telstra to give\nthe ACCC, within 30 days after the notice is given, a\nreplacement draft migration plan that complies with the\nmigration plan principles.\nNote:\nFor migration plan principles, see section 577BB.\nConsultation"
    },
