    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577BD(3) Approval of draft migration plan by the ACCC—plan given",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577bd-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.549",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Before making a decision under subsection (2), the ACCC must:\n\n(a) cause to be published on the ACCC’s website a notice:\n\n(i) setting out the original plan; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC\nabout the original plan within 28 days after the notice is\npublished; and",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Before making a decision under subsection (2), the ACCC must:\n\n(a) cause to be published on the ACCC’s website a notice:\n\n(i) setting out the original plan; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC\nabout the original plan within 28 days after the notice is\npublished; and",
