    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577be",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577BE Effect of approval of draft migration plan",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577be"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.555",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the ACCC approves a draft migration plan, the plan becomes a\nfinal migration plan.\nNote:\nA final migration plan came into force on 7 March 2012.\n\n(2) If the ACCC approves a draft migration plan under\nsubsection 577BD(2), the plan comes into force at the start of the\nday after notice of the decision to approve the plan is given to\nTelstra in accordance with subsection 577BD(6).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the ACCC approves a draft migration plan, the plan becomes a\nfinal migration plan.\nNote:\nA final migration plan came into force on 7 March 2012.\n\n(2) If the ACCC approves a draft migration plan under\nsubsection 577BD(2), the plan comes into force at the start of the\nday after notice of the decision to approve the plan is given to\nTelstra in accordance with subsection 577BD(6).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577be-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577be-ss-2"
