    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bf",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577BF Variation of final migration plan",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577bf"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.559",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a final migration plan is in force.\n\n(2) If the final migration plan imposes obligations or prohibitions on a\ndesignated Telstra successor company, the designated Telstra\nsuccessor company may give the ACCC a variation of the final\nmigration plan.\n\n(3) The ACCC must:\n\n(a) if the ACCC is satisfied that the final migration plan as\nvaried complies with the migration plan principles—approve\nthe variation; or",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if a final migration plan is in force.\n\n(2) If the final migration plan imposes obligations or prohibitions on a\ndesignated Telstra successor company, the designated Telstra\nsuccessor company may give the ACCC a variation of the final\nmigration plan.\n\n(3) The ACCC must:\n\n(a) if the ACCC is satisfied that the final migration plan as\nvaried complies with the migration plan principles—approve\nthe variation; or",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bf-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bf-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577bf-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "742b9a7adfbea1279ee244547581a2740372f36218b573821201db16155bef43"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577bf",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "577BF Variation of final migration plan",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 559,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a final migration plan is in force.\n\n(2) If the final migration plan imposes obligations or prohibitions on a\ndesignated Telstra successor company, the designated Telstra\nsuccessor company may give the ACCC a variation of the final\nmigration plan.\n\n(3) The ACCC must:\n\n(a) if the ACCC is satisfied that the final migration plan as\nvaried complies with the migration plan principles—approve\nthe variation; or"
    },
