    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577cc",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577CC Publication requirements for undertaking about hybrid",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577cc"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.565",
      "values:originalText": "fibre-coaxial networks\n\n(1) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577C is\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must:\n\n(a) as soon as practicable after making the decision, publish on\nits website:\n\n(i) the undertaking; and\n\n(ii) the terms of the decision; and\n\n(b) as soon as practicable after the ACCC becomes aware that\nthe undertaking has come into force, publish on its website a\nnotice announcing that the undertaking has come into force.\n\n(2) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577C is not\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must, as soon as\npracticable after accepting the undertaking, publish the undertaking\non its website.",
      "skos:definition": "fibre-coaxial networks\n\n(1) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577C is\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must:\n\n(a) as soon as practicable after making the decision, publish on\nits website:\n\n(i) the undertaking; and\n\n(ii) the terms of the decision; and\n\n(b) as soon as practicable after the ACCC becomes aware that\nthe undertaking has come into force, publish on its website a\nnotice announcing that the undertaking has come into force.\n\n(2) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577C is not\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must, as soon as\npracticable after accepting the undertaking, publish the undertaking\non its website.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577cc-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577cc-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2ec5d401e7ba4487b87fadd4e67573003573d57c5ad425e1945ff30fbd9a1a00"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577cc",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "577CC Publication requirements for undertaking about hybrid",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 565,
      "values:originalText": "fibre-coaxial networks\n\n(1) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577C is\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must:\n\n(a) as soon as practicable after making the decision, publish on\nits website:\n\n(i) the undertaking; and\n\n(ii) the terms of the decision; and\n\n(b) as soon as practicable after the ACCC becomes aware that\nthe undertaking has come into force, publish on its website a\nnotice announcing that the undertaking has come into force.\n\n(2) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577C is not\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must, as soon as\npracticable after accepting the undertaking, publish the undertaking\non its website."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577cc-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577CC(1) Publication requirements for undertaking about hybrid",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577cc-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
