      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.568",
      "values:originalText": "(1B) The Minister may, by writing, set out matters for the purposes of\nparagraph (1A)(a).",
      "skos:definition": "(1B) The Minister may, by writing, set out matters for the purposes of\nparagraph (1A)(a).",
      "values:partOf": {
