      "skos:definition": "(2) The period specified in the undertaking as mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) must not be longer than 12 months.\n\n\nVoluntary undertakings originally given by Telstra  Part 33\nSubscription television broadcasting licences  Division 4\n\nSection 577EA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
