      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.568",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the undertaking provides for the ACCC to perform functions or\nexercise powers in relation to the undertaking, the ACCC may\nperform those functions, and exercise those powers, in accordance\nwith the undertaking.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the undertaking provides for the ACCC to perform functions or\nexercise powers in relation to the undertaking, the ACCC may\nperform those functions, and exercise those powers, in accordance\nwith the undertaking.",
