    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ea",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577EA Acceptance of undertaking about subscription television",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577ea"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.569",
      "values:originalText": "broadcasting licences may be subject to the occurrence of\nevents\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) Telstra has, in a document accompanying an undertaking\nunder section 577E, nominated one or more events; and\n\n(b) the nomination is expressed to be a nomination under this\nsubsection; and\n\n(c) each of those events is:\n\n(i) the passage of a resolution covered by\nsubparagraph 411(4)(a)(ii) of the Corporations Act\n2001; or\n\n(ii) an approval covered by paragraph 411(4)(b) of that Act;\nor",
      "skos:definition": "broadcasting licences may be subject to the occurrence of\nevents\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) Telstra has, in a document accompanying an undertaking\nunder section 577E, nominated one or more events; and\n\n(b) the nomination is expressed to be a nomination under this\nsubsection; and\n\n(c) each of those events is:\n\n(i) the passage of a resolution covered by\nsubparagraph 411(4)(a)(ii) of the Corporations Act\n2001; or\n\n(ii) an approval covered by paragraph 411(4)(b) of that Act;\nor",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ea-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ea-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a3b8bfd7a66450230343ceebda8120e6d5e39a56d3d4538c1b5bd80a9b0f98a5",
      "skos:note": "Broadcasting licences may be subject to the occurrence of events nominated by Telstra."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577ea",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "577EA Acceptance of undertaking about subscription television",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 569,
      "values:originalText": "broadcasting licences may be subject to the occurrence of\nevents\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) Telstra has, in a document accompanying an undertaking\nunder section 577E, nominated one or more events; and\n\n(b) the nomination is expressed to be a nomination under this\nsubsection; and\n\n(c) each of those events is:\n\n(i) the passage of a resolution covered by\nsubparagraph 411(4)(a)(ii) of the Corporations Act\n2001; or\n\n(ii) an approval covered by paragraph 411(4)(b) of that Act;\nor"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ea-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ea"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ea-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "if",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Telstra has nominated events",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Licence is subject to occurrence of events"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ec",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577EC Publication requirements for undertaking about",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577ec"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.572",
      "values:originalText": "subscription television broadcasting licences\n\n(1) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577E is\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must:\n\n(a) as soon as practicable after making the decision, publish on\nits website:\n\n(i) the undertaking; and\n\n(ii) the terms of the decision; and\n\n(b) as soon as practicable after the ACCC becomes aware that\nthe undertaking has come into force, publish on its website a\nnotice announcing that the undertaking has come into force.\n\n(2) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577E is not\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must, as soon as\n\n\nVoluntary undertakings originally given by Telstra  Part 33\nSubscription television broadcasting licences  Division 4\n\nSection 577ED\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\npracticable after accepting the undertaking, publish the undertaking\non its website.",
      "skos:definition": "subscription television broadcasting licences\n\n(1) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577E is\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must:\n\n(a) as soon as practicable after making the decision, publish on\nits website:\n\n(i) the undertaking; and\n\n(ii) the terms of the decision; and\n\n(b) as soon as practicable after the ACCC becomes aware that\nthe undertaking has come into force, publish on its website a\nnotice announcing that the undertaking has come into force.\n\n(2) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577E is not\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must, as soon as\n\n\nVoluntary undertakings originally given by Telstra  Part 33\nSubscription television broadcasting licences  Division 4\n\nSection 577ED\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\npracticable after accepting the undertaking, publish the undertaking\non its website.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ec-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ec-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6c7507dd2658e68c39294f6478aeaff4a960367ddd683f3ae63eaea086984681"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577ec",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "577EC Publication requirements for undertaking about",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 572,
      "values:originalText": "subscription television broadcasting licences\n\n(1) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577E is\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must:\n\n(a) as soon as practicable after making the decision, publish on\nits website:\n\n(i) the undertaking; and\n\n(ii) the terms of the decision; and\n\n(b) as soon as practicable after the ACCC becomes aware that\nthe undertaking has come into force, publish on its website a\nnotice announcing that the undertaking has come into force.\n\n(2) If a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577E is not\nexpressed to be subject to the occurrence of one or more specified\nevents within a specified period, the ACCC must, as soon as\n\n\nVoluntary undertakings originally given by Telstra  Part 33\nSubscription television broadcasting licences  Division 4\n\nSection 577ED\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\npracticable after accepting the undertaking, publish the undertaking\non its website."
    },
