    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577k",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "577K Limits on use of certain spectrum licences by Telstra",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577k"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.581",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) the excluded spectrum regime applies to Telstra; and\n\n(b) a spectrum licence relates to a designated part of the\nspectrum;\nthe licensee of the spectrum licence must not authorise Telstra to\noperate radiocommunications devices under the licence.\nNote:\nFor excluded spectrum regime, see section 577GA.\n\n(2) However, the rule in subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) both:\n\n(i) an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under\nsection 577A; and\n\n(ii) the undertaking is covered by subsection (2A); and\n\n(b) either:",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) the excluded spectrum regime applies to Telstra; and\n\n(b) a spectrum licence relates to a designated part of the\nspectrum;\nthe licensee of the spectrum licence must not authorise Telstra to\noperate radiocommunications devices under the licence.\nNote:\nFor excluded spectrum regime, see section 577GA.\n\n(2) However, the rule in subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) both:\n\n(i) an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under\nsection 577A; and\n\n(ii) the undertaking is covered by subsection (2A); and\n\n(b) either:",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577k-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577k-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6a6799a6a16a5f1425399da8ec0b3178cebf05ef5b8e9d6fc3cf48c9bf37a710"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-577k",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "577K Limits on use of certain spectrum licences by Telstra",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 581,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) the excluded spectrum regime applies to Telstra; and\n\n(b) a spectrum licence relates to a designated part of the\nspectrum;\nthe licensee of the spectrum licence must not authorise Telstra to\noperate radiocommunications devices under the licence.\nNote:\nFor excluded spectrum regime, see section 577GA.\n\n(2) However, the rule in subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) both:\n\n(i) an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under\nsection 577A; and\n\n(ii) the undertaking is covered by subsection (2A); and\n\n(b) either:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577k-ss-1",
