      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "regard",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to regard international obligations",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-580",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "580 ACMA must have regard to conventions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-580"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.591",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In performing its telecommunications functions and exercising its\ntelecommunications powers, the ACMA must have regard to\nAustralia’s obligations under any convention of which the Minister\nhas notified the ACMA in writing.\n\n(2) In this section:\nconvention means:\n\n(a) a convention to which Australia is a party; or\n\n(b) an agreement or arrangement between Australia and a foreign\ncountry;",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In performing its telecommunications functions and exercising its\ntelecommunications powers, the ACMA must have regard to\nAustralia’s obligations under any convention of which the Minister\nhas notified the ACMA in writing.\n\n(2) In this section:\nconvention means:\n\n(a) a convention to which Australia is a party; or\n\n(b) an agreement or arrangement between Australia and a foreign\ncountry;",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-580-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-580-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6fc63ffc750a85a67febf725dae21d1cd8489a2727099691afe450aeed65ca9a"
    },
