    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581l",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581L Telecommunications business",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581l"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.604",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, telecommunications business means:\n\n(a) a business that consists of or includes the supply of a listed\ncarriage service; or\n\n(b) a business that consists of or includes the supply of a service\nthat facilitates the supply of a listed carriage service; or\n\n(c) a business that consists of or includes installing, maintaining,\noperating or providing access to:\n\n(i) a telecommunications network; or\n\n(ii) a facility;\n\nused to supply a listed carriage service; or\n\n(d) a business that is covered by a declaration under\nsubsection (2);\nbut does not include a business that is covered by a declaration\nunder subsection (3).\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified business is a telecommunications business for the\npurposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified business is not a telecommunications business for the\npurposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, telecommunications business means:\n\n(a) a business that consists of or includes the supply of a listed\ncarriage service; or\n\n(b) a business that consists of or includes the supply of a service\nthat facilitates the supply of a listed carriage service; or\n\n(c) a business that consists of or includes installing, maintaining,\noperating or providing access to:\n\n(i) a telecommunications network; or\n\n(ii) a facility;\n\nused to supply a listed carriage service; or\n\n(d) a business that is covered by a declaration under\nsubsection (2);\nbut does not include a business that is covered by a declaration\nunder subsection (3).\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified business is a telecommunications business for the\npurposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified business is not a telecommunications business for the\npurposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581l-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581l-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581l-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e6d4a9f20c63710510879346007bf3335f94f1c9b89e9a439970474d2a75683d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581l",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "581L Telecommunications business",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 604,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, telecommunications business means:\n\n(a) a business that consists of or includes the supply of a listed\ncarriage service; or\n\n(b) a business that consists of or includes the supply of a service\nthat facilitates the supply of a listed carriage service; or\n\n(c) a business that consists of or includes installing, maintaining,\noperating or providing access to:\n\n(i) a telecommunications network; or\n\n(ii) a facility;\n\nused to supply a listed carriage service; or\n\n(d) a business that is covered by a declaration under\nsubsection (2);\nbut does not include a business that is covered by a declaration\nunder subsection (3).\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified business is a telecommunications business for the\npurposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified business is not a telecommunications business for the\npurposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003."
    },
