    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581n",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581N Telecommunications asset",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581n"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.607",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, telecommunications asset means:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network used, or to be used, to supply\na listed carriage service; or\n\n(b) a facility used, or to be used, to supply a listed carriage\nservice; or\n\n(c) an asset covered by a declaration under subsection (2);\nbut does not include an asset that is covered by a declaration under\nsubsection (3).\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified asset is a telecommunications asset for the purposes of\nthis Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified asset is not a telecommunications asset for the purposes\nof this Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, telecommunications asset means:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network used, or to be used, to supply\na listed carriage service; or\n\n(b) a facility used, or to be used, to supply a listed carriage\nservice; or\n\n(c) an asset covered by a declaration under subsection (2);\nbut does not include an asset that is covered by a declaration under\nsubsection (3).\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified asset is a telecommunications asset for the purposes of\nthis Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified asset is not a telecommunications asset for the purposes\nof this Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581n-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581n-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581n-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2f5365f17562cd77a516a2356150920ad15627a4304e5a638c43abe7605522f7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581n",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "581N Telecommunications asset",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 607,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, telecommunications asset means:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network used, or to be used, to supply\na listed carriage service; or\n\n(b) a facility used, or to be used, to supply a listed carriage\nservice; or\n\n(c) an asset covered by a declaration under subsection (2);\nbut does not include an asset that is covered by a declaration under\nsubsection (3).\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified asset is a telecommunications asset for the purposes of\nthis Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a\nspecified asset is not a telecommunications asset for the purposes\nof this Part.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003."
    },
