      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581PA(6) Notification of proposed transfer of prescribed asset",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581pa-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.608",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Minister must not specify a class of assets under subsection (5)\nunless each asset in the class is, or was, used by a Telstra successor\ncompany or a designated Telstra successor company:\n\n(a) in connection with the fulfillment of any of the obligations\nimposed on the company by or under a telecommunications\nlaw; or\n\n(b) in order to maintain the company’s capability (including the\ntechnical, operational or organisational capability) to comply\nwith obligations imposed on the company by or under a\ntelecommunications law.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Minister must not specify a class of assets under subsection (5)\nunless each asset in the class is, or was, used by a Telstra successor\ncompany or a designated Telstra successor company:\n\n(a) in connection with the fulfillment of any of the obligations\nimposed on the company by or under a telecommunications\nlaw; or\n\n(b) in order to maintain the company’s capability (including the\ntechnical, operational or organisational capability) to comply\nwith obligations imposed on the company by or under a\ntelecommunications law.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa-ss-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa-ss-6-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa-ss-6-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa-ss-6-logic-deontic-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa-ss-6-logic-argumentation-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c2d3444e90d7f0a0cab0245d006c14d7aa47d74349f44af51f0d91473d93fb5c",
      "skos:note": "The Minister must not specify a class of assets without ensuring they were used by a Telstra successor company in connection with telecommunications law obligations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581pa-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "581PA(6) Notification of proposed transfer of prescribed asset",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 608,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Minister must not specify a class of assets under subsection (5)\nunless each asset in the class is, or was, used by a Telstra successor\ncompany or a designated Telstra successor company:\n\n(a) in connection with the fulfillment of any of the obligations\nimposed on the company by or under a telecommunications\nlaw; or\n\n(b) in order to maintain the company’s capability (including the\ntechnical, operational or organisational capability) to comply\nwith obligations imposed on the company by or under a\ntelecommunications law."
    },
