    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581ta-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581TA(6) Facilitation of compliance with a direction given by the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581ta-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.612",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Before giving or varying a direction under subsection (1), the\nACMA must:\n\n(a) make a copy of the draft direction or variation available on\nthe ACMA’s website; and\n\n(b) publish a notice on the ACMA’s website:\n\n(i) stating that the ACMA has prepared the draft; and\n\n(ii) inviting interested persons to give written comments\nabout the draft to the ACMA within the period specified\nin the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Before giving or varying a direction under subsection (1), the\nACMA must:\n\n(a) make a copy of the draft direction or variation available on\nthe ACMA’s website; and\n\n(b) publish a notice on the ACMA’s website:\n\n(i) stating that the ACMA has prepared the draft; and\n\n(ii) inviting interested persons to give written comments\nabout the draft to the ACMA within the period specified\nin the notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581ta"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581ta-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581ta-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "21563c7d7bd84841346f0d8190f43868e482080c61de8ea8582b3f1c08255629",
      "skos:note": "Publish notice on website and make draft direction available for comments."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581ta-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "581TA(6) Facilitation of compliance with a direction given by the",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 612,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Before giving or varying a direction under subsection (1), the\nACMA must:\n\n(a) make a copy of the draft direction or variation available on\nthe ACMA’s website; and\n\n(b) publish a notice on the ACMA’s website:\n\n(i) stating that the ACMA has prepared the draft; and\n\n(ii) inviting interested persons to give written comments\nabout the draft to the ACMA within the period specified\nin the notice."
    },
