    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581tb-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581TB(5) Facilitation of obligations imposed on a named designated",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581tb-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.614",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Before giving or varying a direction under subsection (1), the\nMinister must:\n\n(a) make a copy of the draft direction or variation available on\nthe Minister’s website; and\n\n(b) publish a notice on the Minister’s website:\n\n(i) stating that the Minister has prepared the draft; and\n\n(ii) inviting interested persons to give written comments\nabout the draft to the Minister within the period\nspecified in the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Before giving or varying a direction under subsection (1), the\nMinister must:\n\n(a) make a copy of the draft direction or variation available on\nthe Minister’s website; and\n\n(b) publish a notice on the Minister’s website:\n\n(i) stating that the Minister has prepared the draft; and\n\n(ii) inviting interested persons to give written comments\nabout the draft to the Minister within the period\nspecified in the notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581tb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581tb-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581tb-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2c252d4636814f84adad7bb92c20293361e8ede9e87cf28a87ff03783d3b1106",
      "skos:note": "Minister must make draft direction or variation available and publish notice on website before giving or varying direction.",
      "dc:description": "written comments from interested persons"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581tb-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "581TB(5) Facilitation of obligations imposed on a named designated",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 614,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Before giving or varying a direction under subsection (1), the\nMinister must:\n\n(a) make a copy of the draft direction or variation available on\nthe Minister’s website; and\n\n(b) publish a notice on the Minister’s website:\n\n(i) stating that the Minister has prepared the draft; and\n\n(ii) inviting interested persons to give written comments\nabout the draft to the Minister within the period\nspecified in the notice."
    },
    {
