      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Eligible company is not a carrier",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Eligible company is not a carrier company group"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581xa",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581XA Deemed bodies corporate",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581xa"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.618",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:\n\n(a) a specified person is an individual or a partnership; and\n\n(b) the person owns or operates:\n\n(i) a facility; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the\nmeaning of Division 3);\nthis Part has effect as if the person were a body corporate that is\nrelated to one or more specified bodies corporate.\n\n\nAccess to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part\n34B\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nSection 581XA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:\n\n(a) a person is the trustee of a specified trust; and\n\n(b) the person (in the capacity of trustee of the trust) owns or\noperates:\n\n(i) a facility; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the\nmeaning of Division 3);\nthis Part has effect as if the person (in the capacity of trustee of the\ntrust) were a body corporate that is related to one or more specified\nbodies corporate.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:\n\n(a) 2 or more persons are the trustees of a specified trust; and\n\n(b) the persons (in their capacity of trustees of the trust) own or\noperate:\n\n(i) a facility; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the\nmeaning of Division 3);\nthis Part has effect as if the persons (in their capacity of trustees of\nthe trust) were a body corporate that is related to one or more\nspecified bodies corporate.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:\n\n(a) a specified person is an individual or a partnership; and\n\n(b) the person owns or operates:\n\n(i) a facility; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the\nmeaning of Division 3);\nthis Part has effect as if the person were a body corporate that is\nrelated to one or more specified bodies corporate.\n\n\nAccess to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part\n34B\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nSection 581XA\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:\n\n(a) a person is the trustee of a specified trust; and\n\n(b) the person (in the capacity of trustee of the trust) owns or\noperates:\n\n(i) a facility; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the\nmeaning of Division 3);\nthis Part has effect as if the person (in the capacity of trustee of the\ntrust) were a body corporate that is related to one or more specified\nbodies corporate.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:\n\n(a) 2 or more persons are the trustees of a specified trust; and\n\n(b) the persons (in their capacity of trustees of the trust) own or\noperate:\n\n(i) a facility; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the\nmeaning of Division 3);\nthis Part has effect as if the persons (in their capacity of trustees of\nthe trust) were a body corporate that is related to one or more\nspecified bodies corporate.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
