    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581Y(6) Access to supplementary facilities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581y-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.620",
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of this section, in determining whether the\ncarrier’s request is reasonable, regard must be had to the question\nwhether compliance with the request will promote the long-term\ninterests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by\nmeans of carriage services. That question is to be determined in the\nsame manner as it is determined for the purposes of Part XIC of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) For the purposes of this section, in determining whether the\ncarrier’s request is reasonable, regard must be had to the question\nwhether compliance with the request will promote the long-term\ninterests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by\nmeans of carriage services. That question is to be determined in the\nsame manner as it is determined for the purposes of Part XIC of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y-ss-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y-ss-6-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y-ss-6-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y-ss-6-logic-cogai-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y-ss-6-logic-shacl-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "abe87c5f5532f91e6ad29a3bcf16c33d0fd81aae4257d7abfcb70176ac1e63e9",
      "skos:note": "Determine reasonableness of carrier's request based on long-term interests of end-users or services supplied by means of carriage services."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581y-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "581Y(6) Access to supplementary facilities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 620,
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of this section, in determining whether the\ncarrier’s request is reasonable, regard must be had to the question\nwhether compliance with the request will promote the long-term\ninterests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by\nmeans of carriage services. That question is to be determined in the\nsame manner as it is determined for the purposes of Part XIC of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010."
    },
