    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581z-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581Z(6) Terms and conditions of access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581z-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.622",
      "values:originalText": "(6) An arbitrator must not make a determination under this section if\nthe determination would have the effect of:\n\n(a) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from\ncomplying with an undertaking in force under section 577A;\nor\n\n(b) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in\nforce under section 577C or 577E; or\n\n(c) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring a designated\nTelstra successor company to engage in conduct in\nconnection with matters covered by the final migration plan.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) An arbitrator must not make a determination under this section if\nthe determination would have the effect of:\n\n(a) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from\ncomplying with an undertaking in force under section 577A;\nor\n\n(b) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in\nforce under section 577C or 577E; or\n\n(c) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring a designated\nTelstra successor company to engage in conduct in\nconnection with matters covered by the final migration plan.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581z"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581z-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581z-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581z-ss-6-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dcccc3c61f879866926428e52856db1a942266678b2bb77bb6038300c7789bdf",
      "skos:note": "Prevent arbitrators from making determinations that harm Telstra successors or final migration plans."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581z-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "581Z(6) Terms and conditions of access",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 622,
      "values:originalText": "(6) An arbitrator must not make a determination under this section if\nthe determination would have the effect of:\n\n(a) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from\ncomplying with an undertaking in force under section 577A;\nor\n\n(b) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in\nforce under section 577C or 577E; or\n\n(c) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring a designated\nTelstra successor company to engage in conduct in\nconnection with matters covered by the final migration plan."
    },
