      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.626",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Division, giving access to a tower includes\nreplacing the tower with another tower located on the same site and\ngiving access to the replacement tower.",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Division, giving access to a tower includes\nreplacing the tower with another tower located on the same site and\ngiving access to the replacement tower.",
