    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581zd-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581ZD(8) Access to telecommunications transmission towers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581zd-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.626",
      "values:originalText": "(8) Subsection (1) does not impose an obligation to the extent (if any)\nto which the imposition of the obligation would have any of the\nfollowing effects:\n\n(a) depriving any person of a right under a contract that was in\nforce at the time the request was made;\n\n(b) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from\ncomplying with an undertaking in force under section 577A;\n\n(c) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in\nforce under section 577C or 577E;\n\n(d) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring a designated\nTelstra successor company to engage in conduct in\nconnection with matters covered by the final migration plan.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) Subsection (1) does not impose an obligation to the extent (if any)\nto which the imposition of the obligation would have any of the\nfollowing effects:\n\n(a) depriving any person of a right under a contract that was in\nforce at the time the request was made;\n\n(b) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from\ncomplying with an undertaking in force under section 577A;\n\n(c) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in\nforce under section 577C or 577E;\n\n(d) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring a designated\nTelstra successor company to engage in conduct in\nconnection with matters covered by the final migration plan.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581zd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581zd-ss-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ff096a26bcd735c0bd9adab70d0efdce424d761b84d554fd47cd22da2dae4519",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from obligation under subsection (1)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581zd-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "581ZD(8) Access to telecommunications transmission towers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 626,
      "values:originalText": "(8) Subsection (1) does not impose an obligation to the extent (if any)\nto which the imposition of the obligation would have any of the\nfollowing effects:\n\n(a) depriving any person of a right under a contract that was in\nforce at the time the request was made;\n\n(b) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from\ncomplying with an undertaking in force under section 577A;\n\n(c) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in\nforce under section 577C or 577E;\n\n(d) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring a designated\nTelstra successor company to engage in conduct in\nconnection with matters covered by the final migration plan."
    },
    {
