    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581ze-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "581ZE(1) Terms and conditions of access",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 628,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An eligible company must comply with subsection 581ZD(1) on\nsuch terms and conditions as are:\n\n\nAccess to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part\n34B\nAccess to telecommunications transmission towers  Division 3\n\nSection 581ZE\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) agreed between the following parties:\n\n(i) the eligible company;\n\n(ii) the carrier concerned; or\n\n(b) failing agreement, determined by an arbitrator appointed by\nthe parties.\nIf the parties fail to agree on the appointment of an arbitrator, the\nACCC is to be the arbitrator."
