      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Agreement is in force",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Determination does not apply if agreement exists"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581zf",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "581ZF Code relating to access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-581zf"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.630",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACCC may, by legislative instrument, make a Code setting out\nconditions that are to be complied with in relation to the provision\nof access under this Division.\n\n(2) An eligible company must comply with the Code.\n\n(3) This section does not, by implication, limit a power conferred by or\nunder this Act to make an instrument.\n\n(4) This section does not, by implication, limit the matters that may be\ndealt with by codes or standards referred to in Part 6.\n\n(5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not, by implication, limit\nsubsection 33(3B) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n581ZG  This Division does not limit Division 2\n\nThis Division does not, by implication, limit Division 2.\n\n\nAccess to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part\n34B\nReview of corporate control percentage  Division 4\n\nSection 581ZH\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The ACCC may, by legislative instrument, make a Code setting out\nconditions that are to be complied with in relation to the provision\nof access under this Division.\n\n(2) An eligible company must comply with the Code.\n\n(3) This section does not, by implication, limit a power conferred by or\nunder this Act to make an instrument.\n\n(4) This section does not, by implication, limit the matters that may be\ndealt with by codes or standards referred to in Part 6.\n\n(5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not, by implication, limit\nsubsection 33(3B) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n581ZG  This Division does not limit Division 2\n\nThis Division does not, by implication, limit Division 2.\n\n\nAccess to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part\n34B\nReview of corporate control percentage  Division 4\n\nSection 581ZH\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
