      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.630",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not, by implication, limit\nsubsection 33(3B) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n581ZG  This Division does not limit Division 2\n\nThis Division does not, by implication, limit Division 2.\n\n\nAccess to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part\n34B\nReview of corporate control percentage  Division 4\n\nSection 581ZH\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not, by implication, limit\nsubsection 33(3B) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\n581ZG  This Division does not limit Division 2\n\nThis Division does not, by implication, limit Division 2.\n\n\nAccess to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part\n34B\nReview of corporate control percentage  Division 4\n\nSection 581ZH\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
