    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-583",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "583 Penalties for certain continuing offences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-583"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.633",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if an offence against this Act is a continuing\noffence (whether under this Act or because of section 4K of the\nCrimes Act 1914).\n\n(2) The maximum penalty for each day that the offence continues is\n10% of the maximum penalty that could be imposed in respect of\nthe principal offence.\n\n(3) In this section:",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if an offence against this Act is a continuing\noffence (whether under this Act or because of section 4K of the\nCrimes Act 1914).\n\n(2) The maximum penalty for each day that the offence continues is\n10% of the maximum penalty that could be imposed in respect of\nthe principal offence.\n\n(3) In this section:",
