    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-586",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "586 Giving of documents to partnerships",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-586"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.635",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, if a document is given to a partner of\na partnership in accordance with section 28A of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901, the document is taken to have been given\nto the partnership.\n\n(2) In this section:\nthis Act includes:\n\n(a) the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999 and regulations under that Act; and\n\n(b) the Spam Act 2003 and regulations under that Act; and\n\n(c) the Do Not Call Register Act 2006 and regulations under that\nAct.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, if a document is given to a partner of\na partnership in accordance with section 28A of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901, the document is taken to have been given\nto the partnership.\n\n(2) In this section:\nthis Act includes:\n\n(a) the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999 and regulations under that Act; and\n\n(b) the Spam Act 2003 and regulations under that Act; and\n\n(c) the Do Not Call Register Act 2006 and regulations under that\nAct.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-586-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-586-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1e61970fa9e91ba80bc0f2aa18b885c2afb82e363015d7c7a235c9da33529e3f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-586",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "586 Giving of documents to partnerships",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 635,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, if a document is given to a partner of\na partnership in accordance with section 28A of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901, the document is taken to have been given\nto the partnership.\n\n(2) In this section:\nthis Act includes:\n\n(a) the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999 and regulations under that Act; and\n\n(b) the Spam Act 2003 and regulations under that Act; and\n\n(c) the Do Not Call Register Act 2006 and regulations under that\nAct."
    },
