      "cof:title": "586(1) Giving of documents to partnerships",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 635,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, if a document is given to a partner of\na partnership in accordance with section 28A of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901, the document is taken to have been given\nto the partnership."
    },
