    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-587",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "587 Nomination of address for service of documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-587"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.635",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person may nominate an address for\nservice in:\n\n(a) an application made by the person under this Act; or\n\n(b) any other document given by the person to the ACCC or the\nACMA.\nThe address must be in Australia.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person may nominate an address for\nservice in:\n\n(a) an application made by the person under this Act; or\n\n(b) any other document given by the person to the ACCC or the\nACMA.\nThe address must be in Australia.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-587-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-587-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "18265cb8444bebfa765a88e63127d2451e4f565f70b189d6a973522ff32abd3f",
      "skos:note": "A person may nominate an address for service of documents."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-587",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "587 Nomination of address for service of documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 635,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person may nominate an address for\nservice in:\n\n(a) an application made by the person under this Act; or\n\n(b) any other document given by the person to the ACCC or the\nACMA.\nThe address must be in Australia."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-587-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
