    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-588-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "588(4) Service of summons or process on foreign corporations—",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-588-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.636",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section:\n\n\nMiscellaneous  Part 35\n\nSection 589\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\ncriminal proceeding includes a proceeding to determine whether a\nperson should be tried for an offence.\nthis Act includes the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection\nand Service Standards) Act 1999 and regulations under that Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In this section:\n\n\nMiscellaneous  Part 35\n\nSection 589\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\ncriminal proceeding includes a proceeding to determine whether a\nperson should be tried for an offence.\nthis Act includes the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection\nand Service Standards) Act 1999 and regulations under that Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-588"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-588-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a33f13e2d8e195c93cc1c92bd954e4a055f69f760dc45a160715c7737555cce4",
      "skos:note": "Defines criminal proceeding and includes related Acts."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-588-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "588(4) Service of summons or process on foreign corporations—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 636,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section:\n\n\nMiscellaneous  Part 35\n\nSection 589\n\nTelecommunications Act 1997\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\ncriminal proceeding includes a proceeding to determine whether a\nperson should be tried for an offence.\nthis Act includes the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection\nand Service Standards) Act 1999 and regulations under that Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-588-ss-4-norm",
