      "skos:note": "Defines consumer body and telecommunications terms."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-593-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "593(8) Funding of consumer representation, and of research, in",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 640,
      "values:originalText": "(8) In this section:\nconsumer body means a body or association that represents the\ninterests of consumers.\ntelecommunications means the carriage of communications by\nmeans of guided and/or unguided electromagnetic energy."
